


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a533d4e9:


    "波琳娜甩了甩琴盒，狠狠打了我一下，把我给打清醒了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_9eb8c3d8:


    Rom "我……他，他不是……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e54581ea:


    Pol "你当我三岁小孩吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4d790f45:


    Pol "这是谁？拜沙？还是……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e212ff99:


    "她死死盯着我，好像能透过面具看到我的脸一样。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d0ec6310:


    "即便周围光线昏暗，我也能看到她气得脸都红了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dae9941c:


    Pol "安东？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2c2ab88d:


    Pol "我真没想到你是这种人。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ac8cd650:


    "我咕哝着，想找个借口搪塞过去，心里又暗暗希望罗姆卡会先开口跟她解释。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_9d26f6d9:


    "可那位失败的演员只是死死盯着雪堆。他尴尬极了，脸红得跟个苹果一样。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ae0f0019:


    "我们策划了这么一场大戏，却彻底演砸了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4fb80ada:


    "波琳娜攥紧拳头，忽然大喊了一句："


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_63cba6fa:


    Pol "一群小丑！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_18738e7a:


    "说完，波琳娜就在白雪覆盖的柏油路上狂奔起来。那声响亮的“小丑！”则像被困住的鸽子，在校园的墙壁之间飞来飞去。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_71f39b98:


    "她的身影像裙摆似的晃来晃去，不一会儿就消失在了拐角。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_cc710a17:


    "罗姆卡羞愧地低下了头。他手里那束花也早就蔫巴了，啪一下掉在了脏兮兮的雪地上。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_132c083c:


    Rom "砸了，全砸了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_51627011:


    "我摘下面具，任由寒风吹凉我汗津津的脸。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bcac9f74:


    "面具没了，那种侵入性的想法和情绪好像也跟着不见了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f7cf369e:


    "罗姆卡死死盯着脚尖，咬紧了牙，咬得牙齿都咯咯响。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b23f68fd:


    "他又沮丧又失落，无法面对命运的打击，跟我截然不同。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_953e97b7:


    "我明白他现在的心情有多差。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a8640f29:


    "不管是粉碎周围的一切，还是用头哐哐撞混凝土墙，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4962a73e:


    "反正只要能让波琳娜回来，他做什么都愿意。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4b06b5c7:


    "他坚强又勇敢，但是害怕露出脆弱的一面。这就是他追爱路上的绊脚石。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_42ee8352:


    "我急中生智，连忙拍了拍罗姆卡的肩膀。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dd9675e7:


    Ant "在这等我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bedc0abd:


    "我飞奔着穿过校园，想赶上波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8bf017d5:


    "校园里回荡着我急促的脚步声。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f5e278a9:


    "眼前人的琴盒就像猫生气时的尾巴一样，晃来晃去的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_5545fc3d:


    Ant "波琳娜！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f688114e:


    "她没有立马停下，只是放慢了脚步。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_fea2eda4:


    Ant "波琳娜，你先别走！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6265d2c6:


    "我终于能看到她漂亮的侧脸了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_42f41331:


    Pol "干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_070512c1:


    "我追上了她，小心地抓住她的胳膊肘。可她这次没有一把甩开。看来有戏！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3f1741c3:


    Ant "误会，天大的误会。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_10f0d5ec:


    "波琳娜拨开了一缕头发。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dd79e1f6:


    ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_cbbbab5b:


    "她的语气还是很严厉。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_12df51f3:


    Pol "有什么好误会的？！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_97342dc7:


    Pol "罗姆卡自顾自计划了出英雄救美。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_265b229f:


    Pol "你就自愿当了小丑，好让他在我面前逞英雄。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3b4179bf:


    Pol "他为了演好这出戏，还不知道从哪找了张这么丑的面具！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_09546ed2:


    ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a73cb8b4:


    Ant "那你就错了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b5b1853f:


    Ant "罗姆卡真的很喜欢你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7a2e247f:


    "她眼睛里闪着好奇的光芒。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a50d5f34:


    "我想抱一抱波琳娜，想带着她偷偷逃走，逃到森林里去。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b6d949d7:


    "我想带她去见我的新朋友。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6e220332:


    "我想让那笛声再度响起，波琳娜肯定喜欢那支曲子。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c678e495:


    "我想带着波琳娜跳到天上去，跳得比云还高。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7becb46c:


    "等我们飘在夜空中，抬头就能望见星星的时候，我就告诉她，她对我来说到底有多重要。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_82495bbb:


    "我是快要渴死的人，她就是能解我渴的水。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_72ca458b:


    Pol "我觉得你也喜欢我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ad8e285b:


    "我装起傻来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_26990d13:


    Ant "我？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1e161082:


    "波琳娜生气地甩开了我的手。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_15926608:


    Pol "我明白了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4e29e78b:


    Ant "等等！我是喜欢你！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c1f4d92e:


    Ant "大家都喜欢你！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_08ba602a:


    Ant "但罗姆卡不一样，他特别喜欢。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_08e1118c:


    Pol "特别喜欢撒谎是吗。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e2c3a6c9:


    Ant "他看着吊儿郎当，其实比谁都认真。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_fbec0608:


    Ant "你记不记得，你跟我说过你想从这儿逃走？有他在，你的愿望肯定能实现。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ec87e8b9:


    Ant "他会带你去亮堂的大城市。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6447ee43:


    Ant "你想去哪他都能带你去！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b0b03d69:


    Ant "他发誓说要保护你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8f027430:


    "学校外面一片漆黑，只有寒风和纷飞的雪花。波琳娜盯着那片黑暗看了一会儿，开口问道："


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_93fa16b1:


    Pol "那你想让我怎么做？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6f1a27b4:


    Pol "就因为他发了誓，我就要给他生儿育女？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_131de90e:


    Ant "你就给他个机会，跟他再接触接触，好好了解了解他。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_55807f69:


    Ant "而且玩笑归玩笑，那个杀人魔还在外头晃悠倒是真的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e4882fcd:


    Ant "今天就让罗姆卡送你回家吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_766ffc46:


    "我嘴唇都麻木了，脸也硬得跟石头一样，但我还是强迫自己开口说话。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_12607e8e:


    "我害怕声音会出卖我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_af9aa0dd:


    "可那些话语就跟剃刀一样，割开了我的胸膛和气管，从我嘴里飘散了出去。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_133e1c45:


    "波琳娜听完以后一直没说话，我觉得她好像沉默了一个世纪。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_56d66d09:


    "她生气地哼了下鼻子，手指在黑色的琴盒上点来点去，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3614a427:


    "最后叹了口气，开口说道："


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d0c5e4e8:


    Pol "你告诉罗姆卡，我在校门口等他。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6cabf5e0:


    Pol "不过我没什么别的意思！他可别误会了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3203d220:


    "只要有必要，我什么表情都做得出来。于是我连忙装作很高兴的样子。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a61c3d54:


    Ant "你不会后悔的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c75837ad:


    "我慢慢走到拐角处，双眼紧闭。心脏每跳一下，锤子就敲一下，把钉子钉进我灵魂深处。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d45d4a5e:


    "罗姆卡还蹲坐在那儿，抚弄着头发。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ad01a0d1:


    Ant "她在校门口等你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_447f91d3:


    "罗姆卡听完惊讶不已。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a0b2083c:


    "他猛地跳起来，说话也哽咽了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_82102c1f:


    "我上个礼拜见到他的时候，他还是个人狠话不多的老大，跟现在简直判若两人。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2e1442ec:


    Rom ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_92fe1786:


    Rom "你这人情我这辈子都还不完！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3aba58d2:


    Rom "说吧，你想要什么？你是想让我给你搞个俄罗斯方块游戏机来，还是教你打架？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b9e1bae1:


    Rom "还是……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_447c29d6:


    "我就一个愿望：让我一个人清静清静。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_41c0479e:


    "这样一来，我就能静静看着森林在风中摇曳，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_49422d7f:


    "就能透过旧面具，吸入针叶林那寒冷的气味了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c8d11d78:


    Ant "快去吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_643a9669:


    "希望在涉及到阿狸萨的问题上，我不用在友谊和感情之间做选择。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_30bf3170:


    "毕竟，我只有阿狸萨了……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7aeb7c57:


    ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1c8e7945:


    "没错，在这片漆黑的针叶林里，她就是我唯一的光。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_478c6746:


    Ant_m ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_48c72325:


    Ant "我知道我想要什么了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2f59ea75:


    "罗姆卡走着走着忽然停了下来，定定地看着我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ec8c1a3c:


    Ant ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6d427f17:


    "我的好兄弟傻笑着，往后拉了拉帽子。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_58281b81:


    Rom "你想怎么整？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3f773ab5:


    Rom "要抢银行还是怎么的？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_199a76ae:


    Ant "不用，只要抓住那个连环杀手就行了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3367a085:


    Ant "绑架案都是他干的，只要抓住他，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e9e0f1b4:


    Ant "警察就会奖励我们一大笔钱。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_5a2bdf1b:


    "罗姆卡的脸抽了一下。他双手插进了裤兜里。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8b2b15fe:


    Rom "你真觉得帮忙抓了人，那个警督就会给你钱？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7b2004c7:


    Rom "他顶多给你块警察手表之类的！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_50fff925:


    "我懒得跟他吵了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ea5699ad:


    Ant "你到底帮不帮我抓犯人？给我个准话。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_0bd16284:


    Rom ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d65fa05d:


    Rom "有什么事都一起行动。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_222caf38:


    Ant "好吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2ef5b91b:


    Ant "我们要是知道该从哪找起……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f2f180f7:


    Rom "等等！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_64071792:


    Rom "拜沙不是说，他听到有人在哭吗？就墓地后面那片全是枯树叶的地方。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_72dad38d:


    Rom "肯定是卡嘉。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bed8b679:


    "我紧张得整个人都绷紧了，就跟吉他的弦一样。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_01067e00:


    "先是沃瓦失踪，然后是谢苗失踪，接着又是卡嘉失踪。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2b2a41b3:


    "我们会帮警察抓住那个可恶的犯人，然后整个村子就不用再活在恐惧之中了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c316a343:


    "大人再也不用把小孩关在家里，奥利娅就能出门了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b17762c9:


    "到时候，我就能教她怎么跳到天上去，她就能跟新朋友一块儿上天了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b9eef27b:


    Ant "你有什么计划？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8b8557f6:


    Rom "我这赶时间，没法跟你展开说。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ea259bdd:


    Rom "一个小时以后，波琳娜家见。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_76b59315:


    Rom "哦不对，一个半小时以后！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3adf472b:


    Rom "你应该知道她家在哪吧？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b1700b31:


    "我偷看过波琳娜的同学录，她家的门牌号我还记得。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2600d9a2:


    Ant "好，到时候见。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3f16febf:


    Rom "好！那我走了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f69cf603:


    "罗姆卡说完就飞也似地跑开了，只留下我一个人站在原地，努力让狂跳的心平静下来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_cee8eb89:


    "说不定有了罗姆卡的帮助，这场噩梦终于要结束了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_0b9a6d9e:


    "拜沙在那默默嗑着瓜子。我一走过去，他就冲我做了个鬼脸。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_039a9e30:


    Bya ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8f042d1e:


    Bya ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dab8da61:


    Bya ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_5cbab9d2:


    "拜沙郁闷地看了我一眼，转过了身去。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_742196e2:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_c5f0ad01:


    Rom "人渣！可悲又恶心的人渣！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_7d648ca1:


    "罗曼冲着天上的星星，发出了绝望的吼叫。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_cb870638:


    "他像抽雪茄一样，用嘴叼着刀柄，刀尖朝外，就像伸出了只钢做的爪子。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_01a5b9ab:


    "他四脚着地，"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_133441c7:


    "光看影子就像只野兽。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_84427fc2:


    "罗曼的口水滴在了雪地上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_15a05e51:


    "他愤怒到失去了理智，手脚并用，猛地跃起，咆哮着朝我扑了过来！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_aa3f305e:


    "{b}\"快跑！\"{/b}"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_b8ab2285:


    "我看都没看，转身就跑！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_08f3ebf5:


    "我每跑一步，就在雪地上留下一个深深的脚印，围在森林旁边的篱笆风一样从我身边飞过。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_0b9364a6:


    "罗曼发出的声音实在是太大了，大到我都不敢相信这是个跟我同岁，死命追着我的男孩能发出来的。那声音比起人更像野兽，而且是大得吓人的野兽。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_16618398:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_ab2c2074:


    "我就快要窒息了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_9411523c:


    "角落里停了辆拖拉机，但我没看见司机。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_808f5cda:


    "好像有什么东西灵巧地跳过了小路，站在离我很远的地方。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_5b76c8ea:


    "积雪堆得高高的，挡住了我的去路，我只能爬上去，往下滑，然后往小路跑。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_23c49d5c:


    "路灯惊恐地闪烁着。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_991837c0:


    "我发现前面有个商店，立马冲了过去。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_74e37624:


    "我抓住门把手一拧……锁着的！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_d08a7f28:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_f402ff67:


    "我跑到了清过雪的柏油路上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_afc97422:


    "前院的狗一反常态，叫都不叫了，怯生生地呜咽着。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_18c1e7bb:


    "我跑到了村子的最后一户人家门前，然后跑出了村子。高大的森林耸立在我面前，仿佛是块黑色的巨石碑。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_f99dd214:


    "我眼下只有一条路可走。要么跑到森林的空地里去，让罗曼当活靶子扎成筛子，要么直接穿过沟壑，还有落了一地树枝树干的地方，冒险跑出森林。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_d463625f:


    "我选了第二条路。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_d3cd3562:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_ec37a520:


    "我不停晃动身子，挣扎着爬起来，转身就往坡上爬，老觉得罗曼不知道什么时候就会从上面冒出来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_32383a75:


    "野蛮的咆哮声穿过了村子，直直钻进了我耳朵里。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_43043837:


    "一分钟过去了，两分钟过去了……"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_b1b81c57:


    "我颤抖着，凝视着坡顶，凝视着松树仿佛蘸墨画出来的轮廓，"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_0aac583d:


    "凝视着……越来越近的剪影。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_afc77b8e:


    "戴着狼面具的孩子从森林里走出来，站在了我面前。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_d51111d2:


    Wolf "碰、砰，朋友。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_2192a2ef:


    "他松开拳头，蝴蝶刀掉在了雪地上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_2850a0a4:


    Wolf "你妹、每、没事了。我们说过的。汪、往、忘了？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_2ca06f2a:


    "我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛，站在原地一动不动。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_2fb35cd4:


    "小狼伸手指了指林间的空地。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_221cf107:


    Wolf "每、妹、没事的。快走吧。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_7f815e67:


    "我吓坏了，什么都不敢问。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_bb20767c:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_1bc88855:


    "他脸色蜡白，眼睛里闪着磷脂的光。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_7a7c84aa:


    "啪一下，有什么东西打在了我身上，我低头看了一眼。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_a54e5e28:


    "刀刃都不见了……什么嘛，原来那把蝴蝶刀是假的啊。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_fe8cdc8f:


    "可能是从什么恶作剧商店里买的吧，就是那种碰到东西以后，刀刃会啪一下缩回去的小玩具。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_f2c325d0:


    "但我很快就意识到我想错了。刀刃不是缩回去了，是插进了我的胸膛。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_192b116c:


    "它整个没入了我的身体。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_8795b942:


    "就卡在我两根肋骨中间。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_0c7f5323:


    "寒冷。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_53500477:


    "锋利。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_df7b5cc7:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_8dcecca6:


    "我这时候才感觉到痛，就像闪电过后才有雷鸣一样。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_bf4f8256:


    "痛是痛，但算不上剧痛，这点出乎了我的意料。我只感觉不舒服，心里沉了一下，后脑勺那块像有什么东西在回弹一样。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_c9b33c9c:


    "我抓住了罗姆卡的前臂。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_460e1bab:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_87281ddc:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_1f4b58fc:


    "我想叫他住手，话却卡在了喉咙里。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_2f2f3e8f:


    "世界忽然倒了过来，摇晃不止。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_79c86c43:


    "我跪倒在了地上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_0f4d4fcb:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_d501fb3a:


    "就好像肺里的不是空气，是粘稠的面团。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_ccbc8d0e:


    "我嘴里全是血。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_65537d7f:


    "血溢出来，流到了雪地上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_2e470940:


    "我已经抬不起头来了，只能盯着面前这洼血迹。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_8a8b44ec:


    "然后面朝下，扑通一下摔了进去。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_8ae4a4d6:


    ""


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_0f008cb0:


    "我脸上沾满了血。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_460779a6:


    "没事的，我躺一会儿就好了，"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_118a61f1:


    "医生会把我缝好的。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_f856258c:


    "罗姆卡抓着我的后背，把我粗暴地翻了过来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_b2823586:


    "我看见了他扭曲的脸，还有杀红了的眼。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_7192edba:


    "他猛地拔出刀子，血以缓慢的速度，断断续续地溅了出来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_df62c03b:


    "他双手握着蝴蝶刀，大吼一声，猛地往下一捅。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_000cb936:


    "捅进了我的肚子里。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_186822b8:


    "疼痛吞噬了我的意识。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_186b6dbf:


    "我动不了了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_ebce3b7d:


    "我眼睛里全是热乎乎的东西，一滴一滴的，可我就是闭不上眼睛。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_6d7de680:


    "刀子在空中飞舞。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_187351c0:


    "随后狠狠刺进我的身体，刺破了像泡泡似的东西。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_09165ca5:


    "接着又是往上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_482c6661:


    "然后猛地往下扎。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_09165ca5_1:


    "接着又是往上。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_f8d2aa4b:


    "罗姆卡边叫边捅。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_fc59eecd:


    "边叫边割。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_378f99f6:


    "血溅了我一脸，那痕迹像条宽宽的红丝带。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_2af9be22:


    "我脑中仿佛有几十盏灯闪过，但下一刻，这些灯又逐一熄灭了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_833b00c3:


    "这些奇怪的萤火虫都死了，它们栖息的那块区域也沉入了黑暗。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_4bbc7fca:


    "罗姆卡的身影逐渐模糊。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_62938336:


    "我把视线从他的刀上移开了，投向了上方。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_7c38ab6f:


    "我的目光滑过凶手沾满鲜血的脸，投向了渐渐变暗的天空。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_55f75919:


    "就在那转瞬即逝之间，我看见了我无法继续的生活。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_f0346e44:


    "未来还有很多很多的机会，可都与我无关了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_9e2db832:


    "我在恍惚间好像来到了电影院，独自坐在座位上，盯着大银幕。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_ea9fc573:


    "我看见奥利娅失去了我的陪伴，一个人长大。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_bf6db4be:


    "我看见她结婚生子了，可我没机会亲手抱抱我的好外甥，好外甥女了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_95227c14:


    "我看见森林边缘的老屋里，坐着我那对年迈的父母。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_00b5f09a:


    "我看见了明亮的画廊和展厅，可我没机会在墙上挂上我的画了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_9cb43253:


    "还有繁华城市的人行横道，可我永远也没机会在上面走一走了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_af3f9321:


    "大银幕上出现了二十一世纪，那是我永远也去不了的年代。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_e677661f:


    "眼前出现的是一整个宇宙，可里面的人和事都与我没有关系了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_0d917b00:


    "我看见了一道灼热又刺眼的光。不知道它是从天上照下来的，还是从我垂下的眼皮底下照进来的。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_87018947:


    "刀子还在我体内进进出出，可我已经感觉不到痛了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_df81be10:


    "我的肉体会怎么样，已经无关紧要了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_aad70355:


    "电影播完了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_52700098:


    "我消失在了无尽的虚无之中。"





translate chinese d4_setup_mainloop_7fa4cb7f:


    ""


