    ""


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_56afeb5b:


    "拜沙在我们这桌坐下，焦虑地咬了咬下嘴唇。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_89386159:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/158To.ogg"
    Bya "托沙，你家离那个该死的森林那么近……"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_66a8d62c:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/158 V.ogg"
    Bya "你昨天就没看见什么奇怪的东西吗，呵？"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_e88f2dea:


    "我撒了个谎。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_108fdaec:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/4. N.ogg"
    Ant "没、没啊。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_5b60843f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/69 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "我也没看见。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_99b61351:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/70 po.ogg"
    Rom "我那天晚上本来要出去找你们排练的。可年级教室的老师刚好在跟我家里人批评我，说我成绩太差了。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_fed9ee63:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/71 Vot.ogg"
    Rom "我后来就没去成。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_5bee1f04:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/72 A.ogg"
    Rom "也算是我运气好了，不然我们都跟卡嘉一个下场了。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_fe36355d:


    "拜沙挠了挠喉结。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_1e2cf5ee:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/159 E.ogg"
    Bya "那个……是这样……呵……"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_7ed291bb:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/160 Ya.ogg"
    Bya "我听见了……奇怪的声音……"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_f1a4703d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/161 E.ogg"
    Bya "我今早跟往常一样出门上学，走着走着就听到树丛后面传来一阵刺耳的尖叫声。那是个女孩子的声音。你们懂我什么意思吧，呵？"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_af1b4cac:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/162 Nu.ogg"
    Bya "我那会儿还不知道卡嘉出事了。可我就算知道了，那声音也还是很吓人啊，兄弟们……"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_7b1cef41:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/163 Ut.ogg"
    Bya "早上那会儿外面黑得跟晚上似的，乌漆嘛黑的什么都看不清。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_75c8247a:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/164 v.ogg"
    Bya "可万一那个人就是卡嘉呢？"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_51142bc5:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/165A.ogg"
    Bya "而且那还是最危险最吓人的地方，呵，那周围全是让风吹落的树干树枝，旁边就是块墓地。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_65793266:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/73 Hor.ogg"
    Rom "胡说八道！"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_22445305:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/166 Da.ogg"
    Bya "是真的，呵！我亲耳听到的！"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_181669a9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/5. A.ogg"
    Ant "你确定卡嘉真的失踪了吗？"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_032bf4e4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/74Vo.ogg"
    Rom "今天就连卡嘉她妈妈，莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜，都没来上班。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_332bff32:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/167 S.ogg"
    Bya "考试也没了，呵。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_b2cec123:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/168 Ka.ogg"
    Bya "我告诉你们，那个躲在针叶林里呻吟的就是卡嘉。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_3ad865bf:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/169 A.ogg"
    Bya "她也让那个连环杀手给抓了！"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_b67c713f:


    "我记得卡嘉，她是个又漂亮又刻薄的女生。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_9c6ac6ac:


    "她是我们班第一个发育成熟的女生，班上其他女生都很嫉妒她的身材。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_7d4cd672:


    "她同时也很虚伪，是个不折不扣的贱人。八卦几乎都是从她那传出来的。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_618afe2c:


    "拜沙掰着手指头数了起来。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_d9f6ea58:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/170 Se.ogg"
    Bya "卡欣尼娅、沃瓦、谢苗和卡嘉……失踪了四个人了，呵！"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_e2307988:


    "罗曼用力拍了拍桌子。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_4b6b9b2a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/75 Ta.ogg"
    Rom "兄弟们，从现在起，我们谁都别放松警惕。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_04442c78:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/76 Da.ogg"
    Rom "还有，谁也别落单，别跟那些垃圾恐怖电影里的人一样。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_fc7b27a2:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/77 Na.ogg"
    Rom "其他人我都无所谓，反正我会保护好你们俩的。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_89c0bd08:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/78 Kak.ogg"
    Rom "喔，还有波琳娜……"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_f8b3341d:


    "希望你们两个进展顺利。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_f87ba3e1:


    "我都忘了我还喜欢过波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_ad1e32ed:


    "经过了昨天晚上的事情以后，我满脑子只有阿狸萨了。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_f11ae9bd:


    "其他男孩子都起身去了学校食堂，就我一个人还坐在那儿涂涂画画。我在笔记本上画了一排松树和两个小小的人影，那两个人影正从树梢飞向满月。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_f6fb7f8c:


    "寒颤一路爬上了我的肩膀，在我衬衣下摆底下调皮地溜来溜去。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_9ae3dd81:


    "虽然在天上飞的感觉是那么地纯粹……但我还是感觉有什么邪恶的东西，重重地压在我身上。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_98a408fd:


    "究竟是什么呢？是我口袋里那枚图章戒指，还是公告栏上失踪孩子们那一张张阴沉的脸？"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_92e56486:


    "犯人肯定还在村子里游荡。那人脸上戴着副虔诚的面具，可面具底下藏着非常恐怖的东西。"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_0b267328:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/134 R.ogg"
    Pol "你在画什么？"


translate chinese d4_begin_fox_e6134f99:


    "我尴尬得合上了笔记本，好像森林上空那两个人影，有什么见不得人的地方似的。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_1734efad:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我一开始也不信，但是莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜没来上课。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_41d79bf7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Kon.ogg"
    Pol "考试也没了。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_b67c713f:


    "我记得卡嘉，她是个又漂亮又刻薄的女生。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_77575402:


    "卡嘉。她是我们班第一个发育成熟的女生，班上其他女生都很嫉妒她的身材。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_7d4cd672:


    "她同时也很虚伪，是个不折不扣的贱人。八卦几乎都是从她那传出来的。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_f6fb7f8c:


    "寒颤一路爬上了我的肩膀，在我衬衣下摆底下调皮地溜来溜去。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_9ae3dd81:


    "虽然在天上飞的感觉是那么地纯粹……但我还是感觉有什么邪恶的东西，重重地压在我身上。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_a59790bd:


    ""


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_92e56486:


    "犯人肯定还在村子里游荡。那人脸上戴着副虔诚的面具，可面具底下藏着非常恐怖的东西。"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_c08d8baa:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Achto.ogg"
    Pol "你在画什么？"


translate chinese d4_begin_polina_e6134f99:


    "我尴尬得合上了笔记本，好像森林上空那两个人影，有什么见不得人的地方似的。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_b8abc601:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/8. Da.ogg"
    Ant "没什么……就随便画画。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_d06678e2:


    "波琳娜把胳膊肘放在了桌子上。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_67f3ec94:


    "我都忘了她身子有多轻，气质有多优雅了。她整个人就像把小提琴。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_7573a2db:


    "我昨天跟波琳娜打电话的时候，整个人怒火中烧。可现在这股怒火渐渐平息，躲进了洞里。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_5633ba56:


    "我真希望她能剥下虚伪的世俗面具，跟我们一起在森林里跳来跳去。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_172f08c6:


    "我笑了起来，想象着波琳娜的裙子在风中飘动，星星在我们周围眨着眼睛，她疑惑地问我我们是不是在做梦。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_1e553341:


    "然后我会跟她说，是不是做梦根本无所谓……"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_f701ab98:


    "波琳娜的表情又变得阴沉起来。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_66d0b8f8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/134 Uze.ogg"
    Pol "卡嘉的事你听说了吗？"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_3075cc93:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/9. Uzas.ogg"
    Ant "嗯。太惨了。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_2c7f0383:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/135 Da.ogg"
    Pol "嗯。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_af77b4e4:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/01 Uz.ogg"
    Pol "而且还有一点也很可怕，我发现我真的很难同情她。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_e321a007:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/02 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我很努力地想要同情她，但我一想起她干的那些恶毒的事情，我就……"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_53c1f636:


    "波琳娜摇了摇头。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_1ddd38e2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/03YaCh.ogg"
    Pol "你说，我是不是个怪物？"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_bef1a361:


    "\"不是，\"我心里想着，\"你是我见过的最漂亮的女孩子。\""


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_978c03be:


    "\"不是，\"我心里想着，\"你是我见过的最漂亮的女孩子。不过很遗憾，你现在在我心里只能排第二了。\""


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_ca23278e:


    "我决定还是不把这话说出来了。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_50d10bd5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/04 Plo.ogg"
    Pol "我的同学录也不见了。跟卡嘉失踪比起来，这件事更让我心烦，我觉得自己这样真的很不好。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_ea8d365f:


    "我的鼻子又闻到了糖果、树脂和烟火的气味。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_e112d4cb:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/10. T.ogg"
    Ant "你的同学录丢了？"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_1105aed3:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/05da Ektoto.ogg"
    Pol "嗯。我想，有人这会儿在偷看别人的秘密。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_8b1cd88e:


    "\"是森林。\"我脑子里蹦出这么句话来。我想象着弯曲的粗树枝，翻开了波琳娜的同学录；那挂着冰碴的小树枝，摸了摸满是稚气的笔迹。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_5e060315:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/06 Na.ogg"
    Pol "希望能找到。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_ff825d4f:


    "我不太确定她是希望能找到卡嘉，还是希望能找到她的同学录。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_c861f3d5:


    "我刚想开口问问她，就发现她正紧张地盯着我看。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_2882cda2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/11. Cht.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_35977029:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/07 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "你变了。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_c8d3cc76:


    "我吃了一惊，赶忙捋顺了头发。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_904a0f91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/12. Pros.ogg"
    Ant "我就是昨天晚上没睡好。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_00c6c6b0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/08 Se.ogg"
    Pol "你今天的旋律跟以前不一样了，变成了又神秘又古老的调子……"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_6bb1fed0:


    "我想起了那在茂密树梢间流淌的笛声。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_ce497e09:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/09 Nad.ogg"
    Pol "我们昨天说的，你应该没跟别人说吧？"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_e3f1692a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/13. Cto.ogg"
    Ant "那当然！"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_f796fec8:


    "她点了点头，好像认为自己可以充分信任我了一样。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_7ea31629:


    "但我倒不太确定自己值不值得她信任。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_e68a6e6b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/15 A moz.ogg"
    Pol ""


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_ae27c1e8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/16 Ded.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷最近好点了，我晚点回去也没事。"


translate chinese d4_polkatya_general_34766af2:


    "她的长发像瀑布一样倾泻在肩膀上，散发出一股美妙的香气。不用任何魔法，光靠这股香气，就让我飞向了内心小宇宙那一颗颗微微发亮的星星。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_437c4a4a:


    "就在这时，我感觉到了拜沙锐利的目光。他明显在盯着我们。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_05fee426:


    "我摘下了眼镜，眼前立马糊成一片，这样就看不见他的奸笑了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_3bb2ed56:


    "然而，罗姆卡拿着刀的画面在我脑海中一闪而过，我吓得出了一手的汗。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_830e9a79:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/10 Op.ogg"
    Pol "你又打瞌睡了？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_312e021f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/14. Po.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜……"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_d00c2cc0:


    "\"{b}什么罗姆卡，什么刀子，管它呢，{/b}\"我脑海中响起一阵低语，\"{b}想说什么就跟她说什么{/b}\"。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_eb867b4f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/15. k.ogg"
    Ant "我觉得罗姆卡看上你了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_a643e3f7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/11 Du.ogg"
    Pol "你以为我不知道？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_7b499e9a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/16. Ot.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么看出来的？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e7d9f45b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/12 Sch.ogg"
    Pol "直觉吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8ffc70ae:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/13 Pya.ogg"
    Pol "不过我才懒得管他。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_f6c60b77:


    "听她这么说，我更有把握了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_95cbf125:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/17. Mn.ogg"
    Ant "他这人没脑子，你应该看不上他。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_ff3d998a:


    "波琳娜朝我露出了迷人的微笑。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_b83f8c68:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/14Ho.ogg"
    Pol "幸好有你陪着我。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_af0bea69:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/15 A.ogg"
    Pol "等放了学，你想不想跟我一块走走？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_a74474dc:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/16 De.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷最近好点了，我晚点回去也没事。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_44e3b345:


    "我回应了波琳娜的邀约，同时也亲手签下了自己的死刑判决书。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_f1afa199:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/20. Ko.ogg"
    Ant "嗯，好啊！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_4f77a0ae:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/17 To.ogg"
    Pol "那就放学见。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_4704f65d:


    "她再次俯下身来，用那双敏锐的眼睛看着我。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_34598843:


    "然后咕哝了几句，好像是在猜测什么。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_201fbf08:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/18 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "类似穆索尔斯基写的曲子？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_104b473b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/19 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "唔，可能不是。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_02e5a0a9:


    "波琳娜说完就走了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e8887df7:


    "罗姆卡的手下还待在那，死死盯着我，手指放到喉结下面一划，好像在跟我说：\"你死定了。\""


translate chinese d4_school_polina_9895e676:


    "下课铃响了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_69468793:


    "剩下的课一下就上完了，我终于可以出校门了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_ddf7ccdd:


    "小小的旋风像陀螺一样，刮过学校操场。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_849bc9d9:


    "天空落下大片雪花。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_5fb46a39:


    "远处的街灯在半明半暗中闪烁。天实在太冷了，连街灯的光都凝结成了霜花，变得坚硬而又锐利。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_99f3ab4c:


    "远处有只小狗在呜咽，我想起了可怜的如利卡。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_1b57dfc8:


    "波琳娜就站在学校的台阶上，寒风抚弄着她的头发。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_900a755c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/24. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "这里太安静了，我都忘了大城市里的喧嚣了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_6c01c890:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/20 O.ogg"
    Pol "我会梦到那种嘈杂的声音！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_ace25c96:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/25. O.ogg"
    Ant "嘈……什么？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_6ac016e6:


    "波琳娜哈哈大笑起来。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_3fe53318:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/21 Kak.ogg"
    Pol "嘈杂，就是各种声音乱七八糟混一块儿。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_2d10daea:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/22 De.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷总是跟我说，要仔细听万事万物的旋律。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e166080a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/26. On.ogg"
    Ant "感觉你爷爷好厉害。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_b6f755d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/23 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "就是很厉害！我等会儿就带你去见他。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_2ad96f91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/27. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你是想请我去你家玩吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_cfd3c3b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/24 A.ogg"
    Pol "怎么，你不想去？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_fc948e45:


    "操场那头传来了一阵刺耳的口哨声，打乱了我的思绪。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_50fb5686:


    "雪中出现了两个剪影。来的这两个人都低着头，双手插兜。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_467d5147:


    "我一看他们两个那样子就知道，来者不善。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_cf0d5948:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/214Anu.ogg"
    Rom "放手！听见没有！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_6b240421:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/215Polin.ogg"
    Rom "波琳娜，你没事吧？他有没有伤着你？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_0d563bf3:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/01 M.ogg"
    Bya "我们都看见了，呵！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_7da1d3f6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/64. Vid.ogg"
    Ant "看见什么了？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_950f69c3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/216Chto.ogg"
    Rom "你个死变态！你想把她带到森林里去对不对？就跟卡嘉一样！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_05cf235d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/02V .ogg"
    Bya "我们来得正是时候，呵。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_365ab7f7:


    "波琳娜沮丧的声音像鸟儿一样，飞过了学校操场。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_3c42763a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/25 Da.ogg"
    Pol "你们两个发什么神经？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_0e7859b8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/217Ati.ogg"
    Rom "你没听说吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_7cde9c1f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/219Kak.ogg"
    Rom "这垃圾刚搬过来没多久，村里人就一个接一个地失踪了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e44d4252:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/03 Ag.ogg"
    Bya "没错！他昨天跟卡嘉说要送她回家，结果把她拖进了森林！我昨天亲眼看见的！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_0e29644e:


    "我立马反驳。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_69d6ad23:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Vresh.ogg"
    Ant "你撒谎！我讨厌卡嘉！怎么可能还送她回家！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_43dadade:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/220vot.ogg"
    Rom "哦！难怪你要拖她进森林！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e19309ba:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/04 V.ogg"
    Bya "这下都说得通了，呵。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_caa5feab:


    "他们这明摆着是要冤枉人，我傻眼了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8b1bcbe6:


    "不过眼下只有一点值得高兴，那就是罗姆卡和拜沙的演技都挺烂的，一看就知道在撒谎。要让我打分的话，我顶多给个C-吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_431f22b7:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/221pov.ogg"
    Rom "算你走运，我们不跟条子打交道。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_ce89a875:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/222ato.ogg"
    Rom "要不然，我们很乐意把你那点事捅到条子那去！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_5bf84e18:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/05 N.ogg"
    Bya "没事！反正我们也要跟他好好聊聊，呵。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_d159990e:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/06 D.ogg"
    Bya "抓住他！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8b4df86c:


    "罗姆卡奸笑着朝我走来。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_14cc36af:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/223zna.ogg"
    Rom "你说你讨厌卡嘉，对吧？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_2b895c92:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/224kone.ogg"
    Rom "那就对了！凶手不是你还能是谁？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_2bf07094:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/26 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "说不定是你。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_d199fc7e:


    "我惊讶地看着波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_340f12aa:


    "罗姆卡举起拳头，愣在了原地。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_5bdde07e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/225vsm.ogg"
    Rom "你、你说什么？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_b62141db:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/27 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "说实话，卡嘉谁都不喜欢。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_b0d3b6ff:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/28 Du.ogg"
    Pol "你以为她就不会在背后嚼你的舌根吗，罗曼？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_a129432f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/29 Chto.ogg"
    Pol "你以为她没跟人说过你爸坐牢的事？还有你爸经常打你。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e59d3087:


    "罗姆卡的脸涨得通红，他就像离了水的鱼似的，嘴唇张张合合。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_ef5000fb:


    "波琳娜继续愤怒地说着。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_56580e49:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/30 A.ogg"
    Pol "你呢，拜沙？你昨晚去哪了？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_6cab9eb0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/31 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "卡嘉说你看了一眼黑车库以后，脑子就不太正常了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_0b5bebef:


    "拜沙后退了几步，他兜帽下的脸瞬间就没了血色。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_235ab399:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/32 Ta.ogg"
    Pol "说不定，绑架卡嘉的变态就是你？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e518880d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/07 N.ogg"
    Bya "不是！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_49d52c08:


    "拜沙喊了一声，近乎尖叫。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_5a96b0bf:


    "他转身摇摇晃晃地朝校门走去，边走还边摇头。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_aac15a5d:


    "\"哇，\"我在心里惊叹道，\"她一下就搞定了拜沙。\""


translate chinese d4_school_polina_9b74f614:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/33 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "你还打算干嘛，当罗密欧？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_dd8c0e39:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/34 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "你还有什么破谎要撒？嗯？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e4c64c5a:


    "罗曼咽了口气，明显是泄气了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8ede217e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/35 Ci.ogg"
    Pol "你说的这乱七八糟的都是什么？你想跟我演英雄救美吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_dc534fec:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/36 To.ogg"
    Pol "英雄可不是你这样的。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_b3f76082:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/37 E.ogg"
    Pol "还有，罗曼，你演技够烂的。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_1bb9094c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/227da.ogg"
    Rom "你听我说，那个四眼他……"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_fc04b1f0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/38 V.ogg"
    Pol "各方各面都比你强。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_c66c9d6e:


    "她说完后，做了件震惊所有人的事情：她抓住了我的手。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_646f6536:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/39 Po.ogg"
    Pol "安东，我们走。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_0a490a06:


    "罗姆卡惊呆了，波琳娜拉着我从他身边走了过去。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_6cb1ffdf:


    "我看着他的样子，心里有点难过，但又非常高兴。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_7dac920b:


    "罗姆卡也没拦我们。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_cfcc1f6a:


    "他就站在那，盯着雪，看它越下越大。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8d971e58:


    "我走出校门以后，忍不住跳起来喊了一句："


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8adc0949:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/66. Kak.ogg"
    Ant "太厉害了！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_7e0ba999:


    "波琳娜朝我尴尬地笑了笑。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_1e37b43d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/40 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "诶呀……就跟我爷爷说的一样，\"跟狼住，你就得学狼叫。\""


translate chinese d4_school_polina_b7ed3c77:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/67. On.ogg"
    Ant "他感觉像个哲学家。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_f4f3acb2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/41 Kra.ogg"
    Pol "他是研究本地历史的历史学家……不过他早就退休了。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_45fd9bdd:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/42 On.ogg"
    Pol "他最近……身体也不太好。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_95d658dc:


    "我点了点头，表示关切。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_205cf682:


    "我一路上都在偷看波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_3b4ac06b:


    "她就像块珍贵的宝石，每一面都闪着微光，每一秒都有微妙的变化。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_a846539f:


    "她天真无邪地笑着，那双充满笑意的眼睛好像在问我“你说什么？”"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_51ca9cfd:


    "没什么！”我在心里默默回答道。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_cad25acd:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/43 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "你好勇敢，我就喜欢勇敢的人。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_bc6e6aa2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/68. Hr.ogg"
    Ant "我勇敢？我就站在那，一句话也没说。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_9e1a9bd7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/44 No.ogg"
    Pol "是这样没错！但你也没跑。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_62955535:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/45 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "你有勇气还嘴，更别提你那时候还打了巴布林，我现在想起来都觉得厉害！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_59c5120f:


    Ant "我愿意为你做很多事。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_8d06aef6:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/46 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "喏！我就说！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_2dc6f19e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/47 Ez.ogg"
    Pol "你这话就是小说里的人才会说的！"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_e481f1c0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/48 Ra.ogg"
    Pol "\"交给我吧，夫人！\""


translate chinese d4_school_polina_279d72d0:


    "说完，波琳娜咯咯地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_school_polina_c94dde36:


    ""


translate chinese d4_school_solo_ee88ab6e:


    "拜沙就跟玩偶盒里的玩偶一样，忽然大叫一声跳了出来，拦住了我的去路。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_a6271feb:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/171 Op.ogg"
    Bya "喂！"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_d655e8d6:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/172 Ach.ogg"
    Bya "玩得挺开心啊，呵？"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_247c070b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/247ti.ogg"
    Rom "喂，四眼仔，你是不是想撩波琳娜？"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_dfe0584b:


    "我没有请波琳娜替我解围，但她还是主动走了过来。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_6f7a849b:


    "还是说……我光站在那就算是跟她求救了？"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_4b262130:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/174 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "你胡说什么？我们是普通朋友。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_e2a9668a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/248Tvo.ogg"
    Rom "那他是你闺蜜吗？你等下是不是还要跟这个死基佬去逛街，买裙子？"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_391eb38a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/175 N.ogg"
    Pol "他不是基佬！别纠缠彼得罗夫了！"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_9914cf4c:


    "我知道，我得做点什么才行。可我只能一动不动地坐在那，死死抓着桌边。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_40db0068:


    "罗姆卡嘲讽地哼了哼鼻子。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_b0144e58:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/249baba.ogg"
    Rom "算你走运，丑逼。我就先放你一马。今天要不是有女孩子在，我他妈弄死你。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_5bb0e652:


    "我的敌人大笑着离开了教室。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_ab823c9a:


    "波琳娜冲我苦笑了一下。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_ba6faf82:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/176 Bu.ogg"
    Pol "坚强点。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_823fc34f:


    "我真想大叫，但我叫不出来。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_c97ac007:


    "我不够坚强，不敢站起来好好收拾那两个混蛋。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_f6460411:


    "我保护不了自己，也保护不了别人。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_bbbfc7b1:


    "我真是太可悲了。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_998b2133:


    "我真想消失在森林里，想在雪地里挖个坑，把自己埋进去。我想回家，想躲进被窝里，想离人类远远的。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_a509a28d:


    "这些痛苦的想法一直在折磨我。波琳娜一走，我再也憋不住了，哭了出来。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_1baf3423:


    "我今天又跟波琳娜说话了。我怕罗姆卡找我麻烦，放学以后又待到很晚才敢回去。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_0f1cb53e:


    "等我出校门的时候，外面已经是黄昏了，我就这么拖着脚一步一步往家走。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_0cecea13:


    "学校看大门的闲着无聊，用铲子在那刮沥青。高年级的学生聚在一起抽烟，吐出的烟圈又白又圆，就像漫画里的对话气泡。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_280f1d8a:


    "我想在气泡里填上友善的话，但那些人看我的眼神冷冰冰的，一点也不友善。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_06c0fb9c:


    "我想离开这个令人不快的世界，离开这个有过期面包和侮辱的世界。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_ed0ddb1c:


    "有人在楼梯附近推了我一下。爸妈就没教过他们做错了事要道歉吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_8fa9895d:


    "我穿过了村子，走到桥附近的时候放慢了脚步，四处张望了一下，想找找我的狐狸朋友。可别说她了，其他的动物朋友连个影都没有。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_9515f3cf:


    "我又跟森林打照面了。它就像是蜷成一团的捕食者，假装睡着了，一声不吭，实际上有一边眼睛还留了条缝，正从那条缝里盯着我。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_a335325d:


    "我攥紧了书包带，低着头走进了森林，边走边透过镜片看自己的脚。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_e9ec62f5:



    voice "voice/Child/4day/Katya.ogg"
    Noname "卡——嘉！卡——嘉！"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_9234e4ad:


    "又有黑影在光秃秃的树干之间闪过，还不停喊着一个女孩的名字。那个女孩很可能已经死了。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_826e93a6:


    "落日在松树树梢上渐渐熄灭，就像煤气灯里的火调到了最小一样。"


translate chinese d4_school_solo_d72c52f5:


    "我缩着头往前走，尽量不去看那些歪歪扭扭的树。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_597d1f5b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/18. K.ogg"
    Ant "没问题。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_65ef2e91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/19. To.ogg"
    Ant "不过我们从后门走吧，就是挨着操场的那个门。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3e950ccb:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/136 Pr.ogg"
    Pol "你是要躲谁吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_ecb2db4a:


    "我瞥了瞥前面的座位，还是空荡荡的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_da606b95:


    "我那两个好兄弟都不在，刚好给了我背叛他们的好机会。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_988a26fa:


    "想到这，内疚感就用那小小的嘴巴啃食着我的心。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_562cbe33:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/137 Tak.ogg"
    Pol "是不是跟罗曼有关系？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_39a4a75a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/138 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "你不想让他知道我们两个一起出去玩，是吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_eb29b71a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/21. T.ogg"
    Ant "他喜欢你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_13d3f97b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/139 Slo.ogg"
    Pol "这谁都看得出来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_c01227dd:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/140 No.ogg"
    Pol "不过你们男孩子总是忘记最重要的一点，那就是凡事都得先问问女孩子愿不愿意。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3ad7cbcf:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/141 Ade.ogg"
    Pol "然后这个女孩子就会说：‘放学以后后门见。’"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3e728777:


    "我笑了起来，松了一口气。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_b4c675dd:


    "罗曼回来了。他给我扔了个越橘小面包，冲我眨了眨眼。就在这一刻，内疚感又开始撕咬我的心。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_c475be34:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/Esh.ogg"
    Rom "我们等下还有场戏要演。快吃，吃了才有劲演戏！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_22817979:


    "然而我这个要扮演坏蛋的演员，却没有按时参演。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_6a623c02:


    "离代数课下课还有20分钟的时候，我跟老师撒谎说牙疼，早早离开了学校。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_a7dfd1e1:


    "我就跟犯人似的，躲在了学校附近的树丛里。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_4736b656:


    "好在波琳娜很快就到了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3cd74bee:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/22. Ei.ogg"
    Ant "欸，我在这儿！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_08190bd9:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/142 Tib.ogg"
    Pol "你要这么想躲起来，干嘛不把自己埋进雪堆里？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_1aacb29a:


    "我发觉我其实是两边都想讨好：我想瞒着罗曼偷偷赢得波琳娜的芳心，这样罗曼也不会跟我直接闹掰了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_d128cee2:


    "要是他们其中一个发现了我的计划，会怎么样？我自己也有点好奇。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_0850d2bd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/23. Poi.ogg"
    Ant "来，我们走吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_d0b5bff9:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/143 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "嗯。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_8212b122:


    "我们沿着学校的足球场走着。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_412703b6:


    "太阳很大，但温暖不了结冰的土地。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_26d5aba2:


    "黄昏就躲在树丛后面，焦急地等待着。时机一到，它就会跳出来，一口吞掉整个村子。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_900a755c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/24. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "这里太安静了，我都忘了大城市里的喧嚣了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_6c01c890:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/20 O.ogg"
    Pol "我会梦到那种嘈杂的声音！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_ace25c96:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/25. O.ogg"
    Ant "嘈……什么？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_6ac016e6:


    "波琳娜哈哈大笑起来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3fe53318:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/21 Kak.ogg"
    Pol "嘈杂，就是各种声音乱七八糟混一块儿。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_2d10daea:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/22 De.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷总是跟我说，要仔细听万事万物的旋律。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_7a0d075b:


    Ant "他感觉像个哲学家。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_a4cfe8fa:


    Pol ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_e166080a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/26. On.ogg"
    Ant "感觉你爷爷好厉害。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_b6f755d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/23 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "就是很厉害！我等会儿就带你去见他。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_2ad96f91:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/27. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你是想请我去你家玩吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_cfd3c3b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/24 A.ogg"
    Pol "怎么，你不想去？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_4259214e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/28. Net.ogg"
    Ant "没有！当然想去了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_205cf682:


    "我一路上都在偷看波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3b4ac06b:


    "她就像块珍贵的宝石，每一面都闪着微光，每一秒都有微妙的变化。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_a846539f:


    "她天真无邪地笑着，那双充满笑意的眼睛好像在问我“你说什么？”"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_51ca9cfd:


    "“没什么！”我在心里默默回答道。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_fa9b9a35:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/TiS.ogg"
    Pol "你好勇敢，我就喜欢勇敢的人。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_af4e9636:


    Ant "我很勇敢？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_b3b62f5a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/144 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "是啊，巴布林打了你，你不是还手了嘛！我到现在都还记得你是怎么打回去的！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_3c87ae3d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/30. Pu.ogg"
    Ant "那个没什么。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_b7316e92:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/145 Zna.ogg"
    Pol "对女孩子来说，安全感是很重要的！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_e6c73e99:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/31. Za.ogg"
    Ant "保护你是我的荣幸。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_bc9bf51a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/146 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "喏！我就说！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_1257c57d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/147 Ez.ogg"
    Pol "你这话就是小说里的人才会说的！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_e5c0c899:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/148 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "这是我的荣幸，女士！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_279d72d0:


    "说完，波琳娜咯咯地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_betray_b665ff3b:


    "我假装生气，撅起个嘴来，可到最后也还是忍不住跟着笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_67590f4d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/33. Poch.ogg"
    Ant "啊，好啊……说定了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f8a1f690:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/149 Togda.ogg"
    Pol "那就下了代数课后操场见。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4704f65d:


    "她再次俯下身来，用那双敏锐的眼睛看着我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_34598843:


    "然后咕哝了几句，好像是在猜测什么。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_201fbf08:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/18 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "类似穆索尔斯基写的曲子？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_104b473b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/19 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "唔，可能不是。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6bf60af3:


    "她说完就离开了。没多久，罗曼就出现在了门口。他扑通一下坐在我旁边的座位上，跟我咬耳朵。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ee43f8ff:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/79 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "你刚在跟她聊天？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7f3767b1:


    "拜沙朝我们俩走了过来，但罗曼生气地看了他一眼。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_aca3f6e3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/80 Bya.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙，你回避一下。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b6c681d8:


    "拜沙沮丧地撇了撇嘴，离开了教室。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_9c12a822:


    "罗曼这才又转向了我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e90a36f1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/81 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "是的吧？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dd5a53eb:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/82 Ona.ogg"
    Rom "她有没有提我？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a156606b:


    "我没忍住，脸上闪过了一抹伤心绝望的微笑。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dc72f573:


    "战神金刚战队的领袖罗姆卡陷入了疯狂的热恋之中！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_fd5f74b1:


    "他的目光里充满了希望、恳求，还有忧虑。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1b3d80b0:


    "他看起来就像个天真纯洁的小男孩，运动、犯罪和冷漠，好像只是他欺骗世人的伪装。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7c9864d3:


    "我真的能在他这么脆弱的时候背叛他吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_86355496:


    "我能在错的时间错的地点，做出正确的选择吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bf91bec6:


    "我在开口之前假装咳嗽了一下。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bb5a383f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/35. Ona.ogg"
    Ant "她问我你放学以后会去哪儿。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_628b18c1:


    "我话音刚落，罗曼的脸上就洋溢着幸福的笑容。看他这样子，我就觉得我这谎撒得值了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_9fff7b06:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/83 A.ogg"
    Rom "那你是怎么说的？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d6a51a75:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/36. Sk.ogg"
    Ant "我跟她说，你人在操场那儿。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e6058462:


    "罗姆卡兴奋地舔了舔嘴唇。他一把抓住我的手腕，力气大得我以为自己要骨折了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4f3f3bbf:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/85 Nut.ogg"
    Rom "谢了，托沙！你真够朋友！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_37693a38:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/86 Po.ogg"
    Rom "我们这就去准备准备！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_35adf81b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/87 Sh.ogg"
    Rom "我保证这场演出，她这辈子都忘不了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_24a9d506:


    "罗曼离开了教室，跑去找闷闷不乐的拜沙了，我则盯着波琳娜空荡荡的座位愣神。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f57464f1:


    "我用一段友谊，换了另一段友谊。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b13023a3:


    "希望我的选择是对的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a5037b9d:


    "下课铃声在学校最黑暗的角落漫无目的地游荡。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bf5dff60:


    "我外套拉链才拉了一半，就急忙向操场跑去。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b3fd8890:


    "北边飘来了片乌云，云中传出响亮的咆哮。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a71b184e:


    "天气预报说暴风雪就要来了，看来还真没说错。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e7a699e3:


    "其他孩子背对风站着，任由狂风把他们推到溜冰场上去，发出阵阵笑声。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_472e8069:


    "暴风雪将笑声送往了蓝紫色的未知之中。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8dd5c0ea:


    "学校的小操场平时都没什么人。罗姆卡见我来了，立马就冲到了我跟前。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_508fed88:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/88 G.ogg"
    Rom "你准备好了吗？你不会打退堂鼓的对吧？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_712ea98f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/89 V.ogg"
    Rom "机会只有一次，没了就没了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7bfba25a:


    "我压根没准备好。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1a42f2b0:


    "我肚子里一阵刺痛，它催着我赶紧离开这里，不要参与。这个计划很不切实际，根本就不可能成功。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_efd9a963:


    "但我出于原则，又不能在这个时候抛下罗姆卡。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2606b440:


    "与此同时，他伸出沾满墨水的手指，匆忙清点起演员和道具来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_40b5c4ac:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/90 B.ogg"
    Rom "花，有了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8443ae50:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/91 M.ogg"
    Rom "坏蛋，也有了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_819ea8a3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/92 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "还漏了什么没有？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_cc90f4d6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/37.A.ogg"
    Ant "我要不要化装一下？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2be82097:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/37.Gde.ogg"
    Ant "拿把斧子啊，或者……呃……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ccd9a42e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/37.M.ogg"
    Ant "戴个面具？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2be3e561:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/93 Da.ogg"
    Rom "诶唷！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c7288153:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/94 Na.ogg"
    Rom "托沙，你包里不是有个兔子面具吗？戴那个就行了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_18c5e83b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/95 To.ogg"
    Rom "快点！不能让波琳娜看到我们在一块儿！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8a20785a:


    "我刚怀疑地看了看罗姆卡，手指就已经摸到书包拉链，满怀期待地一把拉开。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7ecade9d:


    "我从包里拿出了自己真正的\"脸\"，心里没有一丝惊讶，反而觉得松了一口气。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_659411f8:


    "面具拿在手里，人冷静了下来，肚子也没那么疼了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2c529c82:


    "我立马就记起了那种飞上天的失重感，还有快乐的感觉。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3d865891:


    "罗姆卡的问题一下就变得那么无聊，那么微不足道。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_24ee1bf9:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/96 Da.ogg"
    Rom "记好了，就照排练的来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_517b6e3b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/97 To.ogg"
    Rom "她一出现……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ca936995:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/38. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我就拦住她。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bbeded7f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/98 A.ogg"
    Rom "对！然后我就从树丛里跳出来，嘭地一下，来个英雄救美！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b5e278e1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/99 T.ogg"
    Rom "托沙，你到时胆子要大点。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a3d94a44:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/100 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "演得越真越好。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3e83d28c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/39. Y.ogg"
    Ant "我尽力。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_10007d87:


    "这副面具也就是硬纸板上粘了点毛而已，可它带给我的力量，足以跟呼啸的暴风雪抗衡。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_18b14bd2:


    "我满心欢喜地用这张真正的脸盖住了眼镜，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d8825a98:


    "然后调整了一下面具的位置，让眼睛正对上那两个窟窿。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_78e21b39:


    "罗姆卡跑开了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_15a5ef0b:


    "他前脚刚走，波琳娜就从拐角处走了出来，警惕地四处张望。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2eb27fef:


    "她手里拎着小提琴琴盒，双脚踩着刚下的雪，每走一步都吱吱作响。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_55985140:


    "乌云吞没了太阳，黑暗将我变成了长着兔耳朵的剪影。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1e14ca41:


    "波琳娜怀疑地看了我一眼，随后绕着操场转起圈来。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ddbaf772:


    "嘿嘿！她没认出来我！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d9529f36:


    "我一点也不担心身高或者打扮会暴露自己，径直走到了波琳娜跟前。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_71849bbf:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/40. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "{b}小妞儿，你迷路了吗？{/b} "


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f3b7c20b:


    "她皱了皱眉，往身后的树丛退了几步。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6ed23d23:


    "就在这时，罗姆卡立马从树丛里跳了出来，大声骂了一句。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_48d13521:


    "他就跟螃蟹似的，笨拙地往旁边挪了几步，拿着花的那只手一直背在身后。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3a1fc47d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/102E.ogg"
    Rom "喂，死变态！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6b51b9ea:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/103 P.ogg"
    Rom "只、只要有我在，谁都别想伤害她！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3d5930a5:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/104 Po.ogg"
    Rom "懂……懂吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_59d82fb7:


    "我尴尬得翻了个白眼。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_8472bc6a:


    "罗姆卡的语气太做作了，跟个白痴一样。他排练的时候表现好多了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b3ef2a78:


    "我只当没听见，嚣张地抓住波琳娜的衣领，把她拉近了点，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3653c14e:


    "用手指抚摸着她丝绸般光滑的刘海。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b69bd783:


    "波琳娜愤怒地尖叫着，却只换来我一番讪笑。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_00e8fc0b:


    "我整个人放肆了起来，觉得自己做什么都不会有事的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3bff19b8:


    "我想把波琳娜推倒在地，想用力摸她，摸到她浑身上下都是淤青，摸到话都说不清的罗姆卡学会演戏为止。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_93330d21:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/106 G.ogg"
    Rom "滚开！听见没有？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e08f2e27:


    "我没听他的，继续手上的动作，整个人沉醉在力量之中。罗姆卡困惑极了，他什么也做不了，只能站在原地喃喃自语，他这模样让我很是受用。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_45abd46f:


    "戴上了这副兔子面具，我想干嘛就干嘛。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_58ea7f92:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/41. Pro.ogg"
    Bunny ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_04b2e0b8:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/42. S.ogg"
    Bunny ""


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ffc5263e:


    "罗姆卡惊讶地睁大了眼睛。我看得出来，他一度试图保持冷静，想演好路见不平的英雄。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_0499387a:


    "可就在这个平民英雄动手之前，波琳娜开口了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f82069f6:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/152 Tak.ogg"
    Pol "怎么回事？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d81d0d4d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/153 P.ogg"
    Pol "皮蒂法诺夫，你能不能让你兄弟放开我？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_943af9dc:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/108 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "我……他，他不是……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_20a7ad95:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/155 D.ogg"
    Pol "你当我三岁小孩吗？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d4f0035e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/156 B.ogg"
    Pol "这是谁？拜沙？还是……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_50212038:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/157 An.ogg"
    Pol "安东？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f74bcc07:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/158 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "我真没想到你是这种人。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_dfc9e1c8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/159 K.ogg"
    Pol "一群小丑！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1fdc2fc4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/109 E.ogg"
    Rom "砸了，全砸了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ef23fed9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/45. Z.ogg"
    Ant "在这等我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_121aba66:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/46. Pol.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_0b2b82f7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/47. Nu.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，你先别走！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_5540ef70:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/160 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_62c48d50:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/48. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "误会，天大的误会。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_15d84ae4:


    "我想，她这动作可能是从莎朗·斯通哪部电影里学来的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_42066b35:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/161 Ct.ogg"
    Pol "有什么好误会的？！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_20e1a2db:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/162 R.ogg"
    Pol "罗姆卡自顾自计划了出英雄救美。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a413457c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/163 At.ogg"
    Pol "你就自愿当了小丑，好让他在我面前逞英雄。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2f310fbf:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/164 Es.ogg"
    Pol "他为了演好这出戏，还不知道从哪找了张这么丑的面具！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4ebb71b6:


    "我真想大声反驳：{b}“根本就不丑！”{/b}，但从我一开口，说的却是完全相反的话。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_89a97bf0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/49. Avot.ogg"
    Ant "那你就错了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7e5ee5eb:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/50 T.ogg"
    Ant "罗姆卡真的很喜欢你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3b2f8c60:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/166 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我觉得你也喜欢我。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_78388682:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/50. Mne.ogg"
    Ant "我？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_9791d832:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/168 Vs.ogg"
    Pol "我明白了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_eec5278b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/51.Da.ogg"
    Ant "等等！我是喜欢你！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ed12e6af:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/51.T.ogg"
    Ant "大家都喜欢你！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_61edf533:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/51.No.ogg"
    Ant "但罗姆卡不一样，他特别喜欢。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_18455e4f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/169 Os.ogg"
    Pol "特别喜欢撒谎是吗。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f4bc68dd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52. On.ogg"
    Ant "他看着吊儿郎当，其实比谁都认真。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_91109821:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.Po.ogg"
    Ant "你记不记得，你跟我说过你想从这儿逃走？有他在，你的愿望肯定能实现。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_fe5e4b6e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.V.ogg"
    Ant "他会带你去亮堂的大城市。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3472ef45:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.Da.ogg"
    Ant "你想去哪他都能带你去！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_abb83b2c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.On.ogg"
    Ant "他发誓说要保护你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_1d10a240:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/170 E.ogg"
    Pol "那你想让我怎么做？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c36a703f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/171 Ot.ogg"
    Pol "就因为他发了誓，我就要给他生儿育女？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f7cdd51f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/52.Dl.ogg"
    Ant "你就给他个机会，跟他再接触接触，好好了解了解他。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4541ab0d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/53.Sh.ogg"
    Ant "而且玩笑归玩笑，那个杀人魔还在外头晃悠倒是真的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_50ed1f2c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/53.Po.ogg"
    Ant "今天就让罗姆卡送你回家吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_5f391a9e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/172 Pe.ogg"
    Pol "你告诉罗姆卡，我在校门口等他。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ebdee67b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/173 no.ogg"
    Pol "不过我没什么别的意思！他可别误会了！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_09f89631:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/54. T.ogg"
    Ant "你不会后悔的。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_e7f0bde6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/55. Ona.ogg"
    Ant "她在校门口等你。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_eafae180:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/111 T.ogg"
    Rom "托沙，你真是我的大救星！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_3f94f738:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/112 B.ogg"
    Rom "你这人情我这辈子都还不完！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_5374187b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/113H.ogg"
    Rom "说吧，你想要什么？你是想让我给你搞个俄罗斯方块游戏机来，还是教你打架？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_21de0a2d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/114 E.ogg"
    Rom "还是……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_640335db:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/56. Ed.ogg"
    Ant "快去吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2d5d93dd:


    "……哦，不对，还有奥利娅。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7c4c0b5d:


    "我怎么能把妹妹给忘了呢？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_bd182794:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/57. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我知道我想要什么了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_0cd62da7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/58. Y.ogg"
    Ant "我想带我妹妹去迪士尼乐园玩。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2888cb1a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/116 E.ogg"
    Rom "你想怎么整？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_57caefed:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/117 S.ogg"
    Rom "要抢银行还是怎么的？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f8af47c8:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/59.Ne.ogg"
    Ant "不用，只要抓住那个连环杀手就行了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6b654377:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.To.ogg"
    Ant "绑架案都是他干的，只要抓住他，"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_44d26a6e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.E.ogg"
    Ant "警察就会奖励我们一大笔钱。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_a593dc05:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/118 D.ogg"
    Rom "你真觉得帮忙抓了人，那个警督就会给你钱？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7ddf4d7b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/119 Po.ogg"
    Rom "他顶多给你块警察手表之类的！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_2d4bd537:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "你到底帮不帮我抓犯人？给我个准话。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_862d4bdf:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/120 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "我都说了，我们是个团队。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c4de9798:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/121 K.ogg"
    Rom "有什么事都一起行动。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c50213fe:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.Ho.ogg"
    Ant "好吧。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_090728aa:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/60.Te.ogg"
    Ant "我们要是知道该从哪找起……"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_0fc81ef7:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/122 S.ogg"
    Rom "等等！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_f8c3b8e8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/123 By.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙不是说，他听到有人在哭吗？就墓地后面那片全是枯树叶的地方。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_b2829d5e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/124 G.ogg"
    Rom "肯定是卡嘉。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_70a46197:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/61.Ka.ogg"
    Ant "你有什么计划？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_00483945:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/125 T.ogg"
    Rom "我这赶时间，没法跟你展开说。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7d63657a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/126 Da.ogg"
    Rom "一个小时以后，波琳娜家见。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c9eba42b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/127 N.ogg"
    Rom "哦不对，一个半小时以后！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_c4c8c81d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/128 Z.ogg"
    Rom "你应该知道她家在哪吧？"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_7ce67d99:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/63. Du.ogg"
    Ant "好，到时候见。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_d49f756b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/129 O.ogg"
    Rom "好！那我走了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_4e6ec95c:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/178 S.ogg"
    Bya "哟，谁来了这是！呵！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_6f4ec44d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/179 Br.ogg"
    Bya "你丢下我，跑去陪你那个好朋友了。"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_ddb6ef0e:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/180 Aes.ogg"
    Bya "他还说我们是战神金刚小队呢，呵！"


translate chinese d4_school_fox_voltron_13501e1c:


    "有那么一会儿，我认真想过，要是叫上拜沙，他说不定能帮我们找到卡嘉？可他要是搞砸了一切，我又该怎么办？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_c510ea04:


    "我相信罗姆卡是真拿我当朋友的，但我很讨厌他身边的马屁精跟班拜沙。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_e5aeffe6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/81. Che.ogg"
    Ant "哟，你怎么忽然变成爱发牢骚的小姑娘了？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_d5e3594c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/82.Vot.ogg"
    Ant "没想到你这么喜欢演小女生啊。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_3d3282d4:


    "他恶毒地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_fec2877d:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/183 Da.ogg"
    Bya "滚你妈的！你确实算是我朋友……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_7b328d9e:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/184 Es.ogg"
    Bya "可你要是消失了，我压根就不会想你。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_7335fc72:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/185 V.ogg"
    Bya "你……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_a3bb252c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/70. Da.ogg"
    Ant "走开。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_35bc2de8:


    "他把那包瓜子啪一下扔到我脚边，离开了学校操场，看那样子就很不服气。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_aa7f5747:


    "我等了很久很久，这恐怕是我人生里最长的一个半小时了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_72f8f763:


    "一个半小时以后，我感觉脑子好像让人扔进了搅拌机，搅成了一堆灰色的碎块。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_590c2412:


    "各种焦虑的念头在脑子里一同蹦了出来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_3f177ad6:


    "卡嘉失踪了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_595d6386:


    "森林。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_73616d6f:


    "连环杀手。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_be40da98:


    "墓穴、墓地，还有十字架……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_c1944120:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/130 A.ogg"
    Rom "拜沙呢？吓尿了，不敢来了？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_f3e1a99b:


    "罗姆卡脸上挂着灿烂的笑容，我一看就知道他跟波琳娜进展挺顺利的，没必要打听了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_498dd222:


    "罗姆卡跟我闹着玩，从旁边撞了撞我。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_c9ec9806:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/131 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "走吧！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_43aa68e2:


    "到这个点了，其他人不是在家里做晚饭，看电视，就是为了无聊的事情吵架。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_2622c734:


    "好几户人家的门廊上都有人站那抽烟，个个脸色铁青。院里的水井嘎吱作响。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_34ee9526:


    "暴风雪席卷了村庄。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_c1a9f703:


    "不过我怕的倒不是暴风雪。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_e0844538:


    "面前的森林越来越近了。我都不知道是我们进入了森林，还是森林用它长满尖牙的大嘴，吞噬了我们。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_64456540:


    "两旁的松树弯着腰，在风中吱吱作响，"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_3164a1eb:


    "针叶林里伸出一道道长长的树影。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_8953ad87:


    "我们走进了防风林，谁也没说话。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_b2210ed3:


    "山谷里流淌着白雾，它的尾巴在空中打着旋，跳着幽灵般的舞蹈。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_a1249dfd:


    ""


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_9e7c9b8e:


    "脚下的积雪嗤嗤作响。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_e8613c9a:


    "周围各种隆起的形状，让我想起了葬礼上埋人的小土堆，那些扭曲的树木，则像十字架。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_615d7593:


    ""


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_ff9c6091:


    "时间变得毫无意义。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_ee1f7635:


    "不知道过了多久，我们终于走到了一堆枯树叶面前，停了下来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_7c720dd0:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/132 Z.ogg"
    Rom "好……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_a9f05e41:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/133 P.ogg"
    Rom "搜索行动开始。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_88a87e57:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/134 D.ogg"
    Rom "不管是卡嘉的还是那个绑匪的，反正别放过任何一条线索，我们俩也别离得太远。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_94160ac3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/135 E.ogg"
    Rom "赶紧搞完赶紧撤。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_7855db1a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/136 U.ogg"
    Rom "再过一个小时，这地方就黑得伸手不见五指了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_ba502f96:


    "可我们找了很久还是什么都没找到，这该死的森林太会藏秘密了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_3b4d70e0:


    "我们正准备回家，身后的山谷里忽然响起了树枝断裂的噼啪声，吓得一群乌鸦飞上了天空。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_273756c8:


    "罗姆卡沉着地拔出小刀，戳向面前的黑暗。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_cd6ab035:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/138 S.ogg"
    Rom "听见没有？附近有人。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_cc0bdf99:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/139 V.ogg"
    Rom "说不定就是那个连环杀手。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_16f779eb:


    "黑夜好像听见了他的话。薄暮和雾气之中，站了个又高又吓人的剪影。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_2fd2cf25:


    "雾中的树桩和树枝都变得朦朦胧胧的。那影子比它们都要高大，而且正快步穿过迷雾，径直向我们走来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_5ceddc91:


    "那影子走过来的时候折断了不少树枝。我听那声音就知道，这应该不是鬼，是某种有实体的东西。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_c54ec41f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/74. Cht.ogg"
    Ant "怎么办？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_f0ba1c0c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/140 A.ogg"
    Rom "我他妈怎么知道！是你想抓他不是我！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_5b6b6abe:


    "那影子跳过好几截倒在地上的树桩子，朝我们跑了过来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_774ff24c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/141 N.ogg"
    Rom "别傻站着，抄家伙！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_0eb93be3:


    "我费了好大劲，才勉强拔出来根{u}拉普塔{/u}球棒那么长的树枝，手上沾满了黑黑的泥巴灰，还抖个不停。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_210b39bc:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/142 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "别怕，我以前跟大人打过架。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_477e0c28:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/143 G.ogg"
    Rom "不过……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_b4ed2aff:


    "罗姆卡还想逞英雄，但他的声音在颤抖。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_df78ea88:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/144 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "你可别扔下我跑了！听见没有？！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_17045798:


    "我默默点了点头。那个人影看样子是生气了，伸手从兜里掏了个什么东西出来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_028b2eee:


    "我那很能打的兄弟跟个疯子似的叫了起来，边叫还边挥刀子。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_dd364f5a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/145 A.ogg"
    Rom "啊——啊——啊！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_5448a3e2:


    "我也跟着叫了起来。不过我这基本上是吓的。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_655f972b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/75. ААА.ogg"
    Ant "啊——啊——啊！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_8a3c4236:


    "接着，我们两个都愣在了原地，手里的树枝也掉在了地上。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_bd69da37:


    "眼前的是马卡洛夫手枪的枪管。我们死死盯着它，吓得往后退了好几步。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_ccc796ad:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/01 P.ogg"
    Noname "皮亚蒂法诺夫！操！把刀扔了！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_887eeed2:


    "神秘人一步步走到了月光下，我这时候才终于看清楚，面前的人是高级警督吉洪诺夫。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_4df26078:


    "他皱了皱眉，扭头吐了口唾沫，然后死死盯着我们，盯得我们都不敢看他。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_4967dece:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/02 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "操！真倒霉！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_d608c8eb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/03 To.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我还得解决你们两个。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_e5e38909:


    "罗姆卡阴惨惨地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_9f939b80:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/146 T.ogg"
    Rom "我就知道，连环杀手就躲在条子里！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_0801ef7b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/76.Po.ogg"
    Ant "放我们走吧！我们保证不乱说话！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_4f433560:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/05 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "都给我闭嘴！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_38a77443:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/06 Ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我他妈在寒风里蹲点了整整四个小时，都让你们给搅了！小兔崽子！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_4df1e688:


    "我们尴尬地垂下了双手。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_c00ee4b8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/07 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "上车。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_dismiss_321f79aa:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/08 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "等到了局子里，你们两个给我好好说说跑这来干嘛的！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_facf0ecb:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/63. Nu.ogg"
    Ant "诶呀，拜沙，你别生气……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_21ae59f3:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/64. Ro.ogg"
    Ant "罗姆卡就是有点发昏，你也别怪他。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_a806b6bf:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/65. A.ogg"
    Ant "再说了，我怎么会忘了你呢。来，我送你样东西。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_16c5f359:


    "我把画好的战神金刚递给了拜沙。这张画画得比之前的好多了，画上有五个小狮子机器人，合在一起组成了个超大的人形机器人。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_13086e80:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/186 Ni.ogg"
    Bya "哇塞！给我的，呵？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_578118fe:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/187 Sp.ogg"
    Bya "托沙，谢谢你！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_734f0566:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/66. Ch.ogg"
    Ant "没什么。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_359dd249:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/67. Che.ogg"
    Ant "一个半小时以后，波琳娜家见。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_aa90e1b9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/68.Na .ogg"
    Ant "我们有点急事要商量。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_04cf846b:


    "拜沙开心得脸都红了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_a6391dff:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/188 Ch.ogg"
    Bya "你们两个要干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_86c41c5b:


    "我心里盘算着我们有几成把握，同时冲他难过地笑了笑。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_90058ddd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/69. Po.ogg"
    Ant "尽量不失踪。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_72f8f763:


    "一个半小时以后，我感觉脑子好像让人扔进了搅拌机，搅成了一堆灰色的碎块。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_590c2412:


    "各种焦虑的念头在脑子里一同蹦了出来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_3f177ad6:


    "卡嘉失踪了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_595d6386:


    "森林。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_73616d6f:


    "连环杀手。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_be40da98:


    "墓穴、墓地，还有十字架……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_d89e1a0b:


    "到了傍晚，拜沙才从远处慢慢走过来。那地方离我们约好的碰头地点，隔了整整一个街区。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_6decf356:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/189 Ch.ogg"
    Bya "你们干嘛拉着个脸，呵？想不出冷笑话了？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_b8e91dfb:


    "不过，我现在看到他那张丑脸倒是挺开心的。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_2151100e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/157 V.ogg"
    Rom "兄弟们，集合！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_f3e1a99b:


    "罗姆卡脸上挂着灿烂的笑容，我一看就知道他跟波琳娜进展挺顺利的，没必要打听了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_498dd222:


    "罗姆卡跟我闹着玩，从旁边撞了撞我。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_75a0477c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/158 N.ogg"
    Rom "走吧，先生们！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_3144e38b:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/190 Eto.ogg"
    Bya "一个高兴，一个难过。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_fb65bfb2:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/191Fig.ogg"
    Bya "你们俩真奇怪，呵。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_43c2b989:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/159 A.ogg"
    Rom "别想太多，拜沙。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_6b0c0415:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/160 At.ogg"
    Rom "不然你最后一个脑细胞也要炸了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_43aa68e2:


    "到这个点了，其他人不是在家里做晚饭，看电视，就是为了无聊的事情吵架。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_2622c734:


    "好几户人家的门廊上都有人站那抽烟，个个脸色铁青。院里的水井嘎吱作响。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_34ee9526:


    "暴风雪席卷了村庄。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_c1a9f703:


    "不过我怕的倒不是暴风雪。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_e0844538:


    "面前的森林越来越近了。我都不知道是我们进入了森林，还是森林用它长满尖牙的大嘴，吞噬了我们。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_64456540:


    "两旁的松树弯着腰，在风中吱吱作响，"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_3164a1eb:


    "针叶林里伸出一道道长长的树影。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_8953ad87:


    "我们走进了防风林，谁也没说话。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_b2210ed3:


    "山谷里流淌着白雾，它的尾巴在空中打着旋，跳着幽灵般的舞蹈。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_241b0628:


    "附近有股教堂里那种蜡烛的味道，弄得我脑子迷迷糊糊的。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_9e7c9b8e:


    "脚下的积雪嗤嗤作响。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_e8613c9a:


    "周围各种隆起的形状，让我想起了葬礼上埋人的小土堆，那些扭曲的树木，则像十字架。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_efbacbcd:


    "寒风在怒吼。结冰的沼泽里，黑暗在哀嚎，咕嘟咕嘟冒着泡。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_ff9c6091:


    "时间变得毫无意义。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_ee1f7635:


    "不知道过了多久，我们终于走到了一堆枯树叶面前，停了下来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_7c720dd0:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/132 Z.ogg"
    Rom "好……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_a9f05e41:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/133 P.ogg"
    Rom "搜索行动开始。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_88a87e57:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/134 D.ogg"
    Rom "不管是卡嘉的还是那个绑匪的，反正别放过任何一条线索，我们俩也别离得太远。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_e0123235:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/164 E.ogg"
    Rom "赶紧搞完赶紧撤。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_7855db1a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/136 U.ogg"
    Rom "再过一个小时，这地方就黑得伸手不见五指了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_2e489ff2:


    "地上横着不少让风吹倒的树。我们小心翼翼地跨过去，希望能找到点什么线索。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_60761302:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/192 Hr.ogg"
    Bya "乌漆嘛黑的，什么都没找到，呵。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_45ea8e7f:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/193 Da.ogg"
    Bya "回家吧。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_3e82c87e:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/194 Opa.ogg"
    Bya "诶唷！诶，诶！瞧，这是什么……？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_c9bf7dbf:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/195 A.ogg"
    Bya "我今天真走运！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_e7c2cbb6:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/196 Br.ogg"
    Bya "兄弟们！我找到了！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_b8b74826:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/197 Eto.ogg"
    Bya "瞧，卡嘉的钱包！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_b6bb2f48:


    "接着，我就听到了一声强忍在喉咙里的尖叫。我完全不知道这是谁发出来的，是拜沙，罗姆卡，还是我？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_055fa90d:


    "我终于亲眼看到了那个东西，不过我还是不敢相信那是真实存在的。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_7ce2da11:


    "拜沙吓得踉跄了几步，扑通一声摔进了雪堆里，头发全白了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_73e86ca6:


    "我看着他伸手指向面前的空气，手指抖得跟筛糠一样。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_644b54a7:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/199 Be.ogg"
    Bya "咩……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_30c17206:



    voice "voice/byasha/4day/199 Beee.ogg"
    Bya "咩——！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_440858d5:


    "拜沙好像让什么东西咬了一口似的，猛地跳起来，转身就跑。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_7a023706:


    "罗姆卡都没朝拜沙逃跑的方向望一眼。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_79fd6086:


    "他屏住呼吸，眼睛都不眨一下，就这么直勾勾地盯着自己面前的东西。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_1470b953:


    "我那两条腿不知不觉地动了起来，带着我直直走向那个恐怖到无法形容的东西。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_7bf26445:


    "我犹豫着拨开了针叶织成的帷幔。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_f79eb936:


    "云杉后面是一块小小的林间空地，那地方以前让雷劈过，起过火。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_7abdc283:


    "空地中间是围成圈的焦黑树桩。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_bdf308e9:


    "树桩围成的圈子里面……有座黑色车库。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_24d9364e:


    "车库四面光滑，通体乌黑。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_d18dc8d6:


    "就好像是吸收了黑暗本身一样。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_866ed098:


    "这座车库给人感觉不仅仅是个大铁箱子，它就跟活的一样，"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_bad3be52:


    "能从一个地方一下跑到另一个地方去。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_ad1fd0db:


    "它就像只外壳光滑，从头黑到脚的食腐昆虫。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_bcbf95ee:


    "我们目不转睛地盯着它，它也用它那颗闪着红光的眼睛仔细盯着我们。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_b07742e7:


    "车库的发电机发出低沉的嗡嗡声，听着有种危险的感觉。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_9ebff27f:


    "“那不是什么眼睛，是发电机的灯泡！”我努力说服自己。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_3b795bc6:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/166 ot.ogg"
    Rom "门没锁。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_e5e1007e:


    "我想咽口口水压压惊，可我的嘴巴干得跟沙漠一样。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_6bec22d8:


    "车库的门开着，黑暗就在门里打着转。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_a303082c:


    "我感觉有谁拍了我一下，回头一看，是罗姆卡把手搭在了我肩膀上。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_5168fe0b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/167 po.ogg"
    Rom "去不去？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_17830e4e:


    "他现在一点也不像个孩子，倒挺像个饱经风霜的老人。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_06b06def:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Kuda.ogg"
    Ant "去哪儿？进车库里？你疯了？！"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_54004e6a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Davai.ogg"
    Ant "还是回去通知吉洪诺夫警督吧。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_fe6cb9bd:


    "罗姆卡朝脚边吐了口唾沫。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_1cc0b609:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/169 Ne.ogg"
    Rom "别傻了，托沙。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_5185e1b5:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/170 T.ogg"
    Rom "还吉洪诺夫，他找遍了森林连个连指手套都找不到。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_280db1d6:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/171Da.ogg"
    Rom "怂逼才跟条子合作，尤其是我们俩都上了他们那个少年犯名单……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_740dd6b4:


    "眼前的少年犯掏出他那把标志性的小刀，看着我说道："


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_4636615c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/172 m.ogg"
    Rom "连环杀手可能会跑回他这个窝里来。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_c4a3c302:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/173 E.ogg"
    Rom "我们说不定能趁他不注意，直接把他拿下。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_87bb62e4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/174 En.ogg"
    Rom "要不然，下次就轮到他来埋伏我们了。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_9b3d1ffc:


    Ant_m "那几个戴面具的孩子说，连环杀手是村里一个成年人……"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_c8100ccc:


    Ant_m "就我们两个，真能打得过他吗？"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_408a92e1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/175 V.ogg"
    Rom "过这村就没这店了，兄弟。"


translate chinese d4_byash_choice_call_0cffac99:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/176 T.ogg"
    Rom "去还是不去，赶紧决定！"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_3136da68:


    "车库里传出一阵嘶哑的笑声，听得我毛骨悚然。"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_828d56d3:


    "实际上，那只不过是车库门在响——寒风一吹，它就吱呀吱呀地叫了起来。"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_55f34132:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Eto.ogg"
    Ant "我觉得这是凶手下的套。"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_c133d279:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Net.ogg"
    Ant "没有警察陪着，我们绝对不能进去。"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_53899a94:


    "罗姆卡原本就一副愁眉苦脸的样子，听我说完以后，他整张脸都拧了起来，就跟咬了口柠檬似的。"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_9fc03e23:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/177 x.ogg"
    Rom "嘁，随便你！"


translate chinese d4_garage_choice_police_4ba53f9b:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/178 To.ogg"
    Rom "不过我告诉你……条子比土匪还凶。"


translate chinese mold_test2_a273edf9:


    "我们走近了车库。"


translate chinese mold_test2_bbf3dd62:


    "要是没有发电机的嗡嗡声，这个大铁箱子可以说是一片死寂。"


translate chinese mold_test2_3ce16d64:


    "罗姆卡伸手敲了敲车库大门，好像是想确定它不会变成食肉动物的食道。"


translate chinese mold_test2_fb7965cb:


    "罗姆卡见没有什么异样，胆子便大了起来。他把门开得更大了点，伸手在墙上摸来摸去，想找电灯开关。"


translate chinese mold_test2_a1c06f5c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/182 Toh.ogg"
    Rom "托沙，过来帮我一把。"


translate chinese mold_test2_a20cefa7:


    "……"


translate chinese mold_test2_db2c1c70:


    "结果这就是个普通的车库。"


translate chinese mold_test2_4e6f3ebe:


    "这里面有罐子，有抹布，左右两边都有放工具的架子，中间还停了辆车，上面盖了块布。"


translate chinese mold_test2_19701324:


    "反正没有连环杀手，也没有受害者。"


translate chinese mold_test2_b85e32f9:


    "我松了一口气，甚至还笑了起来，罗姆卡的表情也跟我差不多。"


translate chinese mold_test2_f1a89ef7:


    "他走进车库，绕着那辆车顺时针转了一圈，"


translate chinese mold_test2_82b054da:


    "接着又在满是灰尘的架子上东翻西找，搜着搜着还望了我一眼。"


translate chinese mold_test2_474ec482:


    "我这才鼓起勇气，往车库里迈出了第一步。"


translate chinese mold_test2_696bd909:


    "黑暗像蜘蛛网一样，布满了车库的每个角落。不过这里要真有蜘蛛，应该也早就搬家了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tools_676b2bfc:


    "一堆工具"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tools_a4cbb095:


    "一堆生锈的工具。这堆工具就像车库的獠牙，或者中世纪刽子手的刑具。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tools_2a7be849:


    "你要是伸手去摸，手指就会划破出血，铁锈和机油会顺着口子钻进去。感染了破伤风就等死吧。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tools_32930ff9:


    "等等，钳子上沾了什么红红的东西，我得看一眼……哦，原来是红油漆。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_junk_b5062338:


    "一堆垃圾"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_junk_e813d3dc:


    "为什么这堆垃圾看着像神龛一样？这座车库死气沉沉的，像个教堂，哪哪都有宗教的特征，就是针叶林崇拜的野蛮宗教……"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_junk_16e4d3e7:


    "祭坛上的雕像是铁做的，还刻了古代的经文，只看一眼都觉得浑身不舒服……我不想再看见它了！"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_junk_d85744f8:


    "不，不对，这不是什么神龛，这只是一堆垃圾而已！"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_junk_72c5b563:


    "没人在这供奉什么神，也没有什么神龛！这地方经常停电，车库主人只能点着蜡烛干活，桌上的蜡痕估计就这么来的。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_097ef2fd:


    "全是箱子"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_3f7b9637:


    "我一打开箱子，就会看见成堆的绞肉，断肢，还有飞满苍蝇的人头……"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_fdd0eae6:


    "就像是恐怖版的《奇迹之地》，主持人会从黑箱子里掏出流着脓液的奖品……这是只有在噩梦里才会出现的画面。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_boxes_4783b8de:


    "可箱子是空 。就算真装过什么东西，估计也早就给人拿走了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_car_26b1bd15:


    "不是汽车还能是什么？"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_car_8b83e655:


    "一辆车，盖着防尘布的车。不是车还能是什么？里面一个人也没有，没有活人也没有尸体，但有一滩干涸的血迹，散发出阵阵恶臭……"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_car_d6fc7477:


    "好吧，其实这都是我的想象。防尘布底下是有股味道，不过闻着像机油。除此之前就什么都没有了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tiski_c931d7de:


    "好结实的老虎钳"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tiski_b55fe5da:


    "这把老虎钳夹过什么？这两块金属夹什么东西夹得嘎吱作响？又是什么从撕开的肉块里溅出来，洒到了工作台上？拿着老虎钳的手还在使力，钳子的铸铁零件受不了压力，直接碎了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_tiski_8290cfa7:


    "……但这只是把普通的老虎钳，我们车间教室里有把一模一样的。它是夹零件用的，没夹过受害人，更没扯过肉。钳子上滴的也不是血，是油。"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_shelf_8860abfa:


    "积满灰尘的架子"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_shelf_53fc3d5b:


    "周围一片昏暗，光线照不到架子，也就是说，黑暗里藏着什么都有可能。要是有人躲在蜘蛛网后面看着我怎么办？我还是踮起脚看一眼为妙……"


translate chinese d4_garage_lookaround_shelf_5f13944b:


    "不，一个人也没有，只有一堆旧破烂和灰尘。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_91dcf95c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/183 r.ogg"
    Rom "啊，全是破铜烂铁！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_eff7be55:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/184 ok.ogg"
    Rom "真他妈无聊。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_c0ee07ab:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/185 K.ogg"
    Rom "就这么个破车库还搬来搬去的，这是哪个白痴想出来的好主意？"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_76b71c8e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/186 Po.ogg"
    Rom "走吧。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_0432436d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/10 Aga.ogg"
    Ant "好！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_9f213072:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/10 Da.ogg"
    Ant "我们快回去找拜沙吧，他肯定吓坏了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_538678fb:


    "我走出了车库，外面也正好下起了雪。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_f5c1755b:


    "罗姆卡也大步朝车库门走去，可他走着走着忽然停了下来，盯着那辆车看了一会。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_004612cf:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/187 S.ogg"
    Rom "我说，来都来了，干嘛要空着手回去？"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_4cf153bb:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/188 D.ogg"
    Rom "起码顺个磁带机走吧。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_993097f6:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/189 O.ogg"
    Rom "等我一下。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_a29657d2:


    "盖着车的布底下好像有人在抽泣。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_26d83f60:


    "我吓了一跳，差点扑通一下摔进雪堆里。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_b1b6222a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/190 T.ogg"
    Rom "听见没有？是卡嘉！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_46683a49:


    "罗姆卡使劲扯着那块布。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_1217ed2b:


    "我两条腿僵在了原地，鼓不起劲过去帮他一把，只能站在那看着。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_32710e2a:


    "罗姆卡这次没我帮忙也照样成功了：他拿刀子一划，布嘶啦一下裂开了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_ef9f8b54:


    "可是露出来的根本就不是车，是台巨大的绞肉机。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_e7206274:


    "它就好像从地板下面忽然钻出来的一样，而且每个部件都仔细上过了油，灯光一照，闪闪发亮。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_d5fa16a3:


    "这台绞肉机跟{u}《16岁以下及以上》{/u}里的那个一模一样。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_d6668a4d:


    "那种工业大厂做香肠的时候，就是拿这种大绞肉机来绞牛肉的。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_89fcf962:


    "绞肉机巨大的料斗就像捕蝇草的血盆大口，那张大口里有个绑得结结实实的人，正是失踪的卡嘉。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_c8eae1aa:


    "卡嘉害怕极了，她瞪大了眼睛，想要开口说话，可嘴里塞着东西，也只能发出呜咽声。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_459fd937:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/191 S.ogg"
    Rom "快过来！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_51449647:


    "我就像掀起沉重的车罩一样，一下子甩掉了迷茫和恍惚，猛地冲进了车库。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_41478872:


    "与此同时，罗姆卡费了好大劲，勉强爬上了那台钢做的死亡机器。他伸手穿过卡嘉腋下，一把搂住，然后……"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_8b7be8cd:


    "他的膝盖肯定不小心碰到了什么按钮。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_e8b7d976:


    "绞肉机就像肚子饿了一样，咕噜咕噜叫了起来。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_2ba2fe6c:


    "罗姆卡这时候才意识到自己做了什么，大叫一声。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_94b1e4b3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/192 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "操！关了！赶紧！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_2a57e4c5:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/11 Yas.ogg"
    Ant "好！撑住！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_131ef294:


    "恐怖的齿轮还在尖叫，压根就没哪个开关或者按键能让它停下来。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_34ee3d7f:


    "这东西根本关不掉！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_f29ac563:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/12 Nera.ogg"
    Ant "没用！关不掉！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_16e3b06a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/193 Ta.ogg"
    Rom "那过来搭把手！"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_a66c9835:


    "我们弯腰抓住了卡嘉的胳膊肘，想把她拉上来。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_09eda2dc:


    "此时，机器底部的螺旋形装置动了起来。那几个零件刚开始转得很慢，可每转一圈，速度就变快了一点，最后越来越快。"


translate chinese d4_garage_followup_09218290:


    "绞肉机嘎吱嘎吱地响了起来，就像火焰在啃食木柴一样。"


translate chinese sK1_good_89d226dd:


    "卡嘉发出了破碎的哀号。"


translate chinese sK1_good_b50ae41a:


    "可绞肉机没有放过她，朝她张开了血盆大口。"


translate chinese sK1_good_406ad609:


    "卡嘉的腿已经被压扁了。绞肉机的刀片离它们越来越近，最后整个吃了进去，吓得我尖叫起来。"


translate chinese sK1_good_ca1e6e79:


    "那两条腿成了双破破烂烂的袜子。"


translate chinese sK1_good_d182f8b5:


    "骨头就像细细的树枝，从肉里戳了出来。"


translate chinese sK1_good_c145da1c:


    "血流到底部，汇成了一汪红色的糖浆，上面浮着白色的膝盖骨。"


translate chinese sK1_good_a349de4b:


    "我还想把卡嘉给拉出来，但我感觉到自己敌不过这台机器。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_fcf2fddb:


    "刀片绞碎了她的骨盆，绞得血都起了泡沫。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_4d52f0fa:


    "绞肉机疯狂转动，卡嘉疯狂哀号。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_4982f406:


    "她的眼球血管破裂，两颗眼球急速充血，最后直接从眼眶里蹦了出来。此时，刀片已经绞到了她的肚子。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_2310e943:


    "它们轻松地卷起了卡嘉蓝绿色的肠管，就像奥利娅用叉子卷意大利面一样。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_6db0836a:


    "车库里弥漫着一股内脏的恶臭。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_b7557614:


    "我放弃了。她明显已经没救了。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_dd0bd106:


    "卡嘉的头无助地晃来晃去，黑洞洞的眼窝凝望着虚空。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_c94714f8:


    "绞肉机大口嚼着她胸腔，吞掉了她刚刚发育的乳房。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_89e41806:


    "卡嘉的血压急速上升，她的脸越来越黑，眼窝和耳朵孔都开始往外飙血。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_ec07fb46:


    "卡嘉已经死了，可绞肉机还没停下。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_48025163:


    "卡嘉的头发缠在了刀片上。只听啪的一声巨响，她的头皮整个给扯了下来。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_85a0bc7b:


    "不只是头皮，她的脸皮也给扯掉了。卡嘉凄惨的死状吓得我浑身发抖，差点失去平衡。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_5f8165e7:


    "这时，一双手忽然搭在了我身上。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_04251cf7:


    "我以为自己也要被扔进去做成甜品了，我以为我也要变成肉泥，跟卡嘉的尸体混在一起了。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_7d234027:


    "但那是罗姆卡的手。他一把把我拖走了。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_a5f37d8e:


    "混着人肉，碎骨头和毛发的粗香肠，顺着绞肉机的铁皮箱子滑了出来，哐当一声掉进了托盘里。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_4b5c0763:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/250 Mi.ogg"
    Rom "我们已经尽力了……"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_bf6c7e0d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/197 N.ogg"
    Rom "我们得赶紧走了。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_f322e321:


    "我用冰凉的手指拉开了背包拉链。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_434c3169:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/198 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "你疯了？"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_2e662d22:


    "我用衣袖擦了擦眼泪，举起宝丽来相机。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_7a0d2766:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/14 Nam.ogg"
    Ant "我们要收集证据。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_ef33aa9e:


    "刀片已经把骨头嚼得差不多了。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_f6f699c2:


    "其中一根钢齿上挂着条扯下来的辫子，辫子上还别着个塑料的草莓发夹。"


translate chinese d4_save_katya_after_21466eac:


    "我把镜头对准了辫子，尽量把发夹也给放到取景框里，然后按下了快门。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_b3fe7568:


    "咔嚓。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_ba7c80e1:


    "辫子掉进了绞肉机里。这台巨大的机器最后嘎吱了一声，就再也不动了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_d8357ea0:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/194 Ka.ogg"
    Rom "你他妈怎么光站着不动啊？！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_fbcf10b5:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/195 m.ogg"
    Rom "我们本来可以救她的……"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_19eae413:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/196 V.ogg"
    Rom "你竟然恨她恨到这种地步！我真没想到！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_bf6c7e0d:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/197 N.ogg"
    Rom "我们得赶紧走了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_33b01cdb:


    "我们跌跌撞撞走出了车库。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_2edf6182:


    "我抓起一把雪就塞进了嘴里，大口咀嚼这团白色的糊糊。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_22031de7:


    "罗曼跪倒在地，抓起雪在脸上搓来搓去。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4adaaefb:


    "我终于离那台巨大绞肉机远远的了！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_bb753023:


    "我连指甲都抠进了雪里，整个人咳个不停，好像要把刚刚看见的一切，都给咳出来似的。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_2e66c4c3:


    "但是那种碾碎骨头的声音，血肉的气味，还有卡嘉的痛苦……我怎么可能忘得掉？"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_eed0cb29:


    "罗曼手脚并用，朝我爬了过来。有那么一瞬间，我以为他让惨剧吓得失去了理智；"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_df6f281e:


    "我以为他会像野兽一样，撕开我的喉咙。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_c4ce8133:


    "不过他只是一把揪住我的外套，用雪狠狠擦着我衣袖上的血迹。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_0b52d536:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/17 Chto.ogg"
    Ant "你在干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_1578b1e1:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/200 N.ogg"
    Rom "今天这事，谁也不能说。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4201ff68:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Ochem.ogg"
    Ant "什么意思？"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_7bc52ad8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/201 N.ogg"
    Rom "就是不准去找警察，懂了吗？"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_d1a917c3:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/202 Ka.ogg"
    Rom "卡嘉都这样了，我们也不可能把她给粘回去。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_92641a8f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/203 A.ogg"
    Rom "我不想跟我家那个老头一样，我不想坐牢！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_218252f5:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/18 no.ogg"
    Ant "但是你说……"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_27a4a094:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/204 G.ogg"
    Rom "是我。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_c7cdd8d4:


    "他恨恨地瞪了车库一眼。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4d1c52ee:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/205 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "绞肉机是我开开的。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4e51021c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/19 Nech.ogg"
    Ant "你又不是故意的！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4dfaf325:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/206 Pop.ogg"
    Rom "你证明给警察看啊。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_83f2d107:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/207Em.ogg"
    Rom "他们正愁找不到替罪羊。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_26a3fa5e:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/208Ya.ogg"
    Rom "到时候就是我蹲进去，那个连环杀手逍遥法外！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_6d17bb02:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/209 Bl.ogg"
    Rom "操！我的人生才刚有点起色……！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4bcbc43d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/20 No.ogg"
    Ant "但是我们不能就这么……"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_77792c3a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/210 M.ogg"
    Rom "有什么不能的！发誓！你给我发誓，今天这事绝对不往外说！"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_93374c0e:


    "他没有大声说出“不然的话……”之类的来威胁我，不过听他的语气，明显是有这个意思。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_77b833f3:


    "我沉默了好一会儿，一直在回想绞肉机里流出来的血和肉汁。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_44911975:


    "罗曼说得对。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_00f288a8:


    "吉洪诺夫就算真相信我们，肯跑过来查，"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_ba456dd4:


    "这座车库到时可能又唰地一下，神奇地传送到森林另一头的空地去了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_ef0737cd:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/212 Po.ogg"
    Rom "求你了。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_a5fc74dc:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/213 Kt.ogg"
    Rom "必须要有个人保护波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_500badc7:


    "我慢慢点了点头，心里加了一句“还有奥利娅”。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_4f9310ee:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/21 Horo.ogg"
    Ant "好吧。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_6d834150:


    "不过，我很怕自己守不住这个秘密。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_dbe02943:


    "妈妈一看到我的脸，就什么都知道了。她会发现我身上有血迹，或者闻到有血腥味。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_b4d6321b:


    "我会崩溃，我会跪倒在她面前，我会害怕自己和家人出事，害怕得大哭起来。"


translate chinese d4_garage_photo_1ff02d4f:


    "就在那一刻，我不知道那个我误以为是家的地方，到底有什么在等待着我。"


translate chinese d4_police_entry_c2152e79:


    "警局里一股烟味混着{u}其布瑞克{/u}的味道。"


translate chinese d4_police_entry_732fe0c4:


    "更里面的地方还传出来塔基杨娜·布兰诺娃的歌声，就是模模糊糊的，听不太清。"


translate chinese d4_police_entry_a83d30ea:


    "这里的氛围太伤感了，不太适合办案，适合办葬礼，我觉得应该没人能在这种地方安心工作。"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_cage_566172d7:


    "“号子”，好奇怪的名字……"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_cage_7b1c6fe7:


    "我以前听爸爸提过“号子”，他说就是监牢，专门关罪犯的地方。"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_cage_6963cbc3:


    "这东西有好多根粗粗的金属条，跟电影里的监狱一模一样，看着怪吓人的。我甚至有种把它画下来的冲动。不过，我要画谁蹲进去比较好呢？"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_cage_fcfe3787:


    "我立马就想到了罗姆卡！他要是蹲进号子里，肯定很不错！"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_mask_bf306da7:


    "旧防毒面具"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_mask_f33d9e0a:


    "旁边的椅子挂了个旧防毒面具。警察还记得要做安全演习呀！真是太好了！不过……面具上怎么没有过滤器？"


translate chinese d4_police_lookaround_mask_74ba0416:


    "还是说，这个防毒面具有别的用处……？"


translate chinese dev_loop_board_e231e586:


    "我摇了摇头，打消了阴郁的念头，然后脱下帽子，理了理乱蓬蓬的头发。"


translate chinese dev_loop_board_2f7e652a:


    "鞋底沾的积雪融化了，在地板上留下一滩水渍。"


translate chinese dev_loop_board_79697e4b:


    "时钟的滴答声很响亮。那些在夜里消失的孩子都成了\"寻人启事\"，贴在告示栏上，死死地盯着我们。"


translate chinese dev_loop_board_a9a18b2d:


    "附近有堆打印好的罪犯照片，我那张拼出来的嫌犯素描画像就在里面。"


translate chinese dev_loop_board_ba28b4d1:


    "附近有堆打印好的罪犯照片，但里面没有我那张拼出来的嫌犯素描画像。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_ccd92193:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/68 Ba.ogg"
    Tikhonov "没想到能在这见到你！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_501d4092:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/69 Chto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "皮蒂法诺夫，你是来自首的？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_7418241f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/179 o.ogg"
    Rom "你真会开玩笑……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_1eba100f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/70 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你说得对，现在不是开玩笑的时候。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_5d98b101:


    "吉洪诺夫随后将凝重的目光转向了我。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_404a0376:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/13 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "彼得罗夫，你交朋友得慎重点，知道吗？我们两个都还不怎么熟，你就已经惹上麻烦了。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_0b332af1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/14 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "再这样下去，你最后下场就是上少年犯清单，就跟他一样……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_8152c35a:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/148 O.ogg"
    Rom "呵，大家都知道你这个清单是怎么开的。只要能结案，你什么事都干得出来！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_57f2d703:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/149 A.ogg"
    Rom "可真凶还在外面晃悠！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_c3342bd1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/15 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "喂！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_e62dc1ec:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/16 Sm.ogg"
    Tikhonov "给我听好了！你要是还不改过自新，就等着进少管所，就跟你爸一样！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_890c8f6f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/150 A.ogg"
    Rom "哦，是吗？我保证会吓你一跳！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_f1d59b1e:


    "看样子吉洪诺夫的耐心还没磨干净。要说正事，就得趁现在！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_8338cee2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/05 Ko.ogg"
    Ant "康斯坦丁·弗拉基米罗维奇，有情况！你得跟我们去看看！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_dc1014aa:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/06 M.ogg"
    Ant "我们发现了一座车库！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_795405c1:


    "我已经能猜到他会有什么反应了。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_469be5c6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/75 Von.ogg"
    Tikhonov "嗯？车库？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_da5019ed:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/76 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我猜……里面放了{u}斯登卡·拉金{/u}的宝藏，对不对？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_0819c416:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/78. Net.ogg"
    Ant "不是这样的，我就是……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_06133775:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/22 Pe.ogg"
    Tikhonov "天哪，彼得罗夫……你跟我说实话，这些话不是你自己想说的，对吧？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_71373068:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/23 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "是皮亚蒂法诺夫让你说的，对不对？他觉得这样闹很好玩。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_44d93692:


    "罗姆卡翻了个白眼。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_166ae299:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/180 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "我就跟你说了……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_ad06657e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/79. Nek.ogg"
    Ant "没人逼我！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_6638c248:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/Yasam.ogg"
    Ant "我真的看见了！就跟我现在看见你坐在这一样！看得真真的！森林里有个树桩子围成的圈，那座车库就在圈里面……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_3307c4b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/79 Vr.ogg"
    Tikhonov "安东，那就是个临时小屋。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_217a9c5a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/07 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "不是，那真是车库！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_197e28e1:


    "吉洪诺夫对我举起手来，表示投降。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_8d2bd42c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/80 Ti.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你知道我说的临时小屋长什么样吗？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_ed74a94a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/08 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "不是……我是想说……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_7536e705:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/81 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你压根就不知道！你怎么知道那就不是临时小屋？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_1af7a2b6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/82 Oh.ogg"
    Tikhonov "本地猎人会在林子里搭这种小屋，拿来储存补给。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_279e8f08:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/83 Mi.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我们搜林子的时候，起码搜过10个临时小屋。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_d882bfe1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/84 E.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你说的那个屋子，我们很可能早就进去搜过一圈了……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_46dd44c0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/09 Hi.ogg"
    Ant "临时小屋不会吃小孩！可黑车库会！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_4940a9e5:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/85 Ch.ogg"
    Tikhonov "黑车库？"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_de1ce25d:


    "吉洪诺夫想了一会儿，边想边用手指敲打摞了一沓文件的桌子。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_a127d8a1:


    "我仍旧怀有一丝渺茫的希望，希望这位警督能把我的话当真。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_5ded9150:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/86 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "街上乌漆嘛黑……小巷也乌漆嘛黑……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_5056c312:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/87 Che.ogg"
    Tikhonov "那座神秘的车库，头黑脚也黑……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_785916d9:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/88 Hv.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我懂了！"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_8bd5b102:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/181P.ogg"
    Rom "嘁，我就说……"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_77d29e80:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/89 He.ogg"
    Tikhonov "哈哈，我记性够好吧？小时候讲的恐怖故事我到现在都还没忘。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_bcb74a7e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/90 Po.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我小时候跟我妹妹讲这个故事，把她吓了个半死。那傻姑娘吓得连着三天晚上不敢睡觉。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_e2bf4544:


    "吉洪诺夫咧着嘴大笑起来。他说的话让我想起了奥利娅。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_8e0799f2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/91 Ba.ogg"
    Tikhonov "孩子，那就是个都市传说而已，已经传了很久很久了。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_52d86f9d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/92 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "大人讲给孩子听，孩子又讲给自己的孩子听，就这么一代代传下来的。"


translate chinese d4_police_voluntary_945436c5:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/93 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "有那么几个故事……尤其是比较诡异的那几个……好像永远也不会过时。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_54925fea:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/09 R.ogg"
    Tikhonov "坐吧。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_1be2271a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/10 Ati.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你以为你现在坐的这是什么地方，皮亚蒂法诺夫？我告诉你，监狱里专门给你留了个好位置。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e1264f7c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/147 A.ogg"
    Rom "专门给我留？我干什么了？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_3929a55d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/11 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你持刀威胁警察。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_54f83400:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/12 Teb.ogg"
    Tikhonov "怎么，你以为这还不够你吃牢饭的？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_9a902cb3:


    ""


translate chinese d4_police_forced_404a0376:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/13 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "彼得罗夫，你交朋友得慎重点，知道吗？我们两个都还不怎么熟，你就已经惹上麻烦了。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_0b332af1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/14 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "再这样下去，你最后下场就是上少年犯清单，就跟他一样……"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_16576e22:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/148 O.ogg"
    Rom ""


translate chinese d4_police_forced_57f2d703:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/149 A.ogg"
    Rom "可真凶还在外面晃悠！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_c3342bd1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/15 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "喂！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_4609869c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/16 Sm.ogg"
    Tikhonov ""


translate chinese d4_police_forced_890c8f6f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/150 A.ogg"
    Rom "哦，是吗？我保证会吓你一跳！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_18c80ffb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/17 Pa.ogg"
    Tikhonov "闭嘴！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_df0a3da6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/18 Ot.ogg"
    Tikhonov "那么晚了，别人家的孩子都回去了，你们跑那儿去干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e7086375:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/77. Ko.ogg"
    Ant "康斯坦丁·弗拉基米罗维奇，我们是去找卡嘉的……"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_795405c1:


    "我已经能猜到他会有什么反应了。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_393eb113:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/19 Pom.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你们可真是帮了我大忙啊！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_8b135fef:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/20 ta.ogg"
    Tikhonov "照这样下去，我也要满世界地找你们两个了！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_1ac2a765:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/21 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你们想干嘛？嗯？让家里人给你们上报纸发讣告？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_0819c416:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/78. Net.ogg"
    Ant "不是这样的，我就是……"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_06133775:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/22 Pe.ogg"
    Tikhonov "天哪，彼得罗夫……你跟我说实话，这些话不是你自己想说的，对吧？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_71373068:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/23 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "是皮亚蒂法诺夫让你说的，对不对？他觉得这样闹很好玩。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_44d93692:


    "罗姆卡翻了个白眼。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_0b3c9119:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/151Z.ogg"
    Rom "妈的，又来……"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_ad06657e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/79. Nek.ogg"
    Ant "没人逼我！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_0653b30f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/80. Yasam.ogg"
    Ant "是我自己要去的，我想找到凶手。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_ef71a20f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/24 Eto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你们是运气好，正好碰上我。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_9e337fbf:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/25 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我还好心好意叫你们回家待着！不听我的！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e9f1e971:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/26 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你们到底为什么非得跑去找凶手？嗯？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_921f3934:


    "我尴尬得低下了头。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e5a00238:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/80. Nag.ogg"
    Ant "我想要奖励。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_07338303:


    "高级警督双手抱胸，深深叹了一口气。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_0ebfe7e2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/28 De.ogg"
    Tikhonov "喔，想要钱？你们要那么多钱干什么？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_67c1cd43:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/81. U.ogg"
    Ant "我爸妈欠了很多钱……"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_0e9c22d8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/29 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我们整个国家都欠了钱！一大笔钱！然后呢？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_31c1e23f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/30 Du.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你觉得你们要是跟着失踪了，这个钱就能还上了？"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_abe8bdc3:


    "我抽了抽鼻子，难过极了。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_6ac6d3b0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/01 Da.ogg"
    Ant "我知道做什么都没用！他们一天不吵就活不下去了！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_af70f278:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/02 Pro.ogg"
    Ant "我只是想让我和奥利娅都开开心心的。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_ef41af14:


    "吉洪诺夫想了一会儿，边想边用手指敲打摞了一沓文件的桌子。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_d9b122ef:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/31 Ne.ogg"
    Tikhonov "孩子，你别哭。都会好起来的。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e2ac7cb2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/32 E.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你爸妈的债会还上的，凶手也会落网的……"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_7ecefe32:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/152 A.ogg"
    Rom "呵，是啊，然后我们国家也会兴盛起来的。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_1c74d7a7:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/33 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "皮亚蒂法诺夫，你说话给我小心点！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_4c4b0bac:


    "吉洪诺夫龇起牙大吼一声。但我为了奥利娅，决定还是坚持自己的立场。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e2bf1d34:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/34 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "啊，去他妈的！"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_e14ad4bc:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/35 W.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我这次就训斥一下你们。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_8bd7c624:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/36 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "但我告诉你们，我下回可不会就这么算了。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_69a35833:


    "他指着我们的那根手指，在空中挥来挥去的。"


translate chinese d4_police_forced_549fac86:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/37U .ogg"
    Tikhonov "再让我看见你们天黑了还溜到那么偏的地方去，我就让你们知道知道厉害！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_a5cf9b6e:


    "与此同时，布兰诺娃也发出了最后一声呜咽，接着整个房间陷入了死寂。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_d3bb54f7:


    "我就像由什么自动驾驶仪牵着一样，一步步走到了公告栏面前，在身后留下了一串湿漉漉的鞋印。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_b283b919:


    "我盯着卡欣尼娅、谢苗和卡嘉的照片，而照片上的人也在盯着我。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_1f22e458:


    "吉洪诺夫的手搭上了我的肩膀，我忍不住打了个抖。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_375d5998:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/38 Eh.ogg"
    Tikhonov "唉，安东，你不知道，我经常盯着这几张照片。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_2e594aa6:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/153 L.ogg"
    Rom "你盯什么照片，难道不该去抓犯人？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_9f5c5118:


    "我以为吉洪诺夫会生气，但他只是默默咽下了罗姆卡抛来的嘲讽。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_9146a48a:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/39 Po.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你以为我不想给那混蛋戴上手铐？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_dd002174:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/40 Vz.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你以为我不想抓着那混蛋的手，把他摁在墙上？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_f82113f4:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/41 Da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我每天睡觉之前和睡醒以后，脑子里全是这种念头！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_820cdd1e:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/42 Zn.ogg"
    Tikhonov "你知道我都梦到了些什么吗？你还是别知道的好！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_2caea3d6:


    "他一副没精打采的样子，就好像他那些念头真的很重，重到压得他抬不起头来。他慢慢走回办公桌，叹了口气。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_7aa742b4:


    "我们谁也没说话，就静静听他讲。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_8f513653:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/43 De.ogg"
    Tikhonov "这就是个悬案！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_c371a61c:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/44 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "没错，我们是找到了孩子的脚印。那串脚印直通森林，我们跟着它往里走了差不多45米，就到头了——脚印消失了。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_9048ca91:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/45 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "接着就越来越怪……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_182ac67d:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/46 Pr.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我们调了警犬，但警犬什么痕迹都没找到，就在那不停呜咽。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_c3f3c8b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/47 S.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我们带了一群志愿者进森林里搜了一圈，走过了两万多平方米的土地……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_9c35e3eb:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/48 D.ogg"
    Tikhonov "愣是什么都没找着……凶手难不成是躲进了什么野兽的窝里吗？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_1fc48dcf:


    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/49 A.ogg"


translate chinese d4_police_common_ac354877:


    Tikhonov "后来有个村民跟我们说，他大晚上听见有小孩在笑。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_a889a6d2:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/50 M.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他说那几个失踪的孩子从阴间跑回来了，就在他窗户外面望着他。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_4eb59dd3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/51 S.ogg"
    Tikhonov "疯了！所有人都疯了！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_5c8be5e3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/52 Es.ogg"
    Tikhonov "证据也跟着不见了……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_ac4e5268:


    "吉洪诺夫捏了捏自己的鼻梁。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_13eb84bf:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/53 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "仔细想想，其实村子以前也出过这种事……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_2ba69f66:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/54 Po.ogg"
    Tikhonov "三十年前，村子里发生了几起失踪案，失踪的都是孩子，就跟现在一样。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_90ba472b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/55 Ho.ogg"
    Tikhonov "警察那会儿也没找到犯人，不过他们倒是救了两个孩子。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_035d96be:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/56 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我留着这个东西当做纪念，从那天留到了现在。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_38166c2d:


    "吉洪诺夫拉开最下层的抽屉，拿出了张老旧泛黄的寻人启事，递到我面前。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_76792f09:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/154 V.ogg"
    Rom "真的假的？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_fcf1e790:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/03 Ta.ogg"
    Ant "你就是当年得救的孩子？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_54a1adff:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/57 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "没错。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_b6781ac8:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/58 ya.ogg"
    Tikhonov "我第一次到这地方来的时候，跟你差不多大。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_5c233b09:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/59 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "那时候是冬天，又刮风又下雪……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_94f17027:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/61 No.ogg"
    Tikhonov "不过我到现在都不记得当时到底发生了什么事。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_b588a649:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/61 Na.ogg"
    Tikhonov "警察是在针叶林找到我的。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_2294191b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/62 Go.ogg"
    Tikhonov "他说找到我的时候，我已经不省人事了，而且浑身都是松针……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_c0849e50:


    "吉洪诺夫歪着头，沉浸在零碎回忆的迷雾里。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_bd981646:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/63 Eto.ogg"
    Tikhonov "也是多亏了那名警察，我才没有放弃这起悬案。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_a90033ad:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/64 Do.ogg"
    Tikhonov "查明真相是我的责任。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_d026205a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/04 Viska.ogg"
    Ant "你说他们当初救了两个孩子，那另一个是谁？"


translate chinese d4_police_common_fdbf4fb1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/65 da.ogg"
    Tikhonov "说了你也不信！是个女孩，她……"


translate chinese d4_police_common_b71a0d28:


    "吉洪诺夫话还没说完，门突然就开了。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_a1ed1153:


    "可冲进来的不只有凛冽的寒风，还有气喘吁吁的莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_c404f2ca:


    "我吓得跳了起来，立马挺直了腰板站好。不过她压根就没看见我和罗姆卡。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_6304cb12:



    voice "voice/lydia/4day/22 Net.ogg"
    Teacher ""


translate chinese d4_police_common_0b120a0a:



    voice "voice/lydia/4day/23 Vi.ogg"
    Teacher ""


translate chinese d4_police_common_77424340:



    voice "voice/lydia/4day/24 Net.ogg"
    Teacher ""


translate chinese d4_police_common_c6c5a0d1:


    "莉莉娅·帕夫洛夫娜捂着脸哭了起来，我和罗姆卡趁机交换了一下眼神。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_4d58211b:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/66 Us.ogg"
    Tikhonov "安静！别哭了！冷静点！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_fa7b684c:



    voice "voice/lydia/4day/26 Da.ogg"
    Teacher ""


translate chinese d4_police_common_1eae7781:


    "吉洪诺夫一把搂住了她，朝我们匆匆点了点头。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_d7dc1155:



    voice "voice/tihonov/4day/67 Br.ogg"
    Tikhonov "快滚！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_6fc5d692:


    "我们悄悄退到门口，迎着寒风跑了出去，默默承受它无情的鞭打。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_51645a36:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/155 D.ogg"
    Rom "倒霉！条子全是废物！"


translate chinese d4_police_common_ba1d3ffb:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/156 O.ogg"
    Rom "我们只能靠自己了。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_b8dff539:


    "就在那一刻，我觉得世界上好像只剩下寒风，还有在黑暗中徘徊的影子了。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_c1be798f:


    "而我们也注定要成为影子。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_31db550c:


    "罗姆卡跟我伸手告别，我也跟着握住了他的手。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_b2a24a4e:


    "我觉得只要松开了手，自己就会在森林里猛然醒来，而且什么都不记得了。不过我要是让谁给生吞活剥了，那我永远也醒不过来了。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_f8a0086c:


    "罗姆卡松开了手，扭头走了。"


translate chinese d4_police_common_52aef795:


    "我站在警察局门口的灯光里，不安地扭来扭去，犹豫着要不要走进黑暗之中。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_59a11abf:


    "村子看起来很荒凉，好像早就没人住了一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_112cabb8:


    "篱笆摇摇晃晃，山谷里塞满了垃圾……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_bf3619cc:


    "等到了夏天，这里一片绿意盎然，可能就会好上不少。可现在正是冬天，到处都是积雪，到处都结着冰壳……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_1285d3e6:


    "我时不时转过身去，看看有没有人跟在后面。毕竟罗曼和拜沙都跟我闹掰了，我担心他们不会善罢甘休。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_20ba5488:


    "篱笆后面的狗冲我们叫着，脖上的链子也跟着叮当作响。不过等我们走到下一座房子门前，狗就不叫了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_043d5998:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/22 Pre.ogg"
    Ant "你想象一下，其实是鬼魂在晃狗链子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_49828320:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/50 O.ogg"
    Pol "我喜欢鬼故事！爷爷经常给我讲鬼故事……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_2bd93050:


    "我们在一幢房子面前停了下来。这幢房子虽小，但看起来挺温馨的，屋顶上还积了层雪。波琳娜把手放在了大铁门上。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_7fe4117d:


    "她紧盯着我，目光锐利，好像能一眼看穿我的灵魂。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_c6512ea8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/51 Vo.ogg"
    Pol "嗯，我平时不是总跟你说我爷爷人有多好，多聪明，多体贴吗？但其实……我还有些事没跟你说。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_d929e187:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/52 V.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷他最近有点……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_2963308f:


    "她顿了顿，想着该怎么说比较好。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_33730028:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/53 Chu.ogg"
    Pol "疯疯癫癫的？嗯，大概就是这样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_85904592:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/54 Sta.ogg"
    Pol "他年纪越大，脑子就越不清醒了。我想请你帮个忙，就是，你能不能尽量表现得冷静点？就别让他看出来你被吓到就好。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_ab72117d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/23 Tak.ogg"
    Ant "没问题，长官！绝不让他看出来我被吓到！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_1ea66c22:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/55 Ha.ogg"
    Pol "啊哈哈！士兵，别太紧张！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_6dfaef92:


    "我们沿着干净细长的小路往前走，站在了大门前。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_5ecec09e:


    "波琳娜打开了门。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_ffa859e8:


    "长长的走廊里布满了阴影。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_2c8a665d:


    "身后的门“砰”地一声关上了，把屋里和屋外的声音隔绝开来，连呼啸的风声都听不到了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_7cf1775d:


    "屋子里变得很安静，静得我都能听见波琳娜的心跳声。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_73f10f75:


    "我想伸手捂在她胸前，想摸摸她的胸膛，想用手掌上的{u}生命线{/u}去感受她的心跳。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_44bbce30:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/56 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "你经常这样吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_2a197947:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/57 Ka.ogg"
    Pol "我看你站那一动不动，就跟有人拉了你脑子里的紧急制动阀一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_4993fef0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/24 Fa.ogg"
    Ant "我想象力太丰富了，想入迷了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_a3d9ba25:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/58 A.ogg"
    Pol "啊，这样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_58cfc42d:


    "她脱下外套，挂在了墙钩上。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_d62cdfbe:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/59 Ra.ogg"
    Pol "来，脱鞋，放东西。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_5d021f91:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/60 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我先去收拾收拾房间。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_ffd164a0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/61 De.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷记性不好，老乱扔东西。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_ae0fc743:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/62 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我马上回来，等我会儿。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_a3535563:


    "她说完就像只蝴蝶似的，呼一下飞走了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_ffa169e9:


    "可另一只蝴蝶，那只钢做的蝴蝶，它在不久的将来就会飞进我肚子里。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_2a813ff1:


    "我脱下外套，解开了鞋带。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_begin_devend_01ffdaa9:


    "就在这时，我听到了一阵微弱的嘎吱声。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_ski_d5ceb66d:


    "一副滑雪板"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_ski_d2c0e28b:


    "一副“旅行者”牌滑雪板。爸爸会自己做滑雪板和滑雪杆，甚至还能用蜂蜡、松香和松树脂做滑雪板蜡，他跟我说过是怎么做的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_ski_5b4160a3:


    "正值严冬，有这么一副滑雪板真是再合适不过了。不过这副滑雪板得好好保养，固定皮靴的带子破破烂烂的。滑雪板上还有暗红色的点点，可能是生锈了吧。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_telephone_bed2597b:


    "一部电话"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_telephone_e02e5252:


    "你要是站在电话面前，准会觉得壁纸上的图案像一对眼睛，正紧紧盯着你。波琳娜应该就是站在这给我打电话的！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_telephone_c37e9cf7:


    "她就站在电表下面，站在这块阴影里，手指绕着电话线跟我讲电话。她可能还边讲边按电灯开关，灯光熄灭的时候，她就站在黑暗里跟我说着话。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_horns_eb268588:


    "鹿头，挂在墙上装饰用的"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_horns_a376514e:


    "我不知道大人为什么会在家里挂这种东西。鹿头歪歪扭扭的，头顶还有尖角。我以前看过这么一句话，说是“动物的硬角被磨平以后，就不会受伤了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_horns_683f3c5c:


    "但是，这跟用剪过的指甲往墙上抹石灰是一样的。指甲也好石灰也好，它们都是角质化的东西，都曾是某个活体的一部分。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_portrait_74ed862e:


    "帕格尼尼的肖像画，看一眼都觉得毛骨悚然"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_portrait_6e3f5c00:


    "我认得画上的人。他叫帕格尼尼，是个小提琴大师。大家都觉得他是把灵魂出卖给了魔鬼，才换来这么出众的琴技。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_portrait_73681238:


    "这幅画是尼古拉·费欣画的。他是位著名的俄罗斯画家，革命之后就移居到了美国，而且在美国也依旧很有名。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_portrait_41e81c92:


    "哇，帕格尼尼的手指真长！他的眼神也很犀利！他到底在看什么？他说不定真的出卖了自己的灵魂？那波琳娜呢？她也会这么做吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_66c831ab:


    "奇怪的镜子"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_9b6bcc6e:


    "镜子里的倒影好深邃，好清晰……我只看一眼就移不开了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_38e46394:


    "它比起镜子，更像是扇房门，门背后有个一模一样的房间，里面挂了滑雪板，墙上也贴着壁纸。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_1b9daf17:


    "喔，还有电表。不过电表上个月基本没走过，就好像波琳娜和她爷爷一到晚上就摸黑似的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_1880689e:


    "然后是……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_d4598a38:


    "啊？！那站了个人吗？还是镜子做工有问题，门那块才弯弯扭扭的？{w=.7}{nw}"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_mirror_49362450:


    "呜……就是个狩猎比赛的奖杯而已。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_grandfather_f4582e81:


    "波琳娜爷爷的房间"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_grandfather_d3a70eda:


    "哇，好多破烂，就跟在旧货商店里一样！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_grandfather_819ae9a2:


    "也有点像村里墓地旁边的垃圾场。什么塑料花啊，十字架崩坏以后掉下来的碎片啊，都往那扔。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_grandfather_7c2b6348:


    "我为什么会觉得，这些破烂都是波琳娜爷爷从那捡回来的呢？那些人应该不会扔玩具……也不会扔这种手鼓才对。这个手鼓看着像北方萨满教书里说的那种。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_grandfather_169bad4b:


    "这个……是什么来着？喔，应该是捕梦网。它什么梦都没捕到，倒是捕到了一只编干草的蜘蛛。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround_grandfather_03076bce:


    "呜，这还有股臭味，闻着像解冻的猪油，还有潮湿的泥巴……难怪这么冷的天还有苍蝇在嗡嗡叫。不过你要是在这待久了，估计就习惯了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_4cfc1bc1:


    "我手里脱着鞋，眼睛死死盯着走廊尽头。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_64b5dc8d:


    "走廊里半明半暗，尽头的角落看不大清。有什么东西朝我走了过来，弄得干燥的地板吱吱作响。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_65a93fcf:


    "嘎吱嘎吱！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_65a93fcf_1:


    "嘎吱嘎吱！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_0d42b28c:


    "声音越来越大。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_cf4f436d:


    "我这才发现，我想都没想就往门口退了几步。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_b6cbe8db:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/25 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_0b73b2db:


    "走廊拐角出现了辆轮椅。黑暗里浮现出了个矮胖的老人。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d407c379:



    voice "voice/Hariton/01. Ti.ogg"
    Ded "你就是娜娜的同学吧？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_0363cdc6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/26 Da.ogg"
    Ant "对，我叫安东·彼得罗夫。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_53463894:


    "他的手握着轮椅的扶手，握得出奇地紧。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_8cf9fef1:



    voice "voice/Hariton/02. Ochen.ogg"
    Ded "真好！很高兴认识你！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_a1baa347:



    voice "voice/Hariton/03. A.ogg"
    Ded "我叫卡里顿。‘卡里顿’这个名字来源于希腊语，意思是‘仁慈’。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d06ca50f:



    voice "voice/Hariton/04.At.ogg"
    Ded "安东，你知道你的名字有什么含义吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_bbdc758d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/27 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "这我还从来没想过。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d3f2eaf8:



    voice "voice/Hariton/05. Ot.ogg"
    Ded "‘安东’这个名字来源于拉丁语。拉丁语里有个词，叫anteo，意思是上阵杀敌的人！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_a3d31647:


    "我轻声笑了笑，作为回应。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_c3884267:


    "“安东”的词根明显是“勇敢”的意思。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9ec95159:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/28 APo.ogg"
    Ant "那波琳娜呢？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_57901091:



    voice "voice/Hariton/05.pol.ogg"
    Ded "波琳娜这个名字来源于法语。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d1134cb1:



    voice "voice/Hariton/06.Esli.ogg" 
    Ded "我没记错的话……是‘阳光’的意思。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_4ee1022e:


    "那当然了。阳光，法国迷人的景色，还有巴黎的天空……一听就很波琳娜。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_6764cffe:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/29 Vi.ogg"
    Ant "你很了解名字啊。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_42ad5d53:



    voice "voice/Hariton/06.Ya.ogg"
    Ded "我手里有好几个木偶，每个我都起了名字，都是独一无二的名字。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_405aeaaa:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/113. Kuk.ogg"
    Ant "木偶？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_64425a5c:



    voice "voice/Hariton/07. Pol.ogg"
    Ded "波琳娜没跟你说过么？我以前是剧院里的木偶师。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_44a0ec25:



    voice "voice/Hariton/08.Pot.ogg"
    Ded "然后有一天晚上，剧院的保安值夜班的时候抽烟，抽着抽着睡着了，把整个剧院都给烧了，他自己也死在了大火里。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_fe142b5d:



    voice "voice/Hariton/09.Ku.ogg"
    Ded "我的木偶也都让大火给烧了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ebe32bf1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/114. Za.ogg"
    Ant "唉，真可惜。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ba8ac7da:


    "我很确定，波琳娜在路上跟我说过，她爷爷是研究人文历史的……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d8f1796c:


    "他眯起了眼睛。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_5bea44ea:



    voice "voice/Hariton/07. Az.ogg"
    Ded "安东·彼得罗夫，你听没听说过，以前的人都有两个名字？一个是真名，一个是专门给陌生人用的假名。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_1e3addd5:



    voice "voice/Hariton/08.Sh.ogg"
    Ded "大家都觉得，要是自己的真名落到了坏人的手里，那自己就要遭殃。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_25146d83:



    voice "voice/Hariton/09.Po.ogg"
    Ded "有了真名，你就可以给人下咒，甚至把人给活活咒杀。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_70750c1d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/115. Ogo.ogg"
    Ant "真的？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_b2dc1da9:



    voice "voice/Hariton/10.V.ogg"
    Ded "真的！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9b01818c:



    voice "voice/Hariton/11.Iz.ogg"
    Ded "人们给动物起名字也不是乱起的，都是经过深思熟虑的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_72787d6c:



    voice "voice/Hariton/12.Za.ogg"
    Ded "比如{u}扎亚茨{/u}，它来源于立陶宛语里的‘zaisti’这个词，有‘料斗’的意思。还有{u}沃尔克{/u}，它来源于古斯拉夫语的‘vlek’这个词，指的是‘拖东西的家伙’。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_c984bc91:


    "卡里顿转了转轮椅，靠近了点，双手抱胸。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_2903122d:


    "我有点好奇波琳娜的爸爸妈妈去哪了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_fb93035f:


    "她从来没跟我提过她妈妈，只说有个爷爷。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_b3370c24:


    "我决定问个问题，好继续聊下去。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_7bd08223:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/116. A.ogg"
    Ant "那熊呢？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_7ccbb995:



    voice "voice/Hariton/13.O.ogg"
    Ded "噢！熊的名字怎么来的，到现在都是个谜。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_6f856b86:



    voice "voice/Hariton/14.N.ogg"
    Ded "我们的祖先非常害怕这种野兽，怕到都忘了是怎么叫它的了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_94fff887:



    voice "voice/Hariton/15.Ono.ogg"
    Ded "这个词直接从斯拉夫语里消失了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_84f97a41:



    voice "voice/Hariton/16. Vm.ogg"
    Ded "现在就只有个比较近现代的解释，意思是{u}‘看着蜂蜜的家伙’{/u}。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_7283cb16:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/117. En.ogg"
    Ant "感觉挺有意思的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_a5ae4253:


    "老人笑得更灿烂了，露出了一排排金属假牙。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9dc48422:


    "他就像举着耙子一样举起了双手，在空中挥来挥去，抓挠着空气。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_039a6521:



    voice "voice/Hariton/18.Sk.ogg"
    Ded "嚓，嚓，嚓……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d1a60132:


    "吱吱的声音让我本能地缩了缩身子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9b95bd0d:



    voice "voice/Hariton/19.To.ogg"
    Ded "{u}熊啊熊，从荒野走到了村头。{/u}拖着条假腿走不快，拄着根拐杖慢悠悠。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ccd0329b:



    voice "voice/Hariton/19.Vse.ogg"
    Ded "村子熟睡还没醒，农民打呼轰隆隆。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_da3e6bc8:



    voice "voice/Hariton/19.Odn.ogg"
    Ded "只有个老婆婆睁开了眼，坐在我身上就不撒手。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_0dee785b:



    voice "voice/Hariton/19.Mo.ogg"
    Ded "剥下我的皮毛做大衣，割了我的肉来炖得喷喷香。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_20bb698d:


    "波琳娜早先跟我说的“疯疯癫癫”是指他会这样的话，那我早就已经食言了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_a47d498c:


    "不过我这反应不能说是吓了一跳，说是很想听他继续说下去，还比较合适。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_413883f3:



    voice "voice/Hariton/20.Po.ogg"
    Ded "传说，这个古怪的故事就发生在我们村里……就跟其他几个故事一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ca715848:



    voice "voice/Hariton/21Vot.ogg"
    Ded "就比如说……这个吧。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_57b736ee:



    voice "voice/Hariton/21.Vpro.ogg"
    Ded "上个世纪那会儿，普通人的日子很不好过。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_c2633147:



    voice "voice/Hariton/21.Den.ogg"
    Ded "大家缺粮又缺钱，就跟现在一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_80f649eb:



    voice "voice/Hariton/22. Po.ogg"
    Ded "农民没办法，只能去……抢针叶林里的东西。这边捞条鲫鱼，那边抓只肥鹅。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_fc313381:



    voice "voice/Hariton/23.A.ogg"
    Ded "可猎场的看守人……他不拦着这些农民就算了，还带头偷猎。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_df0a931b:



    voice "voice/Hariton/24.S.ogg"
    Ded "后来嘛，他就成了全村最有钱的人，地窖里堆满了吃的用的，多到塞都塞不下。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_0e2271e4:



    voice "voice/Hariton/25.Tak.ogg"
    Ded "这个看猎场的去到哪就吹到哪，张口闭口‘这林子是我的！我一人说了算！’"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ec371c7c:



    voice "voice/Hariton/26.Ob.ogg"
    Ded "他很快就成了家，置办了个小宅子，又雇了一群仆人。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_f6322e9f:



    voice "voice/Hariton/27.E.ogg"
    Ded "看猎场的那天弄了一大桌的菜，从白天吃到了晚上，吃了整整一天，大家也都吃得高高兴兴的。可到了晚上，钟刚敲完第十二下，外面的狗就叫起来了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9f8c341c:



    voice "voice/Hariton/29. Ed.ogg"
    Ded "‘去，’他冲仆人喊道，‘给狗扔几块骨头。’"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_aa83d441:



    voice "voice/Hariton/30.Ch.ogg"
    Ded "过了一会儿，有人来敲门了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_c7117d16:



    voice "voice/Hariton/31. Ede.ogg"
    Ded "‘去，’他冲家人喊道，‘把敲门的给我赶走。’"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_616375d4:



    voice "voice/Hariton/32.O.ogg"
    Ded "仆人和家人出去了就没回来，桌子旁边就剩下他一个人了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_7f8afd2a:



    voice "voice/Hariton/33.Sl.ogg"
    Ded "他听到外面的狗嚎了一声，就又没声了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_fc0715cd:



    voice "voice/Hariton/34.E.ogg"
    Ded "然后！外面有人砸他家的门了！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_2103ed31:



    voice "voice/Hariton/34.B.ogg"
    Ded "砰砰砰，砰砰砰！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_e668ed8f:


    "他说的这个故事太诡异了。我舔了舔干巴巴的嘴唇，本能地朝老人身后望了一眼，心里祈祷着波琳娜能赶紧过来叫我，别让他再说下去了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_78b837d8:


    "可卡里顿背后只有扭动的影子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_2b4fc4e9:



    voice "voice/Hariton/35.E.ogg"
    Ded "看猎场的吓得要死，赶紧跑地窖里去了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_60a7e4ba:



    voice "voice/Hariton/35.Z.ogg"
    Ded "他砰一下关上地窖门，反锁好。外面忽然响起了个声音。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_c1663a9b:



    voice "voice/Hariton/36. M.ogg"
    Ded "亲爱的，是我，你老婆。你快开门呀。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_d50c0488:



    voice "voice/Hariton/37.V.ogg"
    Ded "打死我也不开！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_a56b6c35:



    voice "voice/Hariton/38. G.ogg"
    Ded "那声音一听，火了，变得更强硬了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_14e2a997:



    voice "voice/Hariton/39. Ez.ogg"
    Ded "亲爱的，我快饿死了，你好歹从里面给我拿点吃的呀。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_efeb413b:



    voice "voice/Hariton/40.U.ogg"
    Ded "‘滚开！这地方是我的，让你滚你就给我滚！’看猎场的大喊一声，跪在地上默默祈祷。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_e66e5784:



    voice "voice/Hariton/41.T.ogg"
    Ded "就在下一刻，那个声音开始咆哮了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_6b5b6034:



    voice "voice/Hariton/42.C.ogg"
    Ded "你要是不能出来，那好歹给我块肉！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_555a5356:



    voice "voice/Hariton/43.Eg.ogg"
    Ded "看猎场的吓坏了，整个晚上都没敢出去，缩在地窖里抖个不停。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9b40d682:



    voice "voice/Hariton/44. A.ogg"
    Ded "等他缓过点神来，鼓起勇气走出去一看……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9cc6d6f2:



    voice "voice/Hariton/45.P.ogg"
    Ded "……他家人啊仆人啊，脖子上挂着自己的肠子，活活吊死在大路上了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_bd65d54f:



    voice "voice/Hariton/46. G.ogg"
    Ded "一眨眼的工夫，他的庄园里就站满了野兽。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_41badca5:



    voice "voice/Hariton/47.P.ogg"
    Ded "针叶林没有边界，它这块在我们人类的世界里，那块又在另一个世界，一个黑夜永远不会结束的世界。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_39bc5074:



    voice "voice/Hariton/49. E.ogg"
    Ded "看猎场的吓坏了，就想逃出这个受诅咒的村子，可他跑了半天，还是让真正的森林之主给抓住了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ed49474d:


    "我用颤抖的声音问道。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_f1c00476:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/118. E.ogg"
    Ant "森林之主对他做了什么？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_31c69c54:


    "老人歪着头大笑起来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_166962b1:



    voice "voice/Hariton/51.S.ogg"
    Ded "你还不如问我森林之主没对他做什么！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_b82f0110:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/63 An.ogg"
    Pol "安东！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_5f4634f7:


    "老人死死地盯着我，目送我走到门扇那。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_8ea76d0d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/64 A.ogg"
    Pol "安东，快来我房间！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_ed2e6a8b:


    "他沉默了一会儿，"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_bc798f8b:


    "然后笑了笑，就好像什么都没发生一样，转了两下轮椅，往后退了退。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_9621eea7:



    voice "voice/Hariton/52. N.ogg"
    Ded "嗐，你瞧我这人，说起来就没个完了。去吧，孩子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_6693f96e:


    "我这才从恍惚中清醒过来，迈着小碎步穿过走廊。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_1dcfecf7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/119. Pr.ogg"
    Ant "很高兴认识你。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup_743f3460:



    voice "voice/Hariton/53.E.ogg"
    Ded "我也是，安东·彼得罗夫，我也是……"


translate chinese mold_test_52ef9ebd:


    "我终于进了波琳娜的房间，整个人松了一口气。"


translate chinese mold_test_6760dbf0:


    "波琳娜的房间又可爱又干净，就跟她这个人一样。"


translate chinese mold_test_b8342ba5:


    "房间的墙上挂着几个相框，架子上放着一沓沓的黑胶唱片，还有台唱片机，这两样东西一下就吸引了我的注意。"


translate chinese mold_test_2132c864:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/65 De.ogg"
    Pol "我爷爷他没有打扰到你吧？"


translate chinese mold_test_a3b1b66c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/120. Net.ogg"
    Ant "没有，他这人还……挺有趣的。"


translate chinese mold_test_b9f3e5ba:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/66 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "你现在肯定对自己名字了如指掌了。"


translate chinese mold_test_2493dc0f:


    "我勉强挤出个微笑，目光扫过一张张照片。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_player_21cb39c2:


    "一台老式电唱机"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_player_31e9a4b0:


    "样式太老了，不过我挺喜欢的！我看看波琳娜收藏了什么唱片……噢，有“梅洛迪亚”的乙烯基黑胶唱片，还有几张更加罕见的唱片，是南斯拉夫的厂牌“朱戈顿”发行的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_player_e701c2f6:


    "架子上有拉赫玛尼诺夫和斯维里多夫的唱片，还有希布拉·格兹马娃演奏的《威尔第咏叹调》。总之，只有经典歌手和音乐家的唱片，没有托托·库塔格诺，也没有迪米斯·卢索斯的碟。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_player_73e27561:


    "哇，波琳娜连“骨碟”都有！这是用X光片刻录出来的唱片。唱片针在某个人模糊的肋骨上滑过，你就能听到大卫·奥斯特拉赫拉小提琴。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_piano_7cba8de6:


    "一架保养得很好的“库兹巴斯”钢琴"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_piano_d6b8731e:


    "一架“库兹巴斯”钢琴。琴盖上一粒灰尘都没有！她平时就坐在这练琴吧。我来看看她的乐谱上都有什么歌。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_piano_d18ef9b7:


    "亨德尔的《G小调随想》。唔，这名字听着像“忍者神龟”吃的什么披萨。诶呀，这首叫什么《跳蚤圆舞曲》……我也不会弹这个。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_poster_b1ba1448:


    "《美少女战士》的海报"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_poster_3d198f0c:


    "《美少女战士》的海报。这部动画片是女孩子看的。《战神金刚》比这个好看多了！而且画战神金刚也比画水手服战士有意思，尤其是汽车人变形的时候。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_lookaround2_poster_6465883c:


    "话是这么说，但波琳娜家要是有2x2频道，而且她还叫我一起看《美少女战士》，我也不会拒绝。哈！我要代表月亮消灭你！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_099cf71b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/121. A.ogg"
    Ant "这是你爸爸妈妈吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_469a401d:


    "波琳娜垂下了目光。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_cffc2019:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/67 Da.ogg"
    Pol "嗯。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_92d29db6:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/68 Oni.ogg"
    Pol "他们好多年前就去世了……我对他们也没什么印象了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_0c365ee4:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/122. O.ogg"
    Ant "噢！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_9a068c29:


    "我觉得自己就是个白痴！波琳娜是个孤儿……多明显啊，我怎么就没想到呢？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_fcdf3727:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/123. Mne.ogg"
    Ant "对不起，真的对不起。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_6f1c8e5a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/69 Sp.ogg"
    Pol "没事。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_a454ba8b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/70 De.ogg"
    Pol "爷爷把我当成他亲生女儿，一点点把我带大。他的养育之恩，我这辈子都还不完。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_14a5cc93:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/124. Pr.ogg"
    Ant "他肯定很不容易。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_2f4d4988:


    "波琳娜冲我难过地笑了笑，顺手撩开了脸上那绺调皮的头发。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_f04faf16:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/71 Da.ogg"
    Pol "好了，还是别说难过的事情了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_0baa9dde:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/72 Po.ogg"
    Pol "来，我带你见见约翰娜。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_d61bfd97:


    "约翰娜就蜷缩在暖气片旁边。我弯下腰，仔细看了看它。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_74fc11b4:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/125. Pr.ogg"
    Ant "约翰娜，你好。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_b83e12aa:


    "它摇了摇尾巴，一下打在散热片上，然后冲我哈气。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_2e614c5b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/73 Pro.ogg"
    Pol "抱歉，它脾气不好。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_f2c79cd4:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/125.K.ogg"
    Ant "没事，我都习惯了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_2d92707c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/126.Ch.ogg"
    Ant "对了，约翰娜这个名字有什么说法吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_1a601426:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/74 Te.ogg"
    Pol "你还没聊够名字的事啊？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_3c160cce:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/75 D.ogg"
    Pol "有档电视节目叫{u}《海伦和孩子们》{/u}，约翰娜这个名字就是从这里面来的。你看过这个节目吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_b5a30c93:


    "我哼了一声。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_0515aaef:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/128. Et.ogg"
    Ant "那是女孩子看的！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_d0537f32:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/76 Oi.ogg"
    Pol "诶呀！别这样，我也看《战神金刚》呀。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_1c1075b5:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/129.Da .ogg"
    Ant "真的？那你说，你最喜欢里面的谁？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_18ee82ee:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/77 T.ogg"
    Pol "你这是故意考我吗？唔，我喜欢威震天。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_4c361ba3:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/130. A.ogg"
    Ant "啊哈！你还说你不喜欢坏蛋？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_64fe3156:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/78 Da.ogg"
    Pol "他是坏，可只有他能融化我这颗心！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_4dae7dd2:


    "波琳娜滑稽地抓住了自己的胸口。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_8f34aaf1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/131. tiz.ogg" 
    Ant "你知道吗，其实一开始擎天柱和威震天并肩作战过，他们联手打败了赛博坦星球上的统治者，昆塔莎。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_42ec4af4:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/131.No .ogg"
    Ant "可后来其他人选擎天柱做了新首领，威震天就投靠了黑暗面。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_24acca0c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/80 Bo.ogg"
    Pol "恐怕你跟皮亚蒂法诺夫也会遇上差不多的事。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_eb37d98c:


    "我惊讶地扬起了眉毛。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_8508f00d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/132. Nu.ogg"
    Ant "唔，也没人选我当首领。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_c7ea9254:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/81 Do.ogg"
    Pol "我呀。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_1334e9f8:


    "我的脸可能又红了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_e72c969c:


    "波琳娜坐在沙发上，整了整床单。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_44f3ee71:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/02 Chem.ogg"
    Pol "那，我们接下来做什么好呢？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_bc0a0296:


    "她晃着修长漂亮的腿问道。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_d9e903cd:


    "我一看到她的姿势，还有她调皮的眼神，整个人就着了迷。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_23a31fd0:


    "房间里的灯光昏暗，营造出了特别而又刺激的氛围。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_9e9895da:


    "我闻到了一抹淡淡的黑莓香气，还有某种更迷人，也更难以捉摸的东西。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_fb3f7f12:


    "就在这一刻，我平常的尴尬忽然变成了某种解释不清的活力。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_90a3ee96:


    "我想让波琳娜的目光停在我身上，停得越久越好。我想在她面前好好表现一下自己，反正只要能让波琳娜看着我，做什么我都愿意。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_48ddbd8c:


    "我想象自己是出任务的007，正准备用帅得迷死人的脸，去诱惑面前的美女。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_e4655c18:


    ""


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_27947ec8:


    "我想，有那么一瞬，我在波琳娜眼里肯定很有魅力吧？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_71a1d0ce:


    "可我装帅还没装多久就出了洋相。我压根没注意到钢琴的盖没合上，身子一滑，当的一声，正好坐在中间的那几个琴键上。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_970d234b:


    "我吓得差点蹦到了天花板上。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_69a414c2:


    "砰的一声，琴盖合上了，我的魅力也跟着消失了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_51cc3bff:


    "波琳娜吓得瞪大了眼睛，从沙发上弹了起来。约翰娜也吓得不清，从椅子上跳了下来。它爪子一挠，撕碎了墙上的《美少女战士》海报。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_ca9829ce:


    "其中一片正好落在吓坏的约翰娜面前，也就是我脚边。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_736a014f:


    "我一看波琳娜的表情就知道，她肯定特别宝贝这张海报。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_abcc4a4e:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/40 Pro.ogg"
    Ant "对、对不起。我……我不是故意的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_fa283724:


    "她双眼紧闭，嘴唇抽搐，额头泛起皱纹，看起来不是马上要哭，就是马上要尖叫了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_d8630597:


    "但她只是叹了口气，冷静地说了句："


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_01d5be98:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/05Ne.ogg"
    Pol "没事。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_f1f2365c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/06 Net.ogg"
    Pol "绝缘胶带什么都修得好。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_75a3cb8e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/07 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "不对，看样子得用强力胶带了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_357bcd37:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/08Dav.ogg"
    Pol "来，帮我拼一下。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_66d15447:


    "最后一块碎纸片放到了对的位置，整张海报终于给拼好了，整个房间好像也跟着恢复了和谐。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_5449d1a1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/42 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "这是《美少女战士》里的角色对不对？应该是水手木星？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d0291747:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/09 Da.ogg"
    Pol "不是！这是水手土星！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_abf7c889:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/10 EE.ogg"
    Pol "她叫土萌萤，是毁灭与诞生的战士。不过她没有毁灭世界，最后还是拯救了世界。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d8082bbb:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/11 Mne.ogg"
    Pol "《美少女战士》里面我最喜欢她了！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_b5ebdf04:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/12 Vot.ogg"
    Pol "所以……啊对了，土萌萤还有双重人格！很不可思议对不对！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_4c8b2a97:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/13 Po.ogg"
    Pol "她就两个人格，可约翰娜把她撕成了十几片！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_3bf1308d:


    "我看了波琳娜一眼，轻声问道。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_c7771044:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/133. Ra.ogg"
    Ant "你晚上一般都在干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_14a1dd5f:


    "波琳娜耸了耸肩，看我的眼神好像带着点厌烦。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_088813c9:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/83 Sm.ogg"
    Pol "不是看电视，就是给爷爷拉小提琴。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_530eb663:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/84 On.ogg"
    Pol "他想让我当第二个{u}大卫·奥依斯特拉赫{/u}。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_b998c81c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/134. Ko.ogg"
    Ant "这个什么大卫是干嘛的？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_be98040d:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/85 Sk.ogg"
    Pol "是个很有名的小提琴家。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_1c83b9be:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/135. Ati.ogg"
    Ant "你爷爷逼你练琴就为了这个？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_6ae7ffd5:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/86 Po.ogg"
    Pol "逼我？才不是这么回事。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_3c096a75:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/87 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "我练好了琴，就有机会去大城市过好日子了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_228288e8:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/88 Ga.ogg"
    Pol "到时候我就能去好多城市巡演，认识新朋友了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_586cb9ca:


    "我听完波琳娜的话，心里泛起一阵愚蠢的嫉妒。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d718df22:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/136. Po.ogg"
    Ant "你可不可以拉首曲子给我听听？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_a4340c00:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/89 Ti.ogg"
    Pol "你真的想听？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f8ee852c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/137. Oche.ogg"
    Ant "那当然了！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_ce5011b2:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/90 Hor.ogg"
    Pol "好吧……不过我先跟你说好，我今天有点不舒服。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_9eb47e57:


    "她从琴盒里拿出了小提琴。琴身擦得特别干净，灯光一照，闪闪发亮。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_dc9eaa41:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/91 Et.ogg"
    Pol "这可不是普通的小提琴。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_8a5115ac:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/92 Ee.ogg"
    Pol "十七世纪的时候有位制琴师，叫瓜尔内里，这把琴就是他做的。奥依斯特拉赫第一次演出的时候，用的就是它。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_5907c3c2:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/138. Ona.ogg"
    Ant "那是不是很贵？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_c8ea64d3:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/93 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "没几百万美元拿不下来吧。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_691361d8:


    "我惊得下巴都快掉地上了，波琳娜见状笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d207d23b:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/94 Vi.ogg"
    Pol "你看看你现在的样子！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_51198c38:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/95 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我开玩笑的啦，其实便宜得要死。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d4b1420e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/96 E.ogg"
    Pol "我要是有奥依斯特拉赫用过的琴，那我就能住莫斯科了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_5c98f4c9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/139. A.ogg"
    Ant "我知道你是开玩笑的！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_781bd6d1:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/97 Ko.ogg"
    Pol "唔，是啦。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_09c6b58a:


    "波琳娜把小提琴架在肩上，用下巴夹住，摆好姿势，然后把琴弓放到了琴弦上。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_1e586011:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/98 Fa.ogg"
    Pol "《升F小调》。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_0c2d3cd0:


    "琴弓滑过琴弦，整个房间里充满了美妙的音乐。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_7961d7fd:


    "我坐在窗台上静心聆听，不由得惊叹不已。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_39ace428:


    "波琳娜拉小提琴的样子真是太优雅了！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_30a51d99:


    "琴弓在她手里上下翻飞，仿佛能切开时间与空间。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_b3549926:


    "她纤长的手指以非人的速度移动着，唇角浮现出一抹幽灵般的微笑。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_625dec05:


    "这首神秘的《升F小调》，简直就像吹进房间里的一阵清风，带来了大海和远方城市的气息。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_8687d58f:


    "我听得入了迷。音乐的清风一打在我脸上，我就兴奋到快要窒息。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_0e5c8270:


    "这旋律带我飞上了夜空，让我想起了那天晚上，我在森林里跳来跳去的美好回忆。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_26e91b75:


    "不过美好的事物总是稍纵即逝。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_ee0facbe:


    "波琳娜顿了一会，随后放下手鞠了一躬，她带着香气的头发也跟着散了下来，在风中摇曳，就像瀑布一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_cec4d6af:


    "我立马跳起来鼓掌。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_e73369fd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/140. Br.ogg"
    Ant "哇塞！这首曲子是谁写的？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_fbfaf639:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/100 Rob.ogg"
    Pol "罗伯特·舒曼。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_67ea9b26:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/141. Vot.ogg"
    Ant "我有了新喜欢的作曲家了！太……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_8322de20:


    "脚边忽然传来一声惨叫，我第二个字还没说完，就变成了惊呼。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f20c5af0:


    "糟了，约翰娜！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_6cd269aa:


    "我高兴坏了，压根就忘了这小东西还在旁边，一不小心踩到了它的尾巴。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_919a4fcf:


    "约翰娜也没给我机会道歉。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_7e361cc9:


    "它爬到我腿上，紧紧抓着我的大腿，吭哧就是一口，锋利的爪子和牙齿刺穿了裤腿，狠狠扎进了肉里。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f7d47d9a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/142. Ai.ogg"
    Ant "诶唷！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_c99f2533:


    "波琳娜赶紧过来给我解围，照着约翰娜后脑勺扇了一巴掌。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_ea3113bc:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/101 D.ogg"
    Pol "蠢猫！嘘！走开！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f9fb7489:


    "约翰娜跳上了壁毯，跑到门边，用爪子开了门，溜出了房间。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_2ab3ddb3:


    "我摸了摸大腿，不由得抽了一下，估计口子挺深的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_da37089e:


    "波琳娜同情地抱了抱我。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_5ad5bb3e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/Bolno.ogg"
    Pol "疼吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_9399d2b3:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/143. Da.ogg"
    Ant "还好……都赖我。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d04eea9c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/102 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "敢挠我的客人，我要让它知道知道厉害！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f1e9bf87:


    "我担心的不是伤口痛不痛，是裤子，裤腿上让约翰娜弄出了好几个小洞。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_ee7420ee:


    "唉，妈妈看到肯定\"高兴\"坏了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_e217f887:


    "可同时，波琳娜这么关心我，又让我觉得受宠若惊。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_bc2d0299:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/144.Tv .ogg"
    Ant "约翰娜力气真大。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_e1f6465e:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/103 Vi.ogg"
    Pol "你们以后就好了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_14b68f1c:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/104 Es.ogg"
    Pol "不过，前提是你不会让它挠出血挠死。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_2651960c:


    "她转过身去，好像在找什么东西。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d6acc62a:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/105 Gd.ogg"
    Pol "我记得放了碘酒的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_7c108de9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/145. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "没事，不用……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_4f5cc6eb:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/106 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "什么意思？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_bf8cb095:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/107 Esh.ogg"
    Pol "我房间里还从来没死过人，我可不想让你成为第一个。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f80fa462:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/108 Sn.ogg"
    Pol "来，脱裤子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_15565d3c:


    "我想象着自己在波琳娜面前脱掉裤子，只留了条内裤，"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_e3756644:


    "想象着她俯下身子给我擦药包扎……幻想就像滚烫的水蒸气一样，引得我心头一阵灼痛。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f2f1564d:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/145. Nen.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，还是别弄了吧。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_a983db6b:


    "她没把我的话当回事，还是拿出了团棉花，放进个小棕瓶里浸了浸，瓶子里的液体很呛鼻子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d092f618:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/109 Pa.ogg"
    Pol "这位患者，我已经准备好了。来，脱裤子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_c0113c6f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/146. Se.ogg"
    Ant "不、不用了吧。我回家以后自己洗洗就行……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_6115cee3:


    "她漂亮的唇角原本是上扬的，我话音刚落它就耷拉了下来。波琳娜鼻梁上出现了一道横着的皱纹，说话的声音还带着点任性。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_bc9dbcb0:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/110 P.ogg"
    Pol "别逞强了，让我帮你上药。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d859306a:


    "她揉了揉我伤口下面一点的地方。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_bbbaabf6:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/111 De.ogg"
    Pol "女孩子都这样求你了，你再拒绝就不合适了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_b1c4b783:


    "波琳娜大胆走近了一点，抓住了我的腰带扣。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_fb8cd535:


    "我想躲，但没躲掉。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_ed4fafce:


    "她已经来到了我身后，手指在腰带下面动来动去的，想脱我的裤子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_06c80266:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/147. Ah.ogg"
    Ant "别，别这样！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_20f32dda:


    "她咯咯地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_b7b0bf83:


    "我转过身来，发现波琳娜正贴着我的身子，哈哈大笑。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_8b37ae41:


    "她轻轻咬了咬我的胳膊，扯了扯我的腰带。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_26f11cd6:


    "我往后退了一步，四仰八叉地摔倒在柔软的沙发上，波琳娜跟着压在了我身上。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_c1aa79a9:


    "她的头发盖在了我脸上，弄得我鼻子发痒。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_b4215656:


    "胸前传来震动的感觉——波琳娜在笑。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_3b7f4bf5:


    "我忽然感觉大腿那块冷飕飕的……看来波琳娜还是得手了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_eb3b2e80:


    "我几乎半裸地躺在她身下，快尴尬死了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_6b9f8ff6:


    "波琳娜不笑了，从我身上爬了起来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d9b70403:


    "她吹了吹挡在眼前的头发，跟我四目相对，"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_d391a2aa:


    "随后用手托着脸，打量着我。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_be1344b4:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/148. Ti.ogg"
    Ant "我脸上有什么东西吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_7d89b518:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/113 Ni.ogg" 
    Pol "没有。你长得挺帅的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_e5ea81cc:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/149. Sk.ogg"
    Ant "才没这回事。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_cd73fddc:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/114 Che.ogg" 
    Pol "真的，你真的挺帅的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_2868e493:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/115 E.ogg" 
    Pol "你知道吗，我在村子里等了好多年，等的就是你。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_6065c27c:


    "我的心疯狂跳动。我感觉肋骨下面，太阳穴，甚至是全身都在疯狂跳动。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_baaf9502:


    "我忘了自己裤子都没穿，用光溜溜的大腿摩擦着她的小腿。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_4f61e1a3:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/150. Mne.ogg"
    Ant "有你陪着，我很高兴。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_3fa1f655:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/116 Em.ogg" 
    Pol "我也是。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_0b6e0901:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/117 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我终于遇到一个懂我的人了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_f7a5e022:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/118 Eto.ogg"
    Pol "这比奥依斯特拉赫的小提琴还要珍贵。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_4acdae70:


    "我把目光转向了她的嘴唇。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_followup2_solved_21c12443:


    "波琳娜的双唇离我很近很近，近到我能看到最细小的皱褶。她的嘴唇很干燥，就跟我一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_choice_kiss_66efc532:


    "波琳娜微微眯起眼，眨了眨眼睫毛。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_choice_kiss_8a382e0e:


    "我们的嘴唇碰在了一起。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_choice_kiss_fa8dae24:


    "我头晕目眩，仿佛掉进了无底洞。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_choice_kiss_3c7cc0fe:


    "我身体里的每一个细胞都在欢快地歌唱，就好像听到了世界上最动人的音乐——比舒伯特的曲子还要动听！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_choice_kiss_c38cc54f:


    "我瞥了一眼衣柜门上的镜子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_1f462768:


    "镜子里的门半开着，可以看到昏暗的走廊……还有卡里顿。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_46dfc904:


    "他就在半开的门外面偷看我们。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_7fdc1a90:


    "黑暗汇聚成了深潭，卡里顿阴森的脸就浮在水面上。他的目光刺穿了我的皮肉，带着比约翰娜还强的怒意，扎得比猫爪还要深。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_2d22ff6b:


    "卡里顿见自己暴露了，便摇着轮椅往回走，离开了房间门口，消失在焦油般浓稠的黑暗中。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_95c7061b:


    "我忽然烦躁不安起来，觉得不能再跟波琳娜亲下去了，赶紧挪开了嘴唇。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_5b6abd59:


    "波琳娜疑惑地看着我，沮丧地问道："


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_5daafc44:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/120 V.ogg"
    Pol "怎么了？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_323a4715:


    "我从她身下挣脱出来，起身手忙脚乱地穿裤子，提裤子提到第三次的时候，才终于系好了腰带。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a53b7738:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/152. Ni.ogg"
    Ant "没什么。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_afd404bc:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/152. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我就是忽然想起来……我跟妈妈说好了，今天晚饭之前要回到家。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_de6aa49f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/122 Ni.ogg"
    Pol "别走。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_4dae55f9:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/153. Po.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，你听我说……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_9c435c63:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/123 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "托沙，别走！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a5276c59:


    "波琳娜的声音在颤抖，银色的泪珠顺着脸颊流了下来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_f2aa7b94:


    "我惊呆了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_69456865:


    "波琳娜的情绪一下就变了，快得就跟她爷爷换话题一样。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_52b229ce:


    "不过，她爷爷是年纪大了，性格比较古怪……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_706e8f53:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/124 Za.ogg"
    Pol "带我一起走吧！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_8cdffecd:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/154. T.ogg"
    Ant "波琳娜，你怎么了？别这样！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_f8a79cbd:


    "我很担心她，就凑了过去。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a57a5406:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/155. Nu.ogg"
    Ant "你冷静一下。我就是回个家，没事的。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_7cdb5420:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/125 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "我要疯了！我……我也不知道……我再不走就要自杀了！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a76f4545:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/156. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "别说这种话！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a9949f79:


    "她扑通一下倒在床上，双手捂着脸，啜泣变成了极力压抑住的大哭。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_068c5bd5:


    "我坐立不安，迷惑不解，也不知道该怎么做才好。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_55698400:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/128 Da.ogg"
    Pol "我们一起逃走吧！我们明天就收拾好东西，逃到大城市去！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_317df19b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/157.Na .ogg"
    Ant "我们才12岁……"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_7f151696:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/129 E.ogg"
    Pol "然后呢？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_3751328f:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/130 Te.ogg"
    Pol "你住森林旁边的木头棚屋住得很开心吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_c0f84a92:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/131 A.ogg"
    Pol "人一天天地腐烂下去，心就这么被囚禁在这里……你以为我很乐意这样吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_e53beb4d:


    "她弓着背，攥紧拳头，一下又一下地砸着沙发。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_f226a3c9:



    voice "voice/Polina/4day/132 Es.ogg"
    Pol "托沙，你要是个男子汉，你就带我离开这里吧！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_3161afc0:


    "{b}\"得走了。\"{/b}我心里蹦了这么句话出来。没错，我真的该走了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_447df643:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/158. Pr.ogg"
    Ant "对不起，我该走了。你得好好休息休息了。我们回头再聊吧。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_41207962:


    "我咕哝着这几句话，走出了房间。我这样可能是有点胆小懦弱，但波琳娜歇斯底里的样子，我实在是受不了了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_5dfd699c:


    "我穿好外套，把脚塞进靴子里。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_b572d2bc:



    voice "voice/Hariton/18. Skir.ogg"
    Ded "嚓，嚓。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_981fd212:


    "我凝视着眼前的黑暗，感觉下一秒就会看见一头吃人的熊。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a9cf2854:


    "墙的另一头传来了波琳娜的哭声。与此同时，有什么东西嘎吱嘎吱地响着，朝着我移动了过来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_170bd781:


    "轮椅就停在我面前两米远的地方，恰好卡在光与暗的交界处。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_25f39b58:



    voice "voice/Hariton/54.Uho.ogg"
    Ded "这么快就走了？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_46a9c60b:


    "我边系鞋带边咕哝道。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_97afd4ad:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/159. Pro.ogg"
    Ant "抱歉，我再不走，我妈妈就该担心了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_313b906e:



    voice "voice/Hariton/55.Ti.ogg"
    Ded "安东·彼得罗夫，你知道你妈妈的真名吗？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_c1084334:


    "影子在他身后打着转。这地方太诡异了，哪哪都不对劲。我想赶紧走，越快越好！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_7886a00f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/160. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "不知道，抱歉。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_8d1c695d:


    "我很焦虑，嘴里胡乱道起歉来。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_d0ed4461:



    voice "voice/Hariton/56.Poch.ogg"
    Ded "波琳娜怎么哭了？出什么事了？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_c8a9c3e8:


    "卡里顿的金属假牙在黑暗中闪着光。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_9eedf1cb:



    voice "voice/Hariton/57.Po.ogg"
    Ded "我们去厨房坐坐，茶我都沏好了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_23d8fa77:



    voice "voice/Hariton/58.Ya.ogg"
    Ded "蛋糕也切好了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a8fc982f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/161. Men.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈还在家里等我。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_5c6e8ef6:



    voice "voice/Hariton/59.Pod.ogg"
    Ded "那就让她再多等一会呗，这有什么。来，我们去厨房。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_a710729b:


    "他不满地呜了一声。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_e5d92289:


    "我终于系好了鞋带。卡里顿脸上一直挂着强行挤出来的笑容。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_df687039:


    "我站起来，转过身去，使劲拉门锁，想赶紧走。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_ad773283:



    voice "voice/Hariton/Skirl.ogg"
    Ded "嚓，嚓。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_c21d89ef:


    "我要是再不走，他就会用轮椅撞我，把我拖进走廊深处，让我想走也走不了了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_22ce1b93:



    voice "voice/Hariton/Skirl2.ogg"
    Ded "嚓，嚓。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_53b7a7e2:


    "门终于开了。冷风一下就窜进闷了许久的屋内。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_85b40682:



    voice "voice/Hariton/62.Kak.ogg"
    Ded "你的真名叫什么？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_853e32f6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/162. D.ogg"
    Ant "再见！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_702671f5:


    "我沿着门口的小路飞奔而下，在屋子之间蜿蜒的小道上没命地跑。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_d9b27dd2:


    "我在波琳娜家里待着的时候，黑暗已经用它乌鸦一般的翅膀，笼罩了整个村子。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_89b1a8ac:


    "吹来吹去的风，让黑暗仿佛有了自我意识。路灯闪着微弱的光，牢牢嵌在了黑夜之中。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_b059ad7a:


    "我擦了擦额头。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_93896a59:


    "刚刚那是怎么回事？波琳娜为什么忽然就歇斯底里了起来？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_723a79b9:


    "她爷爷为什么要偷看我们？唉，有这么个爷爷，也难怪她想逃跑。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_4f08874b:


    "我一想起卡里顿的假牙，就起了一身鸡皮疙瘩。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_64fdf902:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/228ei.ogg"
    Noname "喂！"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_98b406c9:


    "我打了个寒颤，环顾四周。篱笆附近有个模模糊糊的人影。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_a8a8006b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/163. Kto.ogg"
    Ant "谁？"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_04a14c51:


    "那人朝我走了过来，走到了灯光下。我一看，吓得魂都没了。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_f3cc1ec1:


    "是罗姆卡。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_3ee8509f:


    "他脸上湿漉漉的，眼睛发红，"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_7e7524ce:


    "应该是躲在黑黑的地方哭了一会。"


translate chinese d4_polhouse_after_devend_8e0099b4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/229nu.ogg"
    Rom "哟，你好啊。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_191229ac:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/164. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "你在干嘛？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_77912aa8:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/230 Da.ogg"
    Rom "你……你没来排练，我担心你出什么事了。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_1890e12c:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/231 Kak.ogg"
    Rom "就跟谢苗和卡嘉一样。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_1e7c2304:


    "只听咔哒一声，罗曼手里多了把蝴蝶刀，在黑暗中闪着寒光。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_7c327fa3:


    "罗曼两眼发光，就像是两枚硬币。他的嘴唇更是没有一点血色，就那么咧着，露出了狰狞的表情。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_b6f92996:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/165. Rom.ogg"
    Ant "罗曼，把刀子收起来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_6329e7ff:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/232 Za.ogg"
    Rom "为什么？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_a206eaea:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/233 Kak.ogg"
    Rom "没了刀子，我还怎么从你的肚脐眼一路划到喉咙，怎么剖开你的肚子，看看你这个叛徒长了颗什么心？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_efd6bde8:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/166. Roma.ogg"
    Ant "罗曼！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_17a07128:


    "我肩胛骨那块毫无防备，要是转身逃跑，罗曼恐怕要照着那下刀子。于是我直接往后退了几步。罗曼皱着眉头，朝我走了过来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_07b15211:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/234 Bil.ogg"
    Rom "你去她家了，对吧？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_16c7dfec:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/235 Prav.ogg"
    Rom "金刚战队的右手，我问你话呢……"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_bad92ade:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/236 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "你去波琳娜家了，对不对？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_32a05dc4:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/237 Ris.ogg"
    Rom "你是不是给她画了画？是不是碰了她？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_94249f5c:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/167. Vse.ogg"
    Ant "没有，你误会了！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_fox_f2de6231:


    "我撒谎了。他没误会。而且实际上，我犯的错还不止这么点。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_2caf7c22:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/239Razve.ogg"
    Rom "我是不是早就警告过你？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_116c2fd7:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/240raz.ogg"
    Rom "我是不是说过，再让我看到你靠近波琳娜，我就杀了你？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_1e7c2304:


    "只听咔哒一声，罗曼手里多了把蝴蝶刀，在黑暗中闪着寒光。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_7c327fa3:


    "罗曼两眼发光，就像是两枚硬币。他的嘴唇更是没有一点血色，就那么咧着，露出了狰狞的表情。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_b6f92996:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/165. Rom.ogg"
    Ant "罗曼，把刀子收起来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_96fd1c35:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/241dum.ogg"
    Rom "你觉得我疯了是吗？那我就发疯给你看看！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_ab854db6:


    voice "voice/anton/4day/166. Roma.ogg"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_eaf261e9:


    Ant "罗曼！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_636d5e10:


    "我肩胛骨那块毫无防备，要是转身逃跑，罗曼恐怕要照着那下刀子。于是我直接往后退了几步。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_notfox_560e93b7:


    "罗曼皱着眉头，朝我走了过来。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_common_4188d081:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/244zalkii_pr.ogg"
    Rom "人渣！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_common_985d6a4e:


    "罗曼嘴角溢出了白色的泡泡。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_common_4bbc0f07:


    "他用力抹了一把脸，眼泪糊得到处都是。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_common_868ea046:


    "他眼睛里蒙上了一层仇恨，变得呆滞无神。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_a4fd4910:


    "波琳娜给我的兽爪护身符又救了我一次。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_2d540a26:


    "我觉得时间好像都静止了。我，罗姆卡，还有他手里那把危险的刀，就像凝结在琥珀里的昆虫一样。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_bf92b9ff:


    "{b}\"快跑！\"{/b}我心里的声音像警报一样叫了起来，{b}\"再不跑真要死在这了！\"{/b}"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_63e5ee3f:



    voice "voice/romka/4day/244 zalkiigrya.ogg"
    Rom "人渣！可悲又恶心的人渣！"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_d6be2aad:


    "寒风抽打着我的脸，像荨麻叶一样刺着我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_03b561a9:


    "窗户的倒影里，有个又大又可怕的东西从远处冲了过来，暴风雪紧紧裹着他，就像给他穿上了一件白色的丧服。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_7eebc283:


    "我跳到了路的另一侧，不小心踩在了冰壳上，脚下一滑，摔进了山沟里。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_04411df6:



    voice "voice/Wolf/341 Drr.ogg"
    Wolf "碰、砰，朋友。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_616c76f1:



    voice "voice/Wolf/337 Te.ogg"
    Wolf "你妹、每、没事了。我们说过的。汪、往、忘了？"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_2c23b345:



    voice "voice/Wolf/338 Vs.ogg"
    Wolf "每、妹、没事的。快走吧。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_amulet_1ff02d4f:


    "就在那一刻，我不知道那个我误以为是家的地方，到底有什么在等待着我。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_8cedabd2:


    "罗姆卡脸上的皮肤拉伸得很夸张，他嘴巴张得很大，口水在牙齿之间拉成了丝，表情又狰狞又怪诞。"


translate chinese d4_madrom_no_amulet_c2186774:


    "我忽然就喘不上气来了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_fce5f2d1:


    "天和地都是雪白雪白的，老屋就像块黑斑，矗立在雪地之上。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_9f3ead3f:


    "前门大开着，门板在风中轻轻摇晃。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_02c65b2c:


    "我感觉白霜慢慢爬上了我的皮肤。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_d261f3b2:


    "我攥紧了拳头。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_575521e9:


    "我攥紧了拳头，照片锐利的边角扎进了手掌肉里。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_4e315b85:


    "黑暗渗进了走廊，雪花也跟着飘进了屋里，轻轻落在地毯上。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_23dba9c5:


    "它们就像一群秃鹫，闻到猎物的气味就飞了进来。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_4b0be9a7:


    "我想象着屋子里的三个角落，放着三台巨大的绞肉机。一台绞肉机里关着妈妈，一台绞肉机里关着爸爸，还有一台关着奥利娅。刀片疯狂转动，把他们都绞成了肉泥……"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_1ecdc1bb:


    "我小心翼翼地走进了家门。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_87c5d423:


    "有那么一会，我以为厨房里有谁在说话，但仔细一听，其实是收音机的声音。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_13d5ce20:


    Radio ""


translate chinese d4_home_devend_7bafc210:


    Radio ""


translate chinese d4_home_devend_c84cb48a:


    "我听到楼上也有动静。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_3db7cbd2:


    "我听到熟悉的吵架声，整个人冷静了下来；这还是头一遭。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_7a473da3:


    "楼梯木板踩上去嘎吱嘎吱响。我每走一步，心起码要跳个五六下。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_42d94d1b:


    "我才走了一步，心却跳了好几下。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_33efb15d:


    "爸爸妈妈卧室的门虚掩着。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_c8a9b4bb:


    "房间里只透出来一小点光。黑色的剪影跳起了仇恨的舞蹈，一场皮影戏就这样拉开了帷幕。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_71bd040c:


    "妈妈冲爸爸发出嘘声，手腕往上抬，直冲到了天花板；爸爸要比妈妈高多了，他双手抱胸，两人就这么对峙着。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_a71dc98a:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/125 Me.ogg"
    Mam "都怪你！我们要过上提心吊胆的日子了！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_d1c5bb75:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/126 E.ogg"
    Mam "还有，别给我睁眼说瞎话了！他就在村子里，你明明看见了！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_fcd4b10f:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/127 On.ogg"
    Mam "他知道我们住在哪！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2654c723:



    voice "voice/father/day4/74 Eto.ogg"
    Pap "那个人压根就不是他。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_7339df07:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/128 Ya.ogg"
    Mam "你别以为我不知道你那帮兄弟的能耐。我早就在报纸上看见过了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_b869dfdc:


    "我把照片揣进兜里，径直往房间走去。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_f5e59a6f:


    "我径直跑向自己的房间。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_a7a24b0b:


    "爸爸妈妈还在相互指责，吵得不可开交。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_27b57de3:


    "爸爸低吼了一声，听起来像野兽在咆哮。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_e514b770:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/01 P.ogg"
    Oly "快阻止他们。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_aafa097a:


    "奥利娅站在走廊里，两只小手紧紧捂着耳朵。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_bb17906b:


    "奥利娅会掉进绞肉机里，让刀片啃干净……我摇摇头，赶跑了脑子里可怕的幻想。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_ab56e0f4:


    "我骗了罗曼，他会拿刀子捅奥利娅……我摇摇头，赶跑了脑子里可怕的幻想。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_526f22af:


    "她哭得眼睛都肿了。我看到她那样子，吓得浑身发抖。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_32928d7e:


    "我差一点就能彻底忘掉卡嘉的死状了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2ae3d40f:


    "我差一点就能忘记老卡里顿的奸笑，还有皮蒂法诺夫手脚并用，朝我扑过来的样子了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2ffe2945:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/168. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "怎么了？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_24d8a805:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/02 O.ogg"
    Oly "他们要离婚了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_a338feb1:


    "我抱住了妹妹，把她紧紧搂在怀里。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_d3c89123:


    "我很想安慰安慰她，可我的舌头不听使唤，就是说不出来。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_8cb648bb:


    "叫喊声从四面八方涌来，全打在了我后脑勺上。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_1a68a870:


    "咒骂的话像雨点一样打在我们身上。我们只能紧紧抱着头，就像躲避轰炸的难民。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_5c22eb8e:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/03 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "我想逃走！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_8da83c29:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/169. V.ogg"
    Ant "你想回房间里去？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_9fca7395:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/04 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "不是！是走去很远很远的地方！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_4efba16f:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/05 O.ogg"
    Oly "带我去梦幻岛吧！你不是答应过我的吗？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_88ec629f:


    "我小心翼翼地抓着奥利娅的手，把它们从耳朵上拿下来，然后领着她走过爸爸妈妈的卧室。他们吵得太厉害了，连门板都在震动。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_bb44ce1f:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/129 Ez.ogg"
    Mam "都怪你！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_b67bf11f:



    voice "voice/father/day4/79 Ra.ogg"
    Pap "要不是为了……"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_82fece35:



    voice "voice/karina/4day/130 To.ogg"
    Mam "除了你还有谁！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_38717d0b:



    voice "voice/father/day4/80 Ni.ogg"
    Pap "绝对不可能是我！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2732c8d6:


    "爸爸妈妈也瞧不起他们自己，但在那一刻，我更瞧不起他们。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2dc351ab:


    "我膝盖发软，站都站不住了，一进房间就赶紧把插销插上，整个人靠在了门板上。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_eea08eb0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/170. Pos.ogg"
    Ant "奥利娅，我也不喜欢这个家。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_ee4aff83:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/06 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "可你起码还能出去上学！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_47394893:


    "我苦笑了一下。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_4313de47:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/171. Eta.ogg"
    Ant "学校就跟噩梦一样！大家都讨厌我！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_4ba292b1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/173. To.ogg"
    Ant "只有一个女孩子不会作弄我。但她把我当成条挨了打的狗，很同情我。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_e6c76c16:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/07Tine.ogg"
    Oly "你才不是狗！你……"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_f44df905:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/174. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "我也不知道我自己到底是什么了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_4bf03a4a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/175.No.ogg"
    Ant "不过不管怎么说，外面肯定也不比家里好多少。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_e87b4a64:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/08 Gd.ogg"
    Oly "那你知不知道什么好地方？要是有的话，我们就一起去吧！我们可以飞啊，游泳啊，肯定很开心！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_b2b40cf0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/173. Es.ogg"
    Ant "要是真的就好了……只要能带你一起逃跑，要我牺牲什么都愿意！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_cf4ad8f0:


    "奥利娅的上嘴唇颤抖着。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2e8d1e5a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/09K.ogg"
    Oly "真的？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_9f2c25fd:


    "我苦笑了一下。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_049fb58f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/174. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "嗯，我拿命做担保！"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_7913295c:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/10 Po.ogg"
    Oly "你怎么才回来呀？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_5eefda11:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/176. ya.ogg"
    Ant "我去见了几个……怪人。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_81ba83d6:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/12 oni.ogg"
    Oly "他们也要离婚吗？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_9b3b85df:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/175.  Y.ogg"
    Ant "有个女孩子出事了，我去帮她了。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_f5818d1d:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/11 Т.ogg"
    Oly "帮到了吗？"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_e693c21f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/177. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "没有。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_2338354b:


    "我站在桌子面前，小心翼翼地拉开抽屉，把卡嘉那张照片扔了进去。"


translate chinese d4_home_devend_635b3606:


    "奥利娅在我背后探出头来，想看看我放的是什么，我砰一下关上了抽屉。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_4550171d:


    "就在这时，有什么东西砸在了窗台上。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_7c780c94:


    "有什么东西砸在了窗台上。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c3ac3642:


    "奥利娅吓得浑身发抖，急忙看了一眼窗户。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_7a101568:


    "砰！又有一个雪球砸在了窗框上。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_5d024f0c:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/14 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "你在等人吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_7fe9a557:


    "我没说话，松开了她的手腕。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_8a307fc4:


    "奥利娅吓得哭了起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_68da4db8:


    "我径直走向了房间的另一头。可爸爸妈妈喊一声，我就忍不住缩一下。不仅是喊，还有摔盘子的声音，他们肯定是跑到厨房去接着吵了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_72054b3a:


    "我走到窗边，猛地拉开窗帘，打开了窗户！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_6e481126:


    "小猫头鹰，小熊，小狼，还有最最重要的那个人——可爱迷人的阿狸萨！他们四个正站在外面，朝我们招手。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_9ba68ee9:


    "奥利娅看到小猫头鹰的时候惊呆了，倒吸了一口凉气。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_5ab8fd51:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/16 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "你看，我就说有吧！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_15db6a80:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/178. Da.ogg"
    Ant "我知道。我从来没怀疑过你。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_b52b0021:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/17 K.ogg"
    Oly "他们是谁呀？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_438664f7:


    "她的语气听起来很害怕，但是又带了几分好奇。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_710e860f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/05Chob.ogg"
    Alis "外面天气这么好，只有最无聊的孩子才傻坐在家里！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_4549cb9c:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/06 U.ogg"
    Owl "我们还有好多游戏要玩呢，咕咕！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_0d2e6d3d:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/22 Dav.ogg"
    Bear "不过也别上来就全部玩一遍。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ed60f675:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/23 Po.ogg"
    Bear "我们玩一会歇一会。我爪子受伤了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_cc4a3f79:



    voice "voice/Wolf/317 Dr.ogg"
    Wolf "碰、砰、朋友！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ec4ca3d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/05Vihod.ogg"
    Animals "来呀，快出来跟我们一起玩，一起跳舞吧！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_3761556f:


    ""


translate chinese d4_beasts_0b1b6abd:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/18 A.ogg"
    Oly "他们知道怎么去梦幻岛吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e64091b2:


    "我看了看站在楼下的动物，觉得他们说不定真知道。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c1f62110:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/179. Mo.ogg"
    Ant "可能吧……？我们一起去问问就知道了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_1fa7fb3c:


    "动物朋友们的剪影就像是种承诺，只要跟他们待在一起，就能摆脱夜晚的悲伤、愤怒和恐惧。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_8fac9ee2:


    "我给奥利娅穿上了厚厚的衣服，保证她不会着凉。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_fcaa9b90:


    "妈妈正对着爸爸大吼大叫，就像{u}尼古拉·德罗兹多夫{/u}节目里的野兽一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_758afeb5:


    "我们溜过吵得震天响的厨房，打开门，走进了雪地里。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_89508a77:


    "阿狸萨跑到我跟前，紧紧抱着我，还用她冷冰冰的鼻子戳我的脖子。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_375b0991:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/55 Kak.ogg"
    Alis "我们等了好~~~久！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_cbb7c71a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/56 Poka.ogg"
    Alis "等你们两个蹲家里的小孩，等得我们都要老了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_3aa41bd2:


    "她抱我抱得更紧了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_8e13c15e:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/25 Okaz.ogg"
    Bear "原来等人这么累！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_01f81188:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/26 Fuh.ogg"
    Bear "唷！让我先喘口气再说。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_8b1dc4f1:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/06 Od.ogg"
    Owl "我有一次准备出去一段时间，咕咕，结果等我准备好的时候，我忘了自己要去哪了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_362ff3c7:


    "奥利娅用怀疑的目光盯着小猫头鹰。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_bc8a8f8c:


    "不过等小猫头鹰来了个完美的后空翻，稳稳当当落了地的那一刻，奥利娅还是咯咯地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_803dc86e:


    "其他动物好像接到了什么信号一样，忽然都不打趣了，一脸惊讶地看着奥利娅。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_239ffaec:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/04 Eto.ogg"
    Owl "这小姑娘不想跟我们做朋友！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_6873312f:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/20 M.ogg"
    Oly "我叫奥利娅。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_aaa07375:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/21 R.ogg"
    Oly "我……我以前……挺怕你的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_69b50d39:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/57 Teb.ogg"
    Alis "你以前很怕小猫头鹰？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_71254f44:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/27 Moz.ogg"
    Bear "她可能有恐猫头鹰症吧？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_a6109cce:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/05 A.ogg"
    Owl "你能治好自己这个毛病吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ad669580:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/58 Glavn.ogg"
    Alis "没事，只要她不是有恐玩症恐乐症就行。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_06166f74:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/59 Inach.ogg"
    Alis "不然就要让我们给吓死了，啊哈哈哈哈！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_cd49beaa:


    "我嘴角向上，跟着笑了起来。意识到这点后，我自己都吓了一跳。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_46eac13e:


    "我不久之前才在波琳娜家遇见了那些事情啊！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ae6290b7:


    "我不久之前才目睹了黑车库里的惨剧啊！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_62bf107d:


    "我每次碰到阿狸萨的时候，都感觉自己像在过河，哗啦啦的水声能盖住我所有消极的念头。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_3a30babc:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/22 Ka.ogg"
    Oly "你穿的真好看！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_53a09897:


    "阿狸萨放开了我，跑到奥利娅身边蹲了下来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_daf56785:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/60 Oo.ogg"
    Alis "哇，真可爱！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_5eefb190:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/61 Anto.ogg"
    Alis "你身边有个这么可爱的小东西，怎么一直藏到现在呀？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_d66dc5ae:


    "我瞥了一眼屋子，担心爸爸妈妈会看见我们，跑过来扫了我们的兴。他们向来喜欢做这种事。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_736d69df:


    "于是我抱住了妹妹，回答道："


translate chinese d4_beasts_8daf294a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/180.Da.ogg"
    Ant "我们走远一点再聊吧。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_605ec087:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/62 Zapr.ogg"
    Alis "没问题！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e8e78cf8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/63 Ol.ogg"
    Alis "哟，奥利娅，我们森林里就有位{u}严寒老人{/u}，你知道该怎么找到他吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_18b2a729:


    "奥利娅的眼睛瞪得大大的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_892d6ca4:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/23 K.ogg"
    Oly "怎么找？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_492495ad:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/64 Nu.ogg"
    Alis "哪有糖，你就往哪走。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_2be8123e:


    "阿狸萨弯下腰，从雪里抓出了颗糖。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_9a8b951e:


    "奥利娅惊讶地举起手去接糖。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_0b0b8933:


    "她先是向我投来了询问的目光，见我点了点头，"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c251c651:


    "她才剥开糖纸，扔进嘴里咀嚼起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_d1ea2144:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/10 Un.ogg"
    Owl "等等，森林里，咕咕，有严寒老人吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_41c48d8b:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/11 Po.ogg"
    Owl "你怎么，咕咕，没跟我提过？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_2928f633:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/65 ya.ogg"
    Alis "我说了，下午说的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_6fe04525:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/23 No.ogg"
    Owl "可是我白天都在睡觉。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_f6ae455f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/66 Aga.ogg"
    Alis "没错，我就是在你睡觉的时候说的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_f6789ae1:


    "他们聊起天来天真烂漫，我听着听着，就想起了罗姆卡。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_9a10adf9:


    "小狼出现前的几分钟里，他还在追我，边追边拼命地叫。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_38a49572:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/181. Chto.ogg"
    Ant "罗姆卡呢？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_4a996991:



    voice "voice/Wolf/319 Pov.ogg"
    Wolf "他美、没事，向、相信我！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_a599268c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/67 Ziv.ogg"
    Alis "你的罗姆卡好着呢。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e2c73089:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/68 Tol.ogg"
    Alis "不过他这种坏孩子，可是得不到严寒老人的礼物的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_1ec6dbdc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/69 mak.ogg"
    Alis "他最多也就能捞着一把煤灰。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_cc957c9a:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/48Nu.ogg"
    Bear "或者屁股开花。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_f89250af:


    "小熊挥舞着包了绷带的爪子，做出威胁的动作。他故意做出一副滑稽的样子，逗得其他动物哈哈大笑。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ff855682:


    "刚刚还盘踞在心里的焦虑，顷刻间就烟消云散，变得又遥远又陌生。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c40d2344:


    "阿狸萨飞快地跑开了，她红色的尾巴摇啊摇的，就像是火炬上的火。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ba4fdb03:


    "奥利娅想都没想就跟着阿狸萨往前跑。她弯腰从雪堆里又捡起一颗糖，哈哈大笑起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_8185603f:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/30 Vi.ogg"
    Bear "你太活泼了，弄得我反胃。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e32bd85e:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/26 Ati.ogg"
    Oly "你能不能别这么消极呀。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ed66e184:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/26 Lu.ogg"
    Oly "趁着严寒爷爷的礼物还没发完，跟我们一起跑过去找他吧。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_dffeea20:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/31 Ska.ogg"
    Bear "没门！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_4752a6a7:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/32 Skoree.ogg"
    Bear "除非天上掉下来八九斤的糖，不然我才不信狐狸的鬼话。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_994b4462:


    "结果天上真的下起了糖果雨，全落在了小熊头上。他不停地挠头，上下晃着脑袋，我看着看着忍不住笑了出来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ad5e3f00:


    "好吃的糖果在雪地里闪闪发亮。小熊打了个喷嚏，从耳朵里扯出了一颗“北方小熊”牌的糖。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_117ca0d7:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/34 Yab.ogg"
    Bear "我先打一个小时的盹，再来数数这里到底有多少颗糖。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_fd14cdf3:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/35Umen.ogg"
    Bear "我怀疑全加起来都没有两斤。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_2ad0cc1f:


    "阿狸萨站在森林的另一头，冲我们大喊道。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_3b2eb4e0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/70 Ne.ogg"
    Alis "那你可能要睡到下辈子了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_f5baba14:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/71 Dav.ogg"
    Alis "严寒爷爷在城堡里等我们都等烦了，动作快点！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_d0467c37:


    "我耸耸肩，跑了起来。这么一跑，我一直以来的恐惧，也散了不少。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_6a214df4:


    "有什么东西从我太阳穴旁边唰一下擦了过去，我觉得应该是雪球，可奥利娅马上就大喊了一句："


translate chinese d4_beasts_991ff062:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/29Z.ogg"
    Oly "是{u}泽菲尔{/u}糖！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_abae0784:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/182. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "别捡了，脏。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c97140b0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/72 Ti.ogg"
    Alis "啊？你真相信什么细菌？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ee81f823:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/184.  A.ogg"
    Ant "你不信吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_b21e5ca2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/73 Ra.ogg"
    Alis "以前信。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_24369c6e:


    "雪地两边全是松树，而且个顶个的粗壮，连成一排很是好看。它们挥舞着爪子，向我们问好。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_1971fd45:


    "雪花也跟上次一样，不是往下落，而是往上飘，飘进那无边无际的夜空。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_ff2050de:


    "地上的雪堆就跟融化的银子一样，闪闪发亮。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_00b0fe4e:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/30 Ka.ogg"
    Oly "真好看！我以前还觉得森林挺吓人的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e1135d56:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/01Nas.ogg"
    Alis "爸爸妈妈就爱讲故事吓唬我们，什么森林啊，雪啊，猫头鹰啊，反正就没一个不吓人的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_5dab2bff:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/02Nu.ogg"
    Alis "不过不用担心，那都是骗人的。月亮亮起来的时候，我们就跟她一起玩吧。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_6c00ba40:


    "奥利娅走着走着忽然跳进旁边的树丛，捡起几颗糖，然后又大笑着跑回小路上，继续往前走。我使尽浑身解数也跟不上她。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c822571e:


    "小猫头鹰从我们头顶飞过，稳稳落在树枝上，一边摇头一边咕咕叫。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_fb23c5ff:


    "小狼把头埋进雪里拱来拱去，用牙扯出来一堆的泡泡糖，连包装纸都没剥，就一股脑吞了下去。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_c9b0f154:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/32 U.ogg"
    Oly "你的肚肚会痛的！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_6610ed3d:


    "小狼吓了一跳，赶忙把糖球吐了出来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_5519c83d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/75 Vra.ogg"
    Alis "假的假的，都是假的！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e740c1ae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/76 Net.ogg"
    Alis "肚子痛都是骗人的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_e475c2b4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/76 Vs.ogg"
    Alis "只有大人才会吃进去细菌，才会肚子痛。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_fbd85b32:


    "阿狸萨停下了脚步，神气十足地拨开了层层叠叠的枝叶，就像拉开剧院的帷幕一样。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_1602a5aa:


    "树丛背后是一片空地，耸立着一座冰雪城堡。塔楼也好墙壁也好，都是用冰块和雪砌起来的，月光一照，闪闪发亮。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_b6dfd695:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/33 O.ogg"
    Oly "我不是在做梦吧？"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_6994304a:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/37 Ush.ogg"
    Bear "要不要我掐你一下？"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_e73085e0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/185. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "没必要。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_86e727a2:


    "我们正凝视着这座神奇的城堡，"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_15b3e364:


    "耳边忽然响起了细碎的铃声，听得人心都静了下来。与此同时，空气里还弥漫着一股巧克力和焦糖的气味。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_48e4a5d3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/78 Mi.ogg"
    Alis "欢迎光临寒舍！请进，快请进！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_8db649a8:


    "她其实用不着说两次请进。我们走进城堡，看见里面也是闪亮闪亮的，晃得人睁不开眼睛。于是我们转着圈，眯着眼睛四处张望。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_bf0e276b:


    "严寒老人就坐在闪闪发亮的宝座上。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_77bcdeff:


    "他头顶有两个帽尖，一边挂着一个绒球，晃来晃去的；脸上的大胡子白得像雪，底下藏着友善的微笑。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_6cde7907:


    "他长得又高又壮，胡子头发都很多，浑身散发着寒气，又有股暖意。我还相信妈妈讲的童话故事的时候，脑子里的严寒老人，就是他这个样子。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_8e451b1f:


    "他说话的声音又低沉又有磁性，就像庆典篝火的烟雾一样，把我整个裹了起来。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_84f7f9a7:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/68.A.ogg"
    Frost "安东，奥利！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_3af8592c:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/OH.ogg"
    Frost "小乖乖，你们大老远跑过来，都累坏了吧！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_2ebaafc3:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/34 Cho.ogg"
    Oly "没多远，我们一下就到了！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_c1fffc83:


    "奥利娅好像没把城堡的主人当成大人，一点也不拘谨，声音也放得很大，就像在跟同龄人聊天一样。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_5aac4ce4:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/69.Z.ogg"
    Frost "我都知道！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_cd45da57:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/70.Mne.ogg"
    Frost "我有不少朋友，他们知道什么都会告诉我……"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_8cd167df:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/71.Kto.ogg"
    Frost "你要是勤奋了一整年，我就会给你送礼物。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_abf77102:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/73.A.ogg"
    Frost ""


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_353d04b1:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/75.Len.ogg"
    Frost "我的糖可不给这样的孩子吃。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_e012ce6c:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/35 A.ogg"
    Oly "我一点也不懒！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_83cf0c0c:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/76.Eo.ogg"
    Frost "我知道。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_fc254435:


    "他打量了我们好一会。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_1eaf3347:


    "可他真正的脸还藏在严寒老人的面具后面。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_ab69f723:


    "我站在原地一动不动，就这么盯着他。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_a4968ca0:


    "森林里打扮成动物的孩子没吓到我，飞向月亮的幻想也没吓到我，但是亲眼看见严寒老人坐在冰雪城堡里，吓得我说不出话来。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_38fdbdf6:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/77.Est.ogg"
    Frost "我给你们准备了礼物。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_a7d83461:


    "他硕大的手掌里攥着个麻袋，风一吹，可可粉，{u}哈尔瓦{/u}和橘子的香味扑鼻而来。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_b44c206b:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/186. Spa.ogg"
    Ant "谢谢，不过我们路上已经吃过糖了。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_1667d9cf:


    "严寒老人紧盯着我。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_d2c4ce21:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/78.Raz.ogg"
    Frost "吼吼吼！你管那叫糖？那有什么了不起的。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_5cd5b1c3:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/79.Vot.ogg"
    Frost "我的糖可厉害了，是梦幻岛的糖，吼吼！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_5a59b04a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/36 Ez.ogg"
    Oly "梦幻岛？！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_32544e26:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/80.Sra.ogg"
    Frost "你们都有资格拿我的糖，我也想直接送给你们。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_22c37a39:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/81.No.ogg"
    Frost "不过，规矩就是规矩。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_551e0fcd:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/82.Nad.ogg"
    Frost "我这有三个谜语，你要是全答对了，糖就是你的了。想不想试试？"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_b932e836:


    "我干裂的嘴唇都还没来得及张开，奥利娅就叫了起来。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_972c4901:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/37 Da.ogg"
    Oly "想！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_d1ff0ad1:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/83.To.ogg"
    Frost "听好了，第一个谜语是这样的……"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_8132fbc4:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/84.Vn.ogg"
    Frost "一个大房子，里面住着汽车和各式各样的轮胎。请问，是什么地方？"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_7739df92:


    "我环顾四周，看了看那几个戴着面具的孩子。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_b436b27e:


    "他们站在角落里一动不动，但身后的影子却在墙上跳着舞。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_3494720e:


    "我听到了一阵低沉的嗡嗡声，有点纳闷这是什么动静。不过转念一想，估计是他们肚子在叫。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_79b38e74:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/38 G.ogg"
    Oly "车库！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_0d2f076b:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/85.Ver.ogg"
    Frost "答对了！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_0b9a72e7:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/85.Tep.ogg"
    Frost "接下来是第二个谜语。安东，你也来回答一下吧。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_177e22ac:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/85.Ves.ogg"
    Frost "那生物在阴影里一待就是一整天，不管是黑夜还是白天。摆弄碗碟哗啦啦，对着同伴凶煞煞。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_1212c1f7:


    "我疑惑地挑了挑眉。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_19c6d4f3:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/187. Ma.ogg"
    Ant "妈妈？"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_07a3503c:


    "奥利娅举起了手。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_5b9624b3:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/39M.ogg"
    Oly "我！我能回答吗？！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_9bf2a448:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/40 Eto.ogg"
    Oly "是猫咪！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_589e2b51:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/87.Verno.ogg"
    Frost "答对了！吼吼吼，还剩最后一个谜语了……你要是能答对，礼物就归你了！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_4da636f1:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/88.Тol.ogg"
    Frost "诶呀，真倒霉……"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_7f3253fe:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/89.Zapa.ogg"
    Frost "我想不起来最后一个谜语了。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_7c6c2e2f:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/90.Moz.ogg"
    Frost "说不定，我们可以请动物朋友来帮个忙？"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_bd2c187b:


    "打扮成动物的孩子把我们团团围住，边笑边跺脚，忽然跳起疯狂的圆舞来。我想起了那个晚上，那个改变了我一生的夜晚——那时候，远处的影子跳的也是这样的舞。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_61c24f43:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/04Ded.ogg"
    Animals "严寒老人座上宾，老人见了笑脸迎。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_60612709:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/04Netomy.ogg"
    Animals "等得太久很无奈，快快打开旧……"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_b5c9c21d:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/41 M.ogg"
    Oly "麻袋！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_1d060bb8:


    "严寒老人满意地笑了起来。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_886e66f9:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/91.Ub.ogg"
    Frost "好吧，你们通过了考验！来，你们的礼物！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_4635e5d8:


    "他抖了抖红色的麻袋，抖出来一大堆糖，其中有不少糖我还是头一次见，都是广告里没有的。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_d309a71f:


    "各种颜色和形状的泡泡糖满天飞，包在里面的衬纸也露了出来，糖香味直冲鼻腔。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_6b361560:


    "拳头大小的棒棒糖，跟奥利娅脑袋一样大的橘子，"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_7665e7fb:


    "“士力架”，“玛氏”和“邦蒂”的巧克力棒，还有“健达奇趣蛋”也跟着掉了下来，全是我们好久没吃过的零食。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_b262b4ea:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/42 Oi.ogg"
    Oly "哇，谢谢！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_94780613:


    "我让内心的声音给说服了，抛开了所有疑虑，用衣袖擦了擦眼泪。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_3d92ef02:


    "这里是真正的梦幻岛……没有霸凌，也没有忌讳。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_4f4bd7eb:


    "我和奥利娅的心愿实现了。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_76ef1714:


    "我们终于可以过上幸福快乐的生活了。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_526a9959:


    "严寒老人站起身来，撒下大把大把的糖。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_100e3433:


    "站在他身边的动物孩子也举起了爪子。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_e69f1563:


    "他们眼睛都亮了，比宝石还要亮，小狼更是激动得流了一地的口水。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_13f18634:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/92.Da.ogg"
    Frost "开动吧，孩子们！"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_469db1f3:


    "动物孩子全冲过了过来，猛地抓起糖，一颗接一颗地往嘴里塞。他们你推我我推你，互相咆哮，脸上也蒙了一层阴影。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_fc8c3b8f:


    "奥利娅捡起手边的糖，剥开了糖纸。"


translate chinese d4_palace_dev_9f556e45:


    "我看着她的动作，内心忽然摇摆不定。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_16cd2758:


    "我紧紧抓住奥利娅的手腕，她尖叫了一声，可能是吓的，也可能是让我弄疼了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_5d7973be:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/188. Ne.ogg"
    Ant "别吃。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_0861aedf:


    "大厅里弥漫着低语，大家都在谨慎地议论着什么。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_f7aa3fcd:


    "他们说话的时候，面具上的耳朵跟着动来动去的，影子也跟着飘来飘去。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_23f49535:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/13 Chto.ogg"
    Owl "怎么了？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_42c78e1d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/80 Niche.ogg"
    Alis "没事！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_9f3050f7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/81 Prosto.ogg"
    Alis "就是托沙相信吃多了糖会得糖尿病。可哪有什么糖尿病啊！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_5475bff9:



    voice "voice/Wolf/325 Ro.ogg"
    Wolf "八、拔、爸爸妈妈、骗你们的！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e0e46c4e:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/41Raz.ogg"
    Bear "我睡了，等他们不犯傻了再叫醒我。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_09ffec4a:


    "严寒老人朝我弯下了腰。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_81707acc:


    "他身上有股焦糖的香气，还有一丁点潮湿的气味。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1fdc838e:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/93.Dav.ogg"
    Frost "难得有这么好的机会！就别说扫兴的话了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c88a31f2:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/94.Se.ogg"
    Frost "今天就玩个痛快吧！吃吧！跳吧！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_124e4976:


    "奥利娅想甩开我的手，可我就是死死抓着她不放。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6435fb94:


    "我看了看那堆糖，又看了看面前高大的老头。他身上有股恶臭，只是用糖香味盖住了。我很难说得出到底是什么臭味，只能集中注意力去闻，去品味。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c271353c:


    "那是肉烂掉的腥臭……是野兽身上才有的恶臭。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6fce4674:


    "我觉得自己一下就清醒了。某种强烈的幻觉褪去之后，恐惧、疲惫和寒冷又回来了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_dec212e6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/189. Spa.ogg"
    Ant "谢谢，不过我们肚子不饿。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_c867455f:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/190Emi.ogg"
    Ant "还有，呃……我们该走了。爸爸妈妈可能已经担心死了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_00fe4461:


    "我拖着妹妹往门口走，可阿狸萨忽然挡住了去路。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_6e44fe19:


    "她手里有个瓷盘。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_9360c70a:


    "有那么一瞬间，我以为盘子上爬满了恶心的蛆虫。可我定睛一看，盘子上只有毛毛虫软糖，没有什么卷成球的虫子。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_52add1bd:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/82 Pro.ogg"
    Alis "安东，你别这样。我们是朋友对吧？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_64a7ec8f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/83 Me.ogg"
    Alis "不对，不仅仅是朋友。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_48001039:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/84 Vs.ogg"
    Alis "你还记得我跟你说的话吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_1168c6fe:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/85 Ni.ogg"
    Alis "只要有我在，谁都伤害不了你。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_ec8ea7b9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/86 Nite.ogg"
    Alis "还有奥利娅。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_90bf5e82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/87 Tak.ogg"
    Alis "求你了，相信我吧。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_553cb373:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/88  S.ogg"
    Alis "就吃一颗吧，好吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_b0fca83a:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/44 An.ogg"
    Oly "放手！安东！放手！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_cc9a7989:


    voice "voice/olya/4day/45 T.ogg"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_af5a51b1:


    Oly "你就跟妈妈一样，什么都不让我干！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_d5cf7410:


    "奥利娅歇斯底里地抽动着，想挣脱我的手。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_2a17ef02:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/190Eto.ogg"
    Ant "不对……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_509ddf27:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/191 V.ogg"
    Ant "这地方不对劲。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_e4227c9e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/89 Vot.ogg"
    Alis "是吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_b6c71aa2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/90 At.ogg"
    Alis "你有没有想过，不对劲的可能不是我们，是你的感知？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_38874dbe:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/91 Kak.ogg"
    Alis "你有没有想过，你每天吃下去的药会对你产生什么影响？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_refuse_df4bed80:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/92 Oni.ogg"
    Alis "那些药会扭曲现实，会扰乱你的思绪，会让你找不到落满雪的小路。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_42b2c7c1:


    "我怀疑地看着阿狸萨，想说点什么来反驳她……"


translate chinese dmenu_1_69587d6b:


    "可我想破了头也想不出来。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_c744cd2e:


    "我想起了沃瓦带血的手套。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_1d0a2b44:


    "不过那只是幻觉而已。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_46df7aeb:


    "我想起了谢苗的几根断指，就装在个小塑料袋里。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_1d0a2b44_1:


    "不过那只是幻觉而已。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_86ddc5fa:


    "我想起了沃瓦带血的手套，还有谢苗的几根断指，就装在个小塑料袋里。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_9da3bb8c:


    "这些全都是幻觉。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_17af32f0:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/191. Kto.ogg"
    Ant "你、你是谁？"


translate chinese dmenu_1_daf5eedc:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/96.Ana.ogg"
    Frost "你觉得我们像什么？"


translate chinese dmenu_1_8d39a2d4:


    ""


translate chinese dmenu_1_af4905bc:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/97.Sname.ogg"
    Frost "只要跟我们待在一起，谁都不会惩罚你，也不会把你锁在房间里，你想做什么就做什么。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_a94d9441:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/98.Ot.ogg"
    Frost "从现在起，没人能逼你做你不想做的事。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_2e241738:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/otkuda.ogg"
    Ant "你怎么知道我们不想干嘛？"


translate chinese dmenu_1_6104c4c6:


    "小狼正大声咀嚼着糖果，严寒老人摸了摸他的后脑勺。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_a44fea29:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/99.Ya.ogg"
    Frost "我当然知道。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_3dfd0733:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/100.Mne.ogg"
    Frost "不管是寒风还是影子，不管是寒冷的星星，还是无边无际的夜空，它们总是在我耳边说着你们的事。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_a35ce320:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/102.On.ogg"
    Frost "它们告诉我，孩子不想长大，"


translate chinese dmenu_1_146e2dd3:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/103.Pre.ogg"
    Frost "不想生活在充满威胁、忌讳和惩罚的世界里。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_a3566ee7:


    "他每说完一个字，声音就大了一点。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_f741df14:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/104.Oz.ogg"
    Frost "成年人活着就是为了变老，然后老死。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_faf04f5d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/105.De.ogg"
    Frost "但孩子是靠梦想活着的。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_55cacc8a:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/106.O.ogg"
    Frost "喔，孩子有多向往无忧无虑的生活，我比谁都清楚。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_1ede2e4b:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/107.Toi.ogg"
    Frost "他们想要奇迹，想要无拘无束地活着。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_a617c634:


    "他的声音像雷鸣一样响亮，吓得我头发都立起来了。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_99fafc3d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/108.Sto.ogg"
    Frost "这些全都是你的。只要许愿就好。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_93c86371:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/110.S.ogg"
    Frost "只要开口就好。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_59da6d7d:


    "他压低了声音，小声说道。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_b1397791:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/111.St.ogg"
    Frost "只要接受就好。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_cbdf6955:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/47 So.ogg"
    Oly "接受……"


translate chinese dmenu_1_e3244562:


    "奥利娅就像着了魔似的，重复了一遍“接受”，仿佛老人话语的回音。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_053a3bd9:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/112.Da.ogg"
    Frost "没错，乖孩子。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_1139145d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/113.Vk.ogg"
    Frost "吃吧，享受这场盛宴吧！"


translate chinese dmenu_1_e3041117:


    "严寒老人指了指面前的狐狸女孩。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_1cf6ee97:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/93 ya.ogg"
    Alis "算我求你了……就当是为了我们大家……就当是为了我，为了你妹妹……"


translate chinese dmenu_1_549bd4a5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/94 Zai.ogg"
    Alis "你就尝一口吧，兔子。求你了。"


translate chinese dmenu_1_57e9bc3a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/95 E.ogg"
    Alis "你只要尝一口，就什么都明白了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ce438f89:


    "话音刚落，我感觉她面具上的窟窿在往外冒寒气。不仅仅是她，其他的动物，还有高大的老人也一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fd9558e1:


    "猫头鹰的脸紧张地抽了一下。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_85148a9d:


    "狼流了一地的口水。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_24754e1e:


    "熊来回倒换着脚，脸上的睡意一下子就不见了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b525ce9d:


    "我们背后的不是严寒老人。那东西只是戴着严寒老人的面具，他从头到尾都在骗我们。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f44e26fc:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/192. Yaska.ogg"
    Ant "我说，我们要走了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c87fa6d8:


    "我抓奥利娅抓得更紧了，她稍一松手，糖哗啦啦掉了一地。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_1fac5dde:


    "奥利娅吓坏了，连忙环顾四周。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_962fbd05:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/YaSkazal.ogg"
    Alis "我说，我们要走了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_78822135:


    "阿狸萨只是学着我的样子又说了一遍，但我很生气。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_55bc746e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/96 oh.ogg"
    Alis "天呐，你怎么……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_11fd4757:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/96 Du.ogg"
    Alis "……这么傻呢？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_0616de1d:


    "那阵笛声又响了起来。可我现在再听到，只觉得痛苦，就好像挨了几下鞭子，又好像变成了一条鱼，让人啪一下扔到冰面上，只能无助地抽搐。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c5358f32:


    "笛声阴魂不散，一直往我耳朵里冲。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_02820830:


    "水晶城堡里充满了孩子的哭声，随后又渐渐变成了野兽的嚎叫，还夹杂着碾碎骨头的嘎吱声，以及撕开皮肉的声音。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f231ce12:


    "阿狸萨手里的瓷盘盛满了蛆虫，啪一下摔成了碎片，"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_bce776aa:


    "她身上皮大衣的接缝也裂开了，冒出一团恶臭的烟雾。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_aee3844a:


    "她一脸狰狞，朝我露出尖利的牙齿，恶臭再次袭击了我的鼻腔。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_54d659fe:


    "狐狸女孩咆哮尖叫，血泪顺着脸颊流下，滴在身上，弄得皮毛都黏在了一起。她的尾巴已经秃了，露出了骨头，一下下地抽打着墙壁。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_a59f651a:


    "妹妹哭个不停，我赶忙把她护在身后，结果一脚踩在了糖堆上。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_bef2ec97:


    "恐惧钻进我的肚子里，流过肠子，一路涌到喉咙。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ebf6be37:


    "我恨不得立马摘下眼镜，再也看不见任何东西；恨不得把眼珠子都挤出来，彻底失明。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_be1c6b2a:


    "我转头看了看小猫头鹰，立马就恶心得整张脸都扭曲了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_189bfd7c:


    "猫头鹰面具的羽毛里冒出了很多蛆虫，疯狂地扭动着身子。面具上的喙也腐烂了，就像让人拿园艺剪掉的一样，咔嚓一声掉到了地上。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_df6e86d7:


    "我跌跌撞撞地后退了几步，差点撞到小狼。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_241f171c:


    "可小狼也变了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b4d9f208:


    "他全身的骨头都在嘎嘎响，整张脸鼓了起来，牙齿则像碎玻璃一样，戳破溃烂的牙龈往外凸，肿胀不堪的舌头还在那来回舔弄着。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c5e51060:


    "小熊出现在了我的视野边缘，正好挡住了我们的去路。他身上每一寸都在往外渗红色的脓水，但眼窝里除了脓水，还有很多虫子，多到把窟窿都给堵上了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_55abac6d:


    "奥利娅吓坏了。我把她拉到身边，惊恐地盯着城堡大门。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_3213d126:


    "不过地上哪还有什么糖。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fb3f6838:


    "只有一具具的人类尸体。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_484a684b:


    "尸体的下颚撕裂开来，肋骨上还沾着点碎肉，"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_4af5c2b0:


    "骨盆上爬满了青苔，牙齿串成了一串项链。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_9cbbef12:


    "鲜血在脚下汇成了汪洋，漂着几块小小的头盖骨和头皮。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_1b099c1f:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/114.Esh.ogg"
    Noname "吃！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_8510d9be:


    "我面前耸立着一个长角的怪物，它长长的爪子抓着支骨笛。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_45302f53:


    "巨大的山羊褪去了和善老人的伪装，现出了真身。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_98bc1a52:


    "他通体乌黑，散发着敌意和恶意，眼眶里仿佛有堆烧得滚烫的煤，看我一眼就把我烧焦了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b70dc29e:


    "他实在是太高了，头上的角都刮到了城堡的天花板。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_3f42e7e8:


    "城堡的冰墙渐渐开裂、融化，化成水滴在地上，形成了泥泞的小水塘，露出了隐藏在底下的金属墙。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_97ad0eea:


    "这是个狭窄的地牢，周围全是嚎叫的野兽。我意识到我们出不去了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_e1741870:


    "我只能紧紧抱着妹妹，看着包围圈越缩越小，等着丑陋的爪子划破血雾，朝我们伸过来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_665517fa:



    voice "voice/Wolf/327 Poz.ogg"
    Wolf "让我把他们四、撕成碎片吧，主人！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_d369c89e:



    voice "voice/Wolf/328 Ya.ogg"
    Wolf "我要挖、嗷、挖出他们的眼球，挖、嗷、挖烂他们还在流血的伤口！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c69e8c93:



    voice "voice/Wolf/329 Y.ogg"
    Wolf "我……我……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f50465c0:


    "狼朝我们咆哮着。他那张血盆大口就像是捕熊夹似的，啪一下合上了，差点溅了我们一脸唾沫。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_1bd8c6a4:


    "不过他话还没说完，浑身腐烂的熊就把他推开了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_52a78413:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/45 Dudki.ogg"
    Bear "没门！该轮到我找乐子了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_19696ed1:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/46 Kak.ogg"
    Bear "我听他们说口水话听得耳朵都起茧子了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ab6fd684:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/47 YaZiv.ogg"
    Bear "我要当着这小淘气鬼哥哥的面，活活撕了她的皮！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_b720ed44:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/48 Ya.ogg"
    Bear "我要让他吃自己妹妹的肉！让他肚子里装满妹妹的内脏！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_5795d50f:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/49 Po.ogg"
    Bear "拜托了，主人……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_aaa1e26a:


    "他咧开嘴笑着，整张脸像是蛋壳一样，好像马上就要裂开了，马上就要露出什么更加邪恶、肮脏和可怕的东西来……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_8b388ac1:


    "就在这时，扭曲的猫头鹰用爪子抓住了他，不让他靠近我们。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_ebf7ba0a:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Ona.ogg"
    Owl "她是我的！我的！你这渣滓！！！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_5ba69117:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Lapi.ogg"
    Owl "不准碰那姑娘！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fc53d2d8:


    "几只动物边吵边扭打在一起，像团毛茸茸的球，在内脏和融化的脂肪堆里滚来滚去。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_6741ebcc:


    "他们相互嚎叫，相互撕扯，随时准备把对方撕成两半，活像是一群抢剩饭的狗。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_3ea19181:


    "笛声忽然响起，他们几个立马分开了，就像让主人拽住了牵狗绳一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_7eb5656f:


    "山羊就是这群野兽的主人。他的笛声足以撕碎灵魂，野兽一听就跟中了咒似的，变成了沉默而又忠诚的傀儡，一动不敢动，静候他的指示。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_bda71c81:


    "山羊放下了胫骨笛。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_241d583c:


    "那恶魔般的旋律，那仿佛无数孩子在压路机下发出的悲鸣，最后一次归于了沉寂。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_95821f91:


    "一块人肉啪一下落在了我颤抖的脚边。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_7612253d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/115.EshEli.ogg"
    Master "吃掉它。不然我们就吃掉你。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_52cd3889:


    "恐惧吞噬了我。我转头看了看奥利娅，她正躺在路边，身上盖了一层粉色的雪。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_31f5f9ae:


    "就像动画片里的睡美人一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_f403aa40:


    "眼前这副景象太恐怖了，她可能是吓晕过去了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_fa524e37:


    "我想嚎啕大哭，想发疯，想立马去死，要快，而且不会痛苦……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_c2a5f507:


    "但我什么也做不了，只能待在这座拷问室里。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice2_refuse_069871b1:


    "我面前只有两条路：要么吃人肉，要么惨死在野兽的肚子里。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a997034c:


    "那群长了毛的绞肉机贪婪地盯着我们，一个个的眼神都饥饿到了极点。我要是敢拒绝他们的主人，他们就会一拥而上，咬碎我的骨头，再全部吞进肚里。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_413ed66e:


    "但我要是答应了，我肯定会变成他们这样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_3311f8fd:


    "我会失去自由意志，变成怎么吃也吃不饱的怪物，跟着嗜血疯子吹奏的旋律跳舞。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_01045f27:


    "我肯定会害死奥利娅，还有其他对我来说很重要的人……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_bd7d872b:


    "我的嘴唇不住地颤抖，恶心的感觉爬了上来，引得胃里一阵翻江倒海。但我不知道从哪来了一股劲，大声喊道："


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f131fd89:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/193. Niko.ogg"
    Ant "我不吃！我是人！我这辈子都不会吃人肉的！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f2bd10e5:


    "这几句话可以当做我的墓志铭了。不过我知道，我的遗体永远也不会被人找到。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9837c682:


    "周围一片死寂。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_e017039d:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/116.Este.ogg"
    Master "吃了他们！灭了他们！撕了他们！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_783a2c62:


    "长角的影子吞噬了我们。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c77abe06:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/119.Sl.ogg"
    Master "肉啊！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_45c71d44:


    "阿狸萨忽然冲了过来，拦住了山羊。她跟那只身形高大的怪物一比，简直小得可笑。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a65d984c:


    "跳蚤在她背上跳来跳去。她的骨头都露了出来，尾巴破破烂烂的，垂在身后拖来拖去，划出来一条血痕。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a0fb8e77:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/98 podo.ogg"
    Alis "等等！别急着吃。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_03b90b2a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/99 Zai.ogg"
    Alis "兔子还有用，他会给我们带肉来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5b77d29e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/101 Dlya.ogg"
    Alis "为了狐狸为了熊……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_11cb0e52:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/120.Za.ogg"
    Master "小兔子带肉来润喉。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_d915096d:


    "山羊眼睛里的火焰不再跳动。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7c205de3:


    "可他手下的傀儡仍旧怒不可遏，朝着我们龇牙。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_0611b9f8:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/51 Da.ogg"
    Bear "你说他是兔子？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_b9c59f44:



    voice "voice/Wolf/332 Raz.ogg"
    Wolf "四、撕了他，吃、吃了他！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_97a893bf:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Samozv.ogg"
    Owl "骗子！咕咕！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_ec867ba6:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Kozan.ogg"
    Owl "塞满肠子的臭皮囊。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5bd4cea2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/102 Zat.ogg"
    Alis "一群小丑，住口！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_df7ade10:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/103 Razv.ogg"
    Alis "你们没感觉到吗？嗯？还是都忘干净了？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_34952e2a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/104 Kogda.ogg"
    Alis "那天在那片雪地里，他差点就啃到月亮了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1cc67b9a:


    "吃人肉的家伙们都不说话了，失望地把口水咽了回去。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f334c70a:


    "与此同时，阿狸萨忽然来了个一百八十度大转弯……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_990b8d86:


    "她又变回了原来的样子，变回了那个戴着狐狸面具的可爱女孩，变回了我在一月的早晨，第一次见到的那个阿狸萨。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_65663d5d:


    "阿狸萨走到我跟前，用身上那股混着橘子、烟火和魔法的气味，驱散了包裹着我们的恐惧。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_e1922f08:


    "她用软乎乎的爪子摸了摸我的脸颊，捋开我额头上黏成一撮的头发。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9d88dd15:


    "阿狸萨抱着我，用温柔好听的声音轻轻说道："


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_8b3e23e4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/105 Tosha.ogg"
    Alis "托沙，你想不想救自己？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_3f7b8045:


    "我咬紧牙关，一言不发，甚至都不敢移开目光，生怕这转瞬即逝的幻觉会跟着破灭。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a86dcc2d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/106 Moi.ogg"
    Alis "亲爱的，告诉我，你想不想救你妹妹？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a061ae89:


    "我的眼泪止不住地流。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_13b314a7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/195. Da.ogg"
    Ant "想、想……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_abbbf4c8:


    "我抓住狐狸女孩的长外套下摆，颤抖着，抽泣着。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f61a8d75:



    voice "voice/Alisa/4day/107 Ska.ogg"
    Alis "大点声，让大家都听听。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_eafcb284:


    "我泪流满面，悲痛欲绝地大叫了起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cbe37d72:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/196.Daa.ogg"
    Ant "想！！！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_f4ee5986:


    "下一秒，我的嘴里就充斥着一股血腥味。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_30472b40:


    "狐狸一刻不停地往我嘴里塞着人肉。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_50d4e61a:


    "我跪倒在地，咳来咳去也只能咳出来血，就是吐不出人肉。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cd201783:


    "腐烂的野兽又围了上来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_62ee8d41:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Kakoe.ogg"
    Owl "开什么玩笑。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_abd8aa04:



    voice "voice/Owl/4day/Pozvol.ogg"
    Owl "主人，让我咬这女孩一口吧！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_01244402:


    "沸腾的怒火吞噬了我的心智。我的内心深处，爆发出了某种陌生而又原始的东西。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5a094a72:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/198. Tolko.ogg"
    Bunny ""


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_25aae670:


    "狐狸咯咯地笑了起来。邪恶的猫头鹰吓了一跳，赶忙跳开了。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c5a73fda:


    "我刚骂完就发不出声了，接着就弯下腰吐了起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_5bd19a19:


    "我吐出来一大滩东西，其中就有我刚刚呕了半天呕不出来的“糖果”。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cbe7e2da:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/122.Ti.ogg"
    Master "没错，兔子……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_2b091a86:


    voice "voice/kozel/4day/124.Dih2.ogg"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1ec87298:


    "他伸手指了指我，我感觉像有把刀深深插进了我的心口。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_12a95d62:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/123.Tv.ogg"
    Master ""


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_4b63b882:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/Dob.ogg"
    Master "明晚之前，给我们弄点肉来……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_c0585745:



    voice "voice/Wolf/342 Inche.ogg"
    Wolf "要不然……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_eea69925:



    voice "voice/Bear/4day/59 Enache.ogg"
    Bear "要不然……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_0e566ede:


    "阿狸萨默默走进了阴影里。山羊张开了臭气熏天的大口，凑到我面前，咆哮道："


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_6985d7b0:



    voice "voice/kozel/4day/125.ME.ogg"
    Master "要不然……我们就吃了你全家。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_15b5cb8c:


    "说完，他咚地跺了一下羊蹄。我什么都不管了，没命地跑。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_64493087:


    "他们在我背后喊道：“活活吃了你全家！”"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9ec5d5cf:


    "冰块掉在了我肩膀上，里面还冻着什么啮齿类动物的尸体。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_ab816d48:


    "我努力了半天终于逃了出来。松树在风中晃着枝丫，树上的雪纷纷落在地上，就像厨师在给粥撒盐一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_aff4a46b:


    "风撕扯着我的头发。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_412dadaa:


    "我转过身想再看一眼，结果愣在了原地。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_fcde6f34:


    "车库竟然在我眼前消失了！它不是一下消失的，是慢慢变透明，最后变得像幽灵一样。寒风袭来，吹走了黑色墙壁的幻影。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1ee64e2d:


    "到这个时候我才忽然想起来，我刚刚只顾着自己跑，把妹妹扔在怪物的巢穴里了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_aa93c097:


    "原本是城堡的地方，只剩下了一大堆雪。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_ea144750:


    "雪堆里伸出来只女孩的手腕，就像坟头的十字架一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_d9b08cc9:


    "我吓坏了，冲到雪堆面前就不要命地挖。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_cb5bb596:


    "奥利娅苍白的小脸，还有半边肩膀都让我挖了出来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_8ea511d4:


    "她冻得铁青的嘴唇抖个不停。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7e8f590e:


    "她还活着！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_1c884de6:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/200. Ya.ogg"
    Ant "撑住！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_a88bafa3:


    "我忽然想起我跟卡嘉也说过这句话，只觉得喉咙发干。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_dcb95226:


    "我手也没停，边挖边祈祷她没事。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9d725fa4:


    "奥利娅的肚子很快也露了出来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7780ba78:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/69Hol.ogg"
    Oly "我好冷……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_b875e0ff:


    "她声音微弱。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_9bb50de1:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/201. Niche.ogg"
    Ant "没事的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_6e666fe7:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/201. Otn.ogg"
    Ant "我一会儿就带你回家，给你倒点热可可，你喝了就暖和起来了，就没事了。你千万别睡过去，听到了吗？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_18e3b99a:



    voice "voice/anton/4day/202. Tito.ogg"
    Ant "别……"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_48b6b4e6:


    "我摸到了什么东西。黏黏的，温温的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_6430601d:


    "我赶紧又扒拉了几下，雪变得又红又黏糊。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_47984faa:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/50 Cho.ogg"
    Oly "怎么了？那是什么？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_71e470a7:


    "我倒吸了一口凉气。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_7b2f9d83:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/51Poch.ogg"
    Oly "你怎么不说话？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_4d57b057:


    "我该怎么跟她说？"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_11b3ed5d:


    "奥利娅的下半身没了。伤口下面吊着一圈圈肠子。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_fa17375e:


    "奥利娅歪着头，看了看那可怕的伤口和碎肉，然后尖叫了起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice3_refuse_078c17ed:


    "叫声震耳欲聋。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_66d4ecfe:


    "地上堆了好多糖。我从里面抓了几颗看起来最好吃的，剥开糖纸尝了一口。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_865a71a9:


