translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_53bc90e1:


    Narr_color "牛奶巧克力在我嘴里融化。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_54f9f06d:


    Narr_color "妹妹脸上沾了巧克力酱，我刚想说她，"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_55c6ea22:


    Narr_color "话却卡在了嗓子眼里。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_0103e7e7:


    Narr_color "一棵巨大的云杉树朝着群星飞去，消失在了外太空的某个地方，成了月球头顶的王冠。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_6ada7549:


    Narr_color "云杉树高大雄伟，枝叶好似长满硬毛的爪子。树枝上挂着大个大个的装饰彩球，还有一圈圈的七色彩灯，全都一闪一闪的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_22f3c2c1:


    Narr_color "城堡的天花板不见了，无数星座在夜空中铺展开来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a8a2c098:


    Narr_color "这里充满了音乐、欢笑、糖果，还有植物的气味！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_06bfd58f:


    Narr_color "小熊、小狼还有小猫头鹰，都在我们身边跳起舞来！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_ee73c3fd:


    Narr_color "雪花又跟上次一样，纷纷往天上飘。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_16ce1472:


    Narr_color "我大笑起来，摸了摸捆得密匝匝的金彩带。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_2d285326:


    Narr_color "不是做梦！这都是真的！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_19456adc:


    Narr_color "阿狸萨像演戏一样，夸张地鞠了一躬。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_5d59eb1f:


    Narr_color "圣诞树上的装饰彩球一闪一闪的，我的灵魂也跟着一闪一闪的。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4a06f805:


    Narr_color "我同时变成了神奇的冬日森林，柔软的常绿植物，还有漫天的星座。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_10e8c83f:


    Narr_color "这里一直都是我的家。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8f2e04c3:


    Narr_color "雪在闪光，差点闪瞎我的眼睛。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8bd57f33:


    Narr_color "奥利娅两只手都抓了一大把糖，转着圈跳舞。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_c550b507:


    Narr_color "小狼拿了几个健达奇趣蛋在手里，杂耍似的抛来抛去。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_d6ff85ac:


    Narr_color "游戏主机，掌机，玩偶，还有战神金刚小人……云杉树底下堆了一堆的礼物，就像用大卡车拉来的一样。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_1b531a90:


    Narr_color "我发觉自己也在跳舞，于是边跳边回答道："


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_4774a691:



    voice "voice/olya/4day/58 Nu.ogg"
    Olya_Color "嗯……分给人好的！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_293eefa7:


    Narr_color "森林的边缘站着一群孩子，正直直地盯着我们，像是看入了迷。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_74749d13:


    Narr_color "我跳着穿过林间空地，一路溜到他们旁边。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_61db897b:


    Narr_color "孩子们手牵着手跟在我后面，走到了那堆礼物跟前。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_40131396:


    Narr_color "带着别人踏上实现梦想的道路，这种感觉实在是太好了！"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_49461f10:


    Narr_color "圣诞派对终于迎来了高潮。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_3aeb1411:


    Narr_color "节日就像漂亮的苹果，里面总是藏着一只淘气的小虫子，这只虫子名叫“稍纵即逝”。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_7f47709e:


    Narr_color "然而这里不一样。在云杉树的爪子底下，节日永远不会结束。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_8c6d6639:


    Narr_color "夜空中绽放着绚丽的烟火，照亮了地上跳舞的人影。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_aacfb3c7:


    Narr_color "我眼眶湿湿的，肌肉鼓了起来。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_129c97d0:


    Narr_color "我仰头看着月亮，再也抑制不住内心的感情，扯开嗓子大叫。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_483db378:


    Narr_color "我朝着星星跳去，来了个空翻。"


translate chinese d4_beasts_choice_take_devend_a712df1a:


    Narr_color "整个梦幻岛都能听见我的声音。"


translate chinese d4_wake_up_devend_1b97b0a3:


    "恐惧就快把我逼疯了。我想都没想，径直冲进了这座离我最近的建筑。只有这能躲了！"


